3 API helpers, item 6\" },\n23\t    { \"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"GET /api/health returns 200 { data: { status: 'ok', db: 'ok', time } } when SELECT 1 succeeds within 2000ms, else 503 with db: 'error'.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 Health endpoint\" },\n24\t    { \"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"Install @mui/material, @emotion/react, @emotion/styled, @mui/material-nextjs, @mui/icons-material, @mui/x-data-grid, @mui/x-date-pickers and @mui/x-charts at the MUI MCP-reported v9 versions, plus the react-is@18.3.1 override required for React 18.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 1\" },\n25\t    { \"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"src/theme/theme.ts builds the MUI theme with cssVariables, light/dark colorSchemes, the specified palette/shape/font/component defaults; root layout wraps the app in AppRouterCacheProvider + ThemeProvider + CssBaseline + LocalizationProvider, renders InitColorSchemeScript, and the top-bar toggle uses useColorScheme().setMode.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 2\" },\n26\t    { \"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"ESLint no-restricted-imports rule fails the build on any banned UI library (tailwindcss, @radix-ui/*, @headlessui/*, lucide-react, next-themes, @tanstack/react-table, recharts, @fullcalendar/*, react-select, react-datepicker, sonner, notistack, antd, @chakra-ui/*, react-bootstrap); no Tailwind config/plugin may exist.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 3\" },\n27\t    { \"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"Shared PageHeader component: Typography title, optional description, optional Breadcrumbs, optional right-side actions slot.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (PageHeader)\" },\n28\t    { \"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"Shared DataTable component wrapping MUI X DataGrid with server-side pagination/sorting, rowCount from API total, debounced search, empty/loading states and URL-synced query params.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (DataTable)\" },\n29\t    { \"id\": \"FR-22\", \"description\": \"Shared EmptyState component: icon, title, description, optional action button, centred layout.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (EmptyState)\" },\n30\t    { \"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Shared ConfirmDialog component using MUI Dialog, destructive variant, async onConfirm with pending spinner.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (ConfirmDialog)\" },\n31\t    { \"id\": \"FR-24\", \"description\": \"Shared useToast() hook + ToastProvider using a single queued MUI Snackbar + Alert, auto-hide 5 seconds.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (useToast/ToastProvider)\" },\n32\t    { \"id\": \"FR-25\", \"description\": \"Shared FormField helpers bind React Hook Form Controller to MUI TextField, Select, Autocomplete, Checkbox, Switch, RadioGroup and DatePicker/DateTimePicker, wiring label/helperText/error.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (FormField)\" },\n33\t    { \"id\": \"FR-26\", \"description\": \"Shared StatCard component: MUI Card with label, value, optional delta Chip and icon.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (StatCard)\" },\n34\t    { \"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"Shared UserAvatar component: MUI Avatar showing initials on a deterministic background colour derived from the user id.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (UserAvatar)\" },\n35\t    { \"id\": \"FR-28\", \"description\": \"Shared DateDisplay component plus formatInSchoolTz(date, pattern) util in src/lib/dates.ts formatting a UTC date in the school timezone.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (DateDisplay)\" },\n36\t    { \"id\": \"FR-29\", \"description\": \"Shared LoadingSkeleton component with MUI Skeleton variants for table, card and form.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Design system, item 4 (LoadingSkeleton)\" },\n37\t    { \"id\": \"FR-30\", \"description\": \"src/app/(app)/layout.tsx renders a permanent left sidebar Drawer (256px, collapsible to 64px icon rail, state saved to localStorage) and a top bar built with AppBar + Toolbar.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 App shell, item 1\" },\n38\t    { \"id\": \"FR-31\", \"description\": \"On screens narrower than 1024px the sidebar becomes a temporary Drawer opened from a hamburger IconButton.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 App shell, item 2\" },\n39\t    { \"id\": \"FR-32\", \"description\": \"Sidebar items are sourced from src/config/navigation.ts, filtered by the current user's role, with the active item highlighted by current path prefix; initial entry is Dashboard (/dashboard, all roles).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 App shell, item 3\" },\n40\t    { \"id\": \"FR-33\", \"description\": \"Top bar shows school short name/logo from SchoolSettings, a theme toggle, a placeholder notification bell, and a user menu (avatar, name, role badge, Profile/Sign out items) for later wiring by PRD-01/PRD-03/PRD-04.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 App shell, item 4\" },\n41\t    { \"id\": \"FR-34\", \"description\": \"/dashboard renders a PageHeader 'Welcome to SchoolHub' and an EmptyState noting dashboards arrive in a later release.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 App shell, item 5\" },\n42\t    { \"id\": \"FR-35\", \"description\": \"src/config/student-tabs.ts exists, exporting an empty typed array of { key, label, href(studentId), roles } for later PRDs to register tabs into.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 App shell, item 6\" },\n43\t    { \"id\": \"FR-36\", \"description\": \"src/app/(public)/layout.tsx renders a header (logo, school name, Sign in button to /login) and a footer with school address/phone/email from SchoolSettings.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 Public layout, item 1\" },\n44\t    { \"id\": \"FR-37\", \"description\": \"/ renders a hero section with the school name, a one-sentence tagline, and the Sign in button.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 Public layout, item 2\" },\n45\t    { \"id\": \"FR-38\", \"description\": \"Custom not-found.tsx (404), error.tsx (with a Try again button calling reset()), and global-error.tsx are implemented.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Error and status pages, item 1\" },\n46\t    { \"id\": \"FR-39\", \"description\": \"/forbidden page shows a 403 message with a link back to /dashboard, for use by later PRDs.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Error and status pages, item 2\" },\n47\t    { \"id\": \"FR-40\", \"description\": \"src/lib/logger.ts exports logger.info|warn|error(message, meta?) writing JSON lines in production and readable lines in development.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-9 Logging\" }\n48\t  ],\n49\t\n50\t  \"nonFunctionalRequirements\": [\n51\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-1\", \"description\": \"Material UI is the only permitted UI component/styling library; every component must be looked up via the MUI MCP server before use (useMuiDocs + fetchDocs), and a fixed list of alternative UI/styling libraries (Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Radix, Chakra, Ant Design, Bootstrap, lucide-react, next-themes, @tanstack/react-table, Recharts, FullCalendar, react-select, react-datepicker, sonner, notistack, etc.) is banned and enforced by ESLint.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"UI component rule (mandatory), items 1-6\" },\n52\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-2\", \"description\": \"/dashboard must reach Largest Contentful Paint under 2.5 seconds on a mid-range laptop running the production build.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 1 (Performance)\" },\n53\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"All shared components meet WCAG 2.1 AA: visible focus rings, labelled controls, 4.5:1 colour contrast, full keyboard operability of sidebar/dialogs/menus; Playwright e2e runs @axe-core/playwright on / and /dashboard with zero serious/critical violations.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 2 (Accessibility)\" },\n54\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-4\", \"description\": \"Layouts work from 360px to 1920px viewport width with no horizontal scroll.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 3 (Responsiveness)\" },\n55\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-5\", \"description\": \"next.config.js sets security headers: X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin, X-Frame-Options: DENY, and a Content-Security-Policy restricted to self plus inline styles required by Next.js.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 4 (Security)\" },\n56\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-6\", \"description\": \"Test harness uses Vitest + Testing Library for unit/component tests and Playwright for e2e (tests/e2e), covering withHandler branches, parsePagination, formatInSchoolTz, env.ts validation, DataTable/ConfirmDialog/useToast component behaviour, the no-restricted-imports lint rule, and the Playwright/axe scenarios listed in Test Requirements.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Test Requirements section\" },\n57\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"A fresh clone must be runnable end-to-end (docker compose up -d && npm install && npm run db:migrate && npm run db:seed && npm run dev) and viewable at localhost:3000 in under 5 minutes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Goals, item 1\" },\n58\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"npm run lint, npm run typecheck, npm run test and npm run test:e2e must all pass on a fresh clone.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Goals, item 3\" }\n59\t  ],\n60\t\n61\t  \"overallConfidencePct\": 100,\n62