nd date after start date and that the date range does not overlap any other academic year, surfacing 'Dates overlap with <year>.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-8\",  \"description\": \"'Set as current' action (behind a confirm dialog) sets isCurrent = true on the chosen year and false on all others inside one transaction.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-9\",  \"description\": \"Deleting an academic year is blocked (action disabled, tooltip 'In use — cannot delete') unless it has zero terms and is referenced by no other record.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 4\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"getCurrentAcademicYear() returns the current year with terms ordered by order (or null); getCurrentTerm(date = today) returns the term containing the date in the school timezone (or null).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 5\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"When no academic year is marked current, every admin page shows a dismissible banner: 'No current academic year is set. Set one in Academic Years.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 6\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Academic year detail page (/admin/academic-years/[id]) lists the year's terms in order with inline create, edit and delete.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 Terms, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Term validation: dates must fall inside the academic year's range and must not overlap sibling terms; order auto-assigns as max+1 and is editable via drag handle or up/down buttons.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 Terms, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"Term dialogs use MUI X DatePicker; a 'Generate terms' shortcut (2 semesters / 3 trimesters / 4 quarters) sp