{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H4yuZZV2gedY7eYCahcz2L","type":"tool_result","content":"205\t## API\n206\t\n207\t| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n208\t|---|---|---|\n209\t| `GET /api/users` | ADMIN | Filters: `role`, `status`, `gradeLevelId`, `q`, `includeArchived`, pagination |\n210\t| `POST /api/users` | ADMIN | Body: common fields + `role` + `profile` object + `links[]` + `sendInvite` |\n211\t| `GET /api/users/:id` | ADMIN | Full user + profile + links |\n212\t| `PATCH /api/users/:id` | ADMIN | Common + profile fields |\n213\t| `POST /api/users/:id/invite` | ADMIN | Resend invite |\n214\t| `POST /api/users/:id/unlock` | ADMIN | |\n215\t| `POST /api/users/:id/status` | ADMIN | `{ status: \"ACTIVE\" \\| \"DISABLED\" }` |\n216\t| `POST /api/users/:id/archive` · `/restore` | ADMIN | |\n217\t| `POST /api/users/import` | ADMIN | `{ type: \"STUDENTS\" \\| \"TEACHERS\", rows: [...], sendInvites }` |\n218\t| `GET /api/users/export` | ADMIN | Same filters as list, returns `text/csv` |\n219\t| `GET /api/users/search` | ADMIN, TEACHER | Picker search |\n220\t| `POST /api/students/:id/parents` | ADMIN | `{ parentId, relationship, isPrimary }` |\n221\t| `DELETE /api/students/:id/parents/:parentId` | ADMIN | |\n222\t| `GET /api/students/:id` | per `assertCanViewStudent` | Medical notes stripped for STUDENT/PARENT |\n223\t| `GET /api/me/children` | PARENT | |\n224\t| `PATCH /api/me/profile` | any | Phone (+ parent fields) |\n225\t| `GET /api/audit-logs` | ADMIN | Filters + pagination |\n226\t\n227\t## Non-Functional Requirements\n228\t\n229\t1. **Privacy:** `medicalNotes` must never be returned to STUDENT or PARENT roles, enforced in the service layer. Exported CSVs exclude medical notes.\n230\t2. **Performance:** user list with 5,000 users must return a page in under 300 ms (index on `lastName`, `firstName`, `email`).\n231\t3. **Reliability:** an import batch either fully succeeds or fully rolls back; partial batches never persist.\n232\t4. **Security:** CSV export must neutralise formula injection (prefix cells starting with `=`, `+`, `-`, `@` with `'`).\n233\t\n234\t## Acceptance Criteria"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"744674dc-d209-4d85-a196-0650535a8eff","uuid":"703fc678-a2dc-4f2d-b892-10c85ca272a1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:14:58.120Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/03-user-management.md","content":"## API\n\n| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET /api/users` | ADMIN | Filters: `role`, `status`, `gradeLevelId`, `q`, `includeArchived`, pagination |\n| `POST /api/users` | ADMIN | Body: common fields + `role` + `profile` object + `links[]` + `sendInvite` |\n| `GET /api/users/:id` | ADMIN | Full user + profile + links |\n| `PATCH /api/users/:id` | ADMIN | Common + profile fields |\n| `POST /api/users/:id/invite` | ADMIN | Resend invite |\n| `POST /api/users/:id/unlock` | ADMIN | |\n| `POST /api/users/:id/status` | ADMIN | `{ status: \"ACTIVE\" \\| \"DISABLED\" }` |\n| `POST /api/users/:id/archive` · `/restore` | ADMIN | |\n| `POST /api/users/import` | ADMIN | `{ type: \"STUDENTS\" \\| \"TEACHERS\", rows: [...], sendInvites }` |\n| `GET /api/users/export` | ADMIN | Same filters as list, returns `text/csv` |\n| `GET /api/users/search` | ADMIN, TEACHER | Picker search |\n| `POST /api/students/:id/parents` | ADMIN | `{ parentId, relationship, isPrimary }` |\n| `DELETE /api/students/:id/parents/:parentId` | ADMIN | |\n| `GET /api/students/:id` | per `assertCanViewStudent` | Medical notes stripped for STUDENT/PARENT |\n| `GET /api/me/children` | PARENT | |\n| `PATCH /api/me/profile` | any | Phone (+ parent fields) |\n| `GET /api/audit-logs` | ADMIN | Filters + pagination |\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n1. **Privacy:** `medicalNotes` must never be returned to STUDENT or PARENT roles, enforced in the service layer. Exported CSVs exclude medical notes.\n2. **Performance:** user list with 5,000 users must return a page in under 300 ms (index on `lastName`, `firstName`, `email`).\n3. **Reliability:** an import batch either fully succeeds or fully rolls back; partial batches never persist.\n4. **Security:** CSV export must neutralise formula injection (prefix cells starting with `=`, `+`, `-`, `@` with `'`).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria","numLines":30,"startLine":205,"totalLines":256}}}
