{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L1eF8vtioKiFYQhn59S216","type":"tool_result","content":"176\t## API\n177\t\n178\t| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n179\t|---|---|---|\n180\t| `GET /api/notifications` | any | `?unread=true&category=&page=` — own notifications only |\n181\t| `GET /api/notifications/unread-count` | any | `{ data: { count } }` |\n182\t| `POST /api/notifications/:id/read` · `/unread` | owner | |\n183\t| `POST /api/notifications/read-all` | any | |\n184\t| `GET /api/me/notification-preferences` | any | Merged with registry defaults |\n185\t| `PUT /api/me/notification-preferences` | any | `{ type, inApp, email }`; `inApp=false` refused for mandatory types |\n186\t| `POST /api/internal/email/dispatch` | `CRON_SECRET` | Returns `{ sent, failed, retried }` |\n187\t| `GET /api/admin/email-log` | ADMIN | |\n188\t| `POST /api/admin/email-log/:id/retry` | ADMIN | |\n189\t| `POST /api/admin/notifications/test` | ADMIN | |\n190\t\n191\t## Non-Functional Requirements\n192\t\n193\t1. **Performance:** `notify()` for 1,000 recipients must finish in under 2 seconds. Unread-count endpoint must respond in under 50 ms (indexed).\n194\t2. **Reliability:** an email is never sent twice by concurrent dispatchers (row locking). A crash mid-send leaves rows in `SENDING`; rows stuck in `SENDING` for more than 10 minutes return to `PENDING`.\n195\t3. **Security:** notification `link` values must be relative paths starting with `/` (validated) to prevent open redirects. Email HTML escapes all user-provided text.\n196\t4. **Deliverability:** every email has both HTML and plain-text parts and a `List-Unsubscribe` header pointing at the preferences page.\n197\t\n198\t## Acceptance Criteria\n199\t\n200\t1. Given a user with default preferences, when `notify()` is called for type `system.test`, then one `Notification` row and one `EmailOutbox` row are created and the bell count increases by 1 within 30 seconds."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54b3bb1c-c2bb-4763-9a84-dd2308368397","uuid":"d1ddb748-e84f-4ad0-a28c-11f6192e8f59","timestamp":"2026-10-19T10:11:30.748Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/04-notifications.md","content":"## API\n\n| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET /api/notifications` | any | `?unread=true&category=&page=` — own notifications only |\n| `GET /api/notifications/unread-count` | any | `{ data: { count } }` |\n| `POST /api/notifications/:id/read` · `/unread` | owner | |\n| `POST /api/notifications/read-all` | any | |\n| `GET /api/me/notification-preferences` | any | Merged with registry defaults |\n| `PUT /api/me/notification-preferences` | any | `{ type, inApp, email }`; `inApp=false` refused for mandatory types |\n| `POST /api/internal/email/dispatch` | `CRON_SECRET` | Returns `{ sent, failed, retried }` |\n| `GET /api/admin/email-log` | ADMIN | |\n| `POST /api/admin/email-log/:id/retry` | ADMIN | |\n| `POST /api/admin/notifications/test` | ADMIN | |\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n1. **Performance:** `notify()` for 1,000 recipients must finish in under 2 seconds. Unread-count endpoint must respond in under 50 ms (indexed).\n2. **Reliability:** an email is never sent twice by concurrent dispatchers (row locking). A crash mid-send leaves rows in `SENDING`; rows stuck in `SENDING` for more than 10 minutes return to `PENDING`.\n3. **Security:** notification `link` values must be relative paths starting with `/` (validated) to prevent open redirects. Email HTML escapes all user-provided text.\n4. **Deliverability:** every email has both HTML and plain-text parts and a `List-Unsubscribe` header pointing at the preferences page.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n1. Given a user with default preferences, when `notify()` is called for type `system.test`, then one `Notification` row and one `EmailOutbox` row are created and the bell count increases by 1 within 30 seconds.","numLines":25,"startLine":176,"totalLines":217}}}
