"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-17\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Paginated EmailOutbox rows, newest first, optional status filter.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"status\": \"\\\"PENDING\\\"|\\\"SENDING\\\"|\\\"SENT\\\"|\\\"FAILED\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int?\", \"pageSize\": \"int?\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"toEmail\": \"string\", \"toName\": \"string|null\", \"subject\": \"string\", \"status\": \"string\", \"attempts\": \"int\", \"lastError\": \"string|null\", \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime\", \"sentAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log/:id/retry\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Only valid for rows currently status=FAILED (VALIDATION_ERROR otherwise); resets attempts=0, status=PENDING, nextAttemptAt=now so the next dispatchEmails() pass picks it up — not a separate send path.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"attempts\": 0, \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/admin/notifications/test\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Calls notify({ type: 'system.test', userIds: [caller.id], title, body }) for the signed-in admin; exercises the same in-app + email path as any other notification.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"notificationId\": \"string\", \"emailQueued\": \"boolean\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":168,"newStart":1,"newLines":109,"lines":[" {","-  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T14:20:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\","," ","-  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (abcd-03) and the source PRD's explicit API table (03-user-management.md, section 'API'), which fully specifies method/path/role/body for all 18 endpoints. Two items carried forward from system-design.md's Status section, unresolved by this sub-task because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) FR-31 is MEDIUM confidence — the unlock contract below assumes it clears exactly lockedUntil/failedLoginCount per prisma/schema.prisma, confirm before implementation; (2) POST /api/users/:id/invite and the session-level effect of POST /api/users/:id/status are written against src/server/services/users.ts's sendInvite(userId) and PRD-01's session/status re-check, neither of which exists in src/ yet (only their schema does) — see handoff-to-dev-planning.json blockers.\",","+  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (abcd-04, Components 3/8/11/15/16/17) and the source PRD's explicit API table (04-notifications.md, section 'API'), which fully specifies method/path/role/body for all 11 endpoints (the table's 'POST /api/notifications/:id/read · /unread' row is two endpoints). Two items carried forward, unresolved here because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) every non-ADMIN, non-CRON_SECRET endpoint below calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) as the stand-in for a real requireUser() per system-design.md's Overview/Component 12 finding — src/server/auth/permissions.ts does not exist yet (only requireRole.ts's ADMIN-placeholder does), so 'own notifications only' / 'own preferences only' scoping is written against the request's userId param today and must be swapped to the real session identity when PRD-01 lands, not re-derived; (2) list/count responses use the real paginated()/ok() shapes from src/server/http.ts (data + nested meta for lists), confirmed directly against src/server/http.ts and existing routes (src/app/api/users/route.ts, src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts) rather than assumed.\","," ","   \"conventions\": {","     \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<resource or array>\" },","-    \"listEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"[...]\", \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 20, \"total\": 0 },","+    \"listEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"[...]\", \"meta\": { \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 20, \"total\": 0 } },","     \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": {} } },","-    \"errorCodes\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR (400)\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED (401)\", \"FORBIDDEN (403)\", \"NOT_FOUND (404)\", \"CONFLICT (409)\", \"RATE_LIMITED (429)\", \"INTERNAL (500)\"],","-    \"pagination\": \"?page= (default 1), ?pageSize= (default 20, max 100)\",","-    \"sorting\": \"?sort=field&order=asc|desc\",","-    \"search\": \"?q=\",","-    \"auth\": \"Per-endpoint role gate shown in each entry's description, enforced server-side via requireRole()/assertCanViewStudent (never UI-only). Student-scoped reads additionally run assertCanViewStudent, which throws FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND (for STUDENT/PARENT callers, to avoid revealing existence) rather than a blanket 403.\",","-    \"audit\": \"Every write endpoint writes an AuditLog row via audit() with action user.<verb> (e.g. user.created, user.status_changed, user.archived, user.unlocked, user.imported, parent_link.created, parent_link.removed).\",","-    \"privacy\": \"medicalNotes is stripped server-side (never UI-only) from every response reachable by STUDENT/PARENT roles and from every CSV export row (NFR-1).\"","+    \"errorCodes\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR (400)\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED (401)\", \"FORBIDDEN (403)\", \"NOT_FOUND (404)\", \"CONFLICT (409)\", \"RATE_LIMITED (429)\", \"INTERNAL (500)\", \"INVALID_TOKEN (410)\"],","+    \"pagination\": \"?page= (default 1), ?pageSize= (default 20, max 100), per src/server/http.ts parsePagination()\",","+    \"auth\": \"Own-row routes call requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (placeholder for PRD-01's requireUser(); see note). ADMIN-only routes call requireRole('ADMIN') directly — already real today. POST /api/internal/email/dispatch checks Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET} itself, not requireRole.\",","+    \"security\": \"Notification.link values are validated server-side as '/'-prefixed relative paths before any write that sets them (NFR-5); this is a notify()-time invariant, not re-validated at the read endpoints below.\"","   },"," ","   \"endpoints\": [","     {","       \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Paginated, filtered user list backed by the (lastName, firstName, email) index.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"role\": \"Role[]?\", \"status\": \"UserStatus?\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string?\", \"q\": \"string?\", \"includeArchived\": \"boolean? (default false)\", \"page\": \"int?\", \"pageSize\": \"int?\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string|null\", \"gradeLevelName\": \"string|null\", \"lastLoginAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"lockedUntil\": \"datetime|null\" } ], \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"NFR-2\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/notifications\",","+      \"description\": \"Any role. Own notifications only (userId scoped server-side). Backs both the /notifications page (paginated, filterable) and, with pageSize=10 and no filters, the bell popover's recent-10 list — one implementation (Component 11), not two query paths.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"unread\": \"boolean?\", \"category\": \"\\\"ACCOUNT\\\"|\\\"ACADEMIC\\\"|\\\"ATTENDANCE\\\"|\\\"COMMUNICATION\\\"|\\\"FINANCE\\\"|\\\"SYSTEM\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int? (default 1)\", \"pageSize\": \"int? (default 20, max 100)\" },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"type\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"title\": \"string\", \"body\": \"string|null\", \"link\": \"string|null\", \"readAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Creates a User + role-specific profile row + any inline parent/student links in one transaction; generates admissionNumber (S<year>-####) or employeeNumber (T-####) where applicable.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"phone\": \"string? (^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$)\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"profile\": \"StudentProfileInput|TeacherProfileInput|ParentProfileInput (shape depends on role; see FR-1)\", \"links\": \"[{ linkedUserId: string, relationship: GuardianRelationship, isPrimary: boolean }]?\", \"sendInvite\": \"boolean (default true)\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"profile\": \"object\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]","-    },","-    {","       \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Full user + role profile + family links (component 6) + 20 most recent AuditLog rows where actorId=id OR entityId=id.\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/unread-count\",","+      \"description\": \"Any role. Own count only. Backed by the Notification(userId, readAt, createdAt) composite index; must respond under 50ms (NFR-3). Polled by the bell every 30s while the tab is visible.\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"lastLoginAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"profile\": \"object\", \"familyLinks\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"linkedUserId\": \"string\", \"linkedUserName\": \"string\", \"relationship\": \"GuardianRelationship\", \"isPrimary\": \"boolean\" } ], \"recentAuditLogs\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"action\": \"string\", \"actorId\": \"string|null\", \"entityType\": \"string|null\", \"entityId\": \"string|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ] } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"count\": \"int\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"PATCH\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Updates common + profile fields. role is rejected server-side if present and different from the existing row (FR-9 is a service-layer invariant, not just a form convenience). An email diff invalidates (marks used) any pending AuthToken rows of type INVITE for this user.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"firstName\": \"string?\", \"lastName\": \"string?\", \"email\": \"string?\", \"phone\": \"string?\", \"profile\": \"Partial<StudentProfileInput|TeacherProfileInput|ParentProfileInput>?\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"profile\": \"object\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\"]","-    },","-    {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/invite\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Resends an invitation email via src/server/services/users.ts's sendInvite(userId) (PRD-01 interface; see note — stub/no-op until PRD-01 lands, call site does not change).\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/read\",","+      \"description\": \"Owner only (the notification's userId must match the caller). Sets readAt=now if not already set; idempotent. NOT_FOUND if the id doesn't belong to the caller (never reveals another user's notification exists).\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"inviteSentAt\": \"datetime\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": \"datetime\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/unlock\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Clears lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, restoring sign-in access immediately. MEDIUM confidence (FR-31) — field names confirmed against prisma/schema.prisma; verify no other lockout field exists before implementation.\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/unread\",","+      \"description\": \"Owner only. Clears readAt. Same ownership/NOT_FOUND rule as /read.\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"lockedUntil\": null, \"failedLoginCount\": 0 } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-31\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": null } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/status\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Sets status to ACTIVE or DISABLED. Rejects self-disable and disabling the last active ADMIN with VALIDATION_ERROR 'At least one active admin is required.' The 'sessions stop working within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session re-check reading status on token refresh, not built here (NFR-7) — this endpoint only guarantees status is correct the instant the write commits.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"status\": \"\\\"ACTIVE\\\"|\\\"DISABLED\\\"\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-14\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/read-all\",","+      \"description\": \"Any role. Sets readAt=now on every unread Notification row owned by the caller in one update.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": {},","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"updated\": \"int\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/archive\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Sets archivedAt=now and status=DISABLED. Same self/last-admin guard as /status. Archived users are excluded from every list/picker query by default (component 3/7/16), enforced at the query layer.\",","+      \"method\": \"GET\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",","+      \"description\": \"Any role. Merges NOTIFICATION_TYPES registry entries visible to the caller's role with the caller's existing NotificationPreference rows (registry defaultEmail/mandatoryInApp used where no row exists).\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"archivedAt\": \"datetime\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\", \"FR-14\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"type\": \"string\", \"label\": \"string\", \"description\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\", \"mandatoryInApp\": \"boolean\" } ] },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/restore\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Clears archivedAt. Does not auto-reactivate status; an admin re-enables separately via /status.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"archivedAt\": null } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\"]","+      \"method\": \"PUT\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",","+      \"description\": \"Any role. Upserts one {type, inApp, email} preference row for the caller. Rejects inApp=false for mandatoryInApp types with VALIDATION_ERROR before any write (FR-22) — defense in depth alongside the disabled UI switch.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"type\": \"string (must exist in NOTIFICATION_TYPES)\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/import\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Re-validates every row server-side (never trusts the client) against the same Zod schemas as the create form, in batches of 200; each batch runs in one prisma.$transaction (all-or-rollback, NFR-3). Grade levels matched case-insensitively by name/shortName; dates parsed strictly as YYYY-MM-DD; rows whose email already exists are skipped, not errored (FR-23).\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"type\": \"\\\"STUDENTS\\\"|\\\"TEACHERS\\\"\", \"rows\": \"object[] (raw parsed CSV rows, re-validated server-side)\", \"sendInvites\": \"boolean (default false)\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"createdStudents\": \"int\", \"createdParents\": \"int\", \"linkedExistingParents\": \"int\", \"skipped\": \"int\", \"failed\": \"int\", \"rowResults\": [ { \"rowIndex\": \"int\", \"result\": \"\\\"created\\\"|\\\"skipped\\\"|\\\"error\\\"\", \"reason\": \"string|null\" } ], \"errorReportCsvUrl\": \"string|null\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-3\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/internal/email/dispatch\",","+      \"description\": \"Requires header Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET}; mismatch or missing header returns 401 UNAUTHENTICATED via the standard error envelope (NFR-8), checked before any other work. On success: recovers stuck SENDING rows (>10min), claims up to batchSize PENDING rows via FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, sends each, applies the retry backoff on failure, and runs the once-per-day purge.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"batchSize\": \"int? (default 50)\" },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"sent\": \"int\", \"failed\": \"int\", \"retried\": \"int\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-17\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-8\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/export\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Same filters as GET /api/users; returns text/csv. medicalNotes is excluded and every cell passes through escapeCsvCell() (NFR-4) to neutralise formula injection.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"role\": \"Role[]?\", \"status\": \"UserStatus?\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string?\", \"q\": \"string?\", \"includeArchived\": \"boolean?\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"contentType\": \"text/csv\", \"body\": \"csv string, one row per matched user, medicalNotes column omitted\" },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-5\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log\",","+      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Paginated EmailOutbox rows, newest first, optional status filter.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"status\": \"\\\"PENDING\\\"|\\\"SENDING\\\"|\\\"SENT\\\"|\\\"FAILED\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int?\", \"pageSize\": \"int?\" },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"toEmail\": \"string\", \"toName\": \"string|null\", \"subject\": \"string\", \"status\": \"string\", \"attempts\": \"int\", \"lastError\": \"string|null\", \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime\", \"sentAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/users/search\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN and TEACHER only. Picker search reusing the list query's filters, capped to 20 rows, projected down, excluding archived users.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"role\": \"Role?\", \"q\": \"string?\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\" } ] },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-28\"]","-    },","-    {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id/parents\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Links a parent to a student inside one transaction: rejects a 5th link for the student (VALIDATION_ERROR) and, if isPrimary is true, clears isPrimary on every other link for that student first.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"parentId\": \"string\", \"relationship\": \"GuardianRelationship\", \"isPrimary\": \"boolean\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"parentId\": \"string\", \"studentId\": \"string\", \"relationship\": \"GuardianRelationship\", \"isPrimary\": \"boolean\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]","-    },","-    {","-      \"method\": \"DELETE\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id/parents/:parentId\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Removes a parent-student link.\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log/:id/retry\",","+      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Only valid for rows currently status=FAILED (VALIDATION_ERROR otherwise); resets attempts=0, status=PENDING, nextAttemptAt=now so the next dispatchEmails() pass picks it up — not a separate send path.\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"deleted\": true } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"attempts\": 0, \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id\",","-      \"description\": \"Gated by assertCanViewStudent (ADMIN/TEACHER full access; STUDENT self only; PARENT linked children only — FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND otherwise, never revealing existence to STUDENT/PARENT). medicalNotes is stripped in the service layer for STUDENT/PARENT roles before the response is built.\",","+      \"method\": \"POST\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/admin/notifications/test\",","+      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Calls notify({ type: 'system.test', userIds: [caller.id], title, body }) for the signed-in admin; exercises the same in-app + email path as any other notification.\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelName\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"dateOfBirth\": \"date\", \"gender\": \"Gender\", \"addressLine1\": \"string|null\", \"city\": \"string|null\", \"medicalNotes\": \"string|null (omitted entirely for STUDENT/PARENT)\", \"emergencyContact\": \"string|null\", \"emergencyPhone\": \"string|null\", \"familyLinks\": \"[{ linkedUserId, linkedUserName, relationship, isPrimary }]\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]","-    },","-    {","-      \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/me/children\",","-      \"description\": \"PARENT only. Lists the caller's linked children for the My Children page.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelName\": \"string\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string\" } ] },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\"]","-    },","-    {","-      \"method\": \"PATCH\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/me/profile\",","-      \"description\": \"Any authenticated user, self only. Narrower mutation path than /api/users/:id — editable fields are phone, plus occupation/address for PARENT role; name/email/role are read-only here.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"phone\": \"string? (^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$)\", \"occupation\": \"string? (PARENT only)\", \"address\": \"string? (PARENT only)\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"phone\": \"string|null\", \"occupation\": \"string|null\", \"address\": \"string|null\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-27\"]","-    },","-    {","-      \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/audit-logs\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Read-only paginated view over the existing AuditLog table; filters by actor, action prefix, and date range. No new write path.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"actorId\": \"string?\", \"actionPrefix\": \"string?\", \"dateFrom\": \"date?\", \"dateTo\": \"date?\", \"page\": \"int?\", \"pageSize\": \"int?\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\", \"actorId\": \"string|null\", \"actorName\": \"string|null\", \"action\": \"string\", \"entityType\": \"string|null\", \"entityId\": \"string|null\", \"ip\": \"string|null\", \"metadata\": \"object|null\" } ], \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"notificationId\": \"string\", \"emailQueued\": \"boolean\" } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","     }","   ],"," "]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T14:20:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (abcd-03) and the source PRD's explicit API table (03-user-management.md, section 'API'), which fully specifies method/path/role/body for all 18 endpoints. Two items carried forward from system-design.md's Status section, unresolved by this sub-task because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) FR-31 is MEDIUM confidence — the unlock contract below assumes it clears exactly lockedUntil/failedLoginCount per prisma/schema.prisma, confirm before implementation; (2) POST /api/users/:id/invite and the session-level effect of POST /api/users/:id/status are written against src/server/services/users.ts's sendInvite(userId) and PRD-01's session/status re-check, neither of which exists in src/ yet (only their schema does) — see handoff-to-dev-planning.json blockers.\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<resource or array>\" },\n    \"listEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"[...]\", \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 20, \"total\": 0 },\n    \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": {} } },\n    \"errorCodes\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR (400)\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED (401)\", \"FORBIDDEN (403)\", \"NOT_FOUND (404)\", \"CONFLICT (409)\", \"RATE_LIMITED (429)\", \"INTERNAL (500)\"],\n    \"pagination\": \"?page= (default 1), ?pageSize= (default 20, max 100)\",\n    \"sorting\": \"?sort=field&order=asc|desc\",\n    \"search\": \"?q=\",\n    \"auth\": \"Per-endpoint role gate shown in each entry's description, enforced server-side via requireRole()/assertCanViewStudent (never UI-only). Student-scoped reads additionally run assertCanViewStudent, which throws FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND (for STUDENT/PARENT callers, to avoid revealing existence) rather than a blanket 403.\",\n    \"audit\": \"Every write endpoint writes an AuditLog row via audit() with action user.<verb> (e.g. user.created, user.status_changed, user.archived, user.unlocked, user.imported, parent_link.created, parent_link.removed).\",\n    \"privacy\": \"medicalNotes is stripped server-side (never UI-only) from every response reachable by STUDENT/PARENT roles and from every CSV export row (NFR-1).\"\n  },\n\n  \"endpoints\": [\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Paginated, filtered user list backed by the (lastName, firstName, email) index.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"role\": \"Role[]?\", \"status\": \"UserStatus?\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string?\", \"q\": \"string?\", \"includeArchived\": \"boolean? (default false)\", \"page\": \"int?\", \"pageSize\": \"int?\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string|null\", \"gradeLevelName\": \"string|null\", \"lastLoginAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"lockedUntil\": \"datetime|null\" } ], \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"NFR-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Creates a User + role-specific profile row + any inline parent/student links in one transaction; generates admissionNumber (S<year>-####) or employeeNumber (T-####) where applicable.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"phone\": \"string? (^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$)\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"profile\": \"StudentProfileInput|TeacherProfileInput|ParentProfileInput (shape depends on role; see FR-1)\", \"links\": \"[{ linkedUserId: string, relationship: GuardianRelationship, isPrimary: boolean }]?\", \"sendInvite\": \"boolean (default true)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"profile\": \"object\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Full user + role profile + family links (component 6) + 20 most recent AuditLog rows where actorId=id OR entityId=id.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"lastLoginAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"profile\": \"object\", \"familyLinks\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"linkedUserId\": \"string\", \"linkedUserName\": \"string\", \"relationship\": \"GuardianRelationship\", \"isPrimary\": \"boolean\" } ], \"recentAuditLogs\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"action\": \"string\", \"actorId\": \"string|null\", \"entityType\": \"string|null\", \"entityId\": \"string|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ] } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"PATCH\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Updates common + profile fields. role is rejected server-side if present and different from the existing row (FR-9 is a service-layer invariant, not just a form convenience). An email diff invalidates (marks used) any pending AuthToken rows of type INVITE for this user.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"firstName\": \"string?\", \"lastName\": \"string?\", \"email\": \"string?\", \"phone\": \"string?\", \"profile\": \"Partial<StudentProfileInput|TeacherProfileInput|ParentProfileInput>?\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"profile\": \"object\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/invite\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Resends an invitation email via src/server/services/users.ts's sendInvite(userId) (PRD-01 interface; see note — stub/no-op until PRD-01 lands, call site does not change).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"inviteSentAt\": \"datetime\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/unlock\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Clears lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, restoring sign-in access immediately. MEDIUM confidence (FR-31) — field names confirmed against prisma/schema.prisma; verify no other lockout field exists before implementation.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"lockedUntil\": null, \"failedLoginCount\": 0 } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-31\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/status\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Sets status to ACTIVE or DISABLED. Rejects self-disable and disabling the last active ADMIN with VALIDATION_ERROR 'At least one active admin is required.' The 'sessions stop working within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session re-check reading status on token refresh, not built here (NFR-7) — this endpoint only guarantees status is correct the instant the write commits.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"status\": \"\\\"ACTIVE\\\"|\\\"DISABLED\\\"\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-14\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/archive\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Sets archivedAt=now and status=DISABLED. Same self/last-admin guard as /status. Archived users are excluded from every list/picker query by default (component 3/7/16), enforced at the query layer.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"archivedAt\": \"datetime\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\", \"FR-14\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/:id/restore\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Clears archivedAt. Does not auto-reactivate status; an admin re-enables separately via /status.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"archivedAt\": null } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/import\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Re-validates every row server-side (never trusts the client) against the same Zod schemas as the create form, in batches of 200; each batch runs in one prisma.$transaction (all-or-rollback, NFR-3). Grade levels matched case-insensitively by name/shortName; dates parsed strictly as YYYY-MM-DD; rows whose email already exists are skipped, not errored (FR-23).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"type\": \"\\\"STUDENTS\\\"|\\\"TEACHERS\\\"\", \"rows\": \"object[] (raw parsed CSV rows, re-validated server-side)\", \"sendInvites\": \"boolean (default false)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"createdStudents\": \"int\", \"createdParents\": \"int\", \"linkedExistingParents\": \"int\", \"skipped\": \"int\", \"failed\": \"int\", \"rowResults\": [ { \"rowIndex\": \"int\", \"result\": \"\\\"created\\\"|\\\"skipped\\\"|\\\"error\\\"\", \"reason\": \"string|null\" } ], \"errorReportCsvUrl\": \"string|null\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/export\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Same filters as GET /api/users; returns text/csv. medicalNotes is excluded and every cell passes through escapeCsvCell() (NFR-4) to neutralise formula injection.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"role\": \"Role[]?\", \"status\": \"UserStatus?\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string?\", \"q\": \"string?\", \"includeArchived\": \"boolean?\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"contentType\": \"text/csv\", \"body\": \"csv string, one row per matched user, medicalNotes column omitted\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-5\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/users/search\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN and TEACHER only. Picker search reusing the list query's filters, capped to 20 rows, projected down, excluding archived users.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"role\": \"Role?\", \"q\": \"string?\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\" } ] },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-28\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id/parents\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Links a parent to a student inside one transaction: rejects a 5th link for the student (VALIDATION_ERROR) and, if isPrimary is true, clears isPrimary on every other link for that student first.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"parentId\": \"string\", \"relationship\": \"GuardianRelationship\", \"isPrimary\": \"boolean\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"parentId\": \"string\", \"studentId\": \"string\", \"relationship\": \"GuardianRelationship\", \"isPrimary\": \"boolean\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"DELETE\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id/parents/:parentId\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Removes a parent-student link.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"deleted\": true } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"Gated by assertCanViewStudent (ADMIN/TEACHER full access; STUDENT self only; PARENT linked children only — FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND otherwise, never revealing existence to STUDENT/PARENT). medicalNotes is stripped in the service layer for STUDENT/PARENT roles before the response is built.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelName\": \"string\", \"status\": \"UserStatus\", \"dateOfBirth\": \"date\", \"gender\": \"Gender\", \"addressLine1\": \"string|null\", \"city\": \"string|null\", \"medicalNotes\": \"string|null (omitted entirely for STUDENT/PARENT)\", \"emergencyContact\": \"string|null\", \"emergencyPhone\": \"string|null\", \"familyLinks\": \"[{ linkedUserId, linkedUserName, relationship, isPrimary }]\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/me/children\",\n      \"description\": \"PARENT only. Lists the caller's linked children for the My Children page.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelName\": \"string\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string\" } ] },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"PATCH\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/me/profile\",\n      \"description\": \"Any authenticated user, self only. Narrower mutation path than /api/users/:id — editable fields are phone, plus occupation/address for PARENT role; name/email/role are read-only here.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"phone\": \"string? (^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$)\", \"occupation\": \"string? (PARENT only)\", \"address\": \"string? (PARENT only)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"firstName\": \"string\", \"lastName\": \"string\", \"email\": \"string\", \"role\": \"Role\", \"phone\": \"string|null\", \"occupation\": \"string|null\", \"address\": \"string|null\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-27\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/audit-logs\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Read-only paginated view over the existing AuditLog table; filters by actor, action prefix, and date range. No new write path.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"actorId\": \"string?\", \"actionPrefix\": \"string?\", \"dateFrom\": \"date?\", \"dateTo\": \"date?\", \"page\": \"int?\", \"pageSize\": \"int?\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\", \"actorId\": \"string|null\", \"actorName\": \"string|null\", \"action\": \"string\", \"entityType\": \"string|null\", \"entityId\": \"string|null\", \"ip\": \"string|null\", \"metadata\": \"object|null\" } ], \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","userModified":false}}
