ld sequence PRD-01's work ahead of these call sites, or confirm the placeholder's single-admin-identity behavior is acceptable for this ticket's own-row scoping until PRD-01 lands.\"","     },","     {","       \"severity\": \"advisory\",","-      \"description\": \"FR-31 (POST /api/users/:id/unlock) is MEDIUM confidence, carried unchanged from intake through system-design.md. The contract assumes clearing exactly lockedUntil and failedLoginCount (both already in prisma/schema.prisma). Confirm no other lockout-related field exists before implementation.\"","+      \"description\": \"FR-23 (nav entries) was MEDIUM confidence at intake; system-design.md resolved it (flat 'Notifications' and ADMIN-only 'Email log' entries, no new nav group) rather than carrying it forward as a gap. No action needed from dev-planning beyond implementing what system-design.md's Component 18 specifies.\"","     }","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\""]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T14:21:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 18,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"Sequencing dependency on PRD-01 (not yet landed in src/): POST /api/users/:id/invite (sendInvite), the 'send invitation email now' path on POST /api/users, and the session-level effect of POST /api/users/:id/status (sessions rejected within 5 minutes of DISABLED) are written against src/server/services/users.ts's sendInvite(userId) and PRD-01's session/token-refresh status re-check, neither of which exists yet in src/server/auth/ (only requireRole.ts's ADMIN-placeholder and the relevant Prisma columns exist). Not a design defect (NFR-7 forbids re-implementing PRD-01 inside this ticket) — dev-planning should either sequence PRD-01's work ahead of these call sites or stub them behind the same placeholder convention requireRole.ts already uses, so call sites don't change when PRD-01 lands.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"FR-31 (POST /api/users/:id/unlock) is MEDIUM confidence, carried unchanged from intake through system-design.md. The contract assumes clearing exactly lockedUntil and failedLoginCount (both already in prisma/schema.prisma). Confirm no other lockout-related field exists before implementation.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","userModified":false}}
