{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SugcvEwBQsiKe8fSBHijKk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (abcd-04, Components 3/8/11/15/16/17) and the source PRD's explicit API table (04-notifications.md, section 'API'), which fully specifies method/path/role/body for all 11 endpoints (the table's 'POST /api/notifications/:id/read · /unread' row is two endpoints). Two items carried forward, unresolved here because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) every non-ADMIN, non-CRON_SECRET endpoint below calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) as the stand-in for a real requireUser() per system-design.md's Overview/Component 12 finding — src/server/auth/permissions.ts does not exist yet (only requireRole.ts's ADMIN-placeholder does), so 'own notifications only' / 'own preferences only' scoping is written against the request's userId param today and must be swapped to the real session identity when PRD-01 lands, not re-derived; (2) list/count responses use the real paginated()/ok() shapes from src/server/http.ts (data + nested meta for lists), confirmed directly against src/server/http.ts and existing routes (src/app/api/users/route.ts, src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts) rather than assumed.\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<resource or array>\" },\n    \"listEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"[...]\", \"meta\": { \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 20, \"total\": 0 } },\n    \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": {} } },\n    \"errorCodes\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR (400)\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED (401)\", \"FORBIDDEN (403)\", \"NOT_FOUND (404)\", \"CONFLICT (409)\", \"RATE_LIMITED (429)\", \"INTERNAL (500)\", \"INVALID_TOKEN (410)\"],\n    \"pagination\": \"?page= (default 1), ?pageSize= (default 20, max 100), per src/server/http.ts parsePagination()\",\n    \"auth\": \"Own-row routes call requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (placeholder for PRD-01's requireUser(); see note). ADMIN-only routes call requireRole('ADMIN') directly — already real today. POST /api/internal/email/dispatch checks Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET} itself, not requireRole.\",\n    \"security\": \"Notification.link values are validated server-side as '/'-prefixed relative paths before any write that sets them (NFR-5); this is a notify()-time invariant, not re-validated at the read endpoints below.\"\n  },\n\n  \"endpoints\": [\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Own notifications only (userId scoped server-side). Backs both the /notifications page (paginated, filterable) and, with pageSize=10 and no filters, the bell popover's recent-10 list — one implementation (Component 11), not two query paths.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"unread\": \"boolean?\", \"category\": \"\\\"ACCOUNT\\\"|\\\"ACADEMIC\\\"|\\\"ATTENDANCE\\\"|\\\"COMMUNICATION\\\"|\\\"FINANCE\\\"|\\\"SYSTEM\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int? (default 1)\", \"pageSize\": \"int? (default 20, max 100)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"type\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"title\": \"string\", \"body\": \"string|null\", \"link\": \"string|null\", \"readAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/unread-count\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Own count only. Backed by the Notification(userId, readAt, createdAt) composite index; must respond under 50ms (NFR-3). Polled by the bell every 30s while the tab is visible.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"count\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/read\",\n      \"description\": \"Owner only (the notification's userId must match the caller). Sets readAt=now if not already set; idempotent. NOT_FOUND if the id doesn't belong to the caller (never reveals another user's notification exists).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": \"datetime\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/unread\",\n      \"description\": \"Owner only. Clears readAt. Same ownership/NOT_FOUND rule as /read.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": null } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n---handoff---\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:11:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 11,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"Sequencing dependency on PRD-01 (not yet landed in src/): every own-notifications-only / own-preferences-only route (GET/POST /api/notifications*, GET/PUT /api/me/notification-preferences) is written against requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) from src/server/auth/requireRole.ts as a stand-in for a real requireUser() identity, exactly as PRD-03's handoff flagged for its own routes. src/server/auth/permissions.ts does not exist yet. Not a design defect (system-design.md's Overview explains why re-implementing auth here would violate this PRD's scope) — dev-planning should sequence PRD-01's work ahead of these call sites, or confirm the placeholder's single-admin-identity behavior is acceptable for this ticket's own-row scoping until PRD-01 lands.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"FR-23 (nav entries) was MEDIUM confidence at intake; system-design.md resolved it (flat 'Notifications' and ADMIN-only 'Email log' entries, no new nav group) rather than carrying it forward as a gap. No action needed from dev-planning beyond implementing what system-design.md's Component 18 specifies.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n---intake handoff---\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-20T05:56:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 34,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 97,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b09f90f4-bdfe-409b-ac12-21f6b1ffd7b1","uuid":"2a563774-2698-4def-aaf8-96f64d3da78e","timestamp":"2026-10-20T06:00:04.525Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (abcd-04, Components 3/8/11/15/16/17) and the source PRD's explicit API table (04-notifications.md, section 'API'), which fully specifies method/path/role/body for all 11 endpoints (the table's 'POST /api/notifications/:id/read · /unread' row is two endpoints). Two items carried forward, unresolved here because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) every non-ADMIN, non-CRON_SECRET endpoint below calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) as the stand-in for a real requireUser() per system-design.md's Overview/Component 12 finding — src/server/auth/permissions.ts does not exist yet (only requireRole.ts's ADMIN-placeholder does), so 'own notifications only' / 'own preferences only' scoping is