{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HVjoSWPXrcZxfGfxSxu6ac","type":"tool_result","content":"201:## API\n202-\n203-| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n204-|---|---|---|\n205-| `GET /api/sections?academicYearId=` | ADMIN, TEACHER | |\n206-| `POST /api/sections` · `PATCH /api/sections/:id` · `DELETE /api/sections/:id` | ADMIN | Delete only when no members and no courses |\n207-| `POST /api/sections/:id/members` | ADMIN | `{ studentIds: string[], overrideCapacity? }` |\n208-| `DELETE /api/sections/:id/members/:studentId` | ADMIN | |\n209-| `POST /api/students/:id/move-section` | ADMIN | `{ toSectionId }` |\n210-| `POST /api/sections/:id/core-courses` | ADMIN | `{ items: [{ subjectId, teacherId }] }` |\n211-| `POST /api/sections/copy-to-year` | ADMIN | `{ fromYearId, toYearId }` |\n212-| `GET /api/courses` | ADMIN (all), others (own) | Filters + pagination |\n213-| `POST /api/courses` · `PATCH /api/courses/:id` | ADMIN | Archive via `{ archived: true }` |\n214-| `GET /api/courses/:id` | `assertCanViewCourse` | |\n215-| `GET /api/courses/:id/roster` | `assertCanViewCourse` | Shape depends on role |\n216-| `POST /api/courses/:id/enrollments` | ADMIN | `{ studentIds, overrideCapacity? }` |\n217-| `PATCH /api/enrollments/:id` | ADMIN | `{ status }` |\n218-| `GET /api/me/courses` | any | |\n219-\n220-All writes audit (`section.*`, `course.*`, `enrollment.*`).\n221-\n222-## Non-Functional Requirements\n223-\n224-1. **Integrity:** the one-section-per-year rule is enforced by the database unique constraint, not only in code.\n225-2. **Performance:** adding 30 students to a section with 8 core courses (240 enrollments) completes in under 1 second.\n226-3. **Privacy:** students see classmates' names only — no emails, admission numbers or profile links.\n227-\n228-## Acceptance Criteria\n229-\n230-1. Given section 7A with 6 core courses, when an admin adds Sam to 7A, then Sam has 6 ACTIVE enrollments.\n231-2. Given Sam is in 7A, when the admin moves Sam to 7B, then the 7A core enrollments are DROPPED, 7B's are ACTIVE, and Sam's elective enrollments are unchanged.\n232-3. Given Sam is already in 7A this year, when an admin tries to add Sam to 7B directly, then the request fails with `CONFLICT` \"Sam Student is already in section 7A for 2026–2027.\"\n233-4. Given a section at capacity, when an admin adds another student without override, then the request fails with the full message.\n234-5. Given Tom teaches Mathematics – 7A, when Tom opens `/my-courses`, then that course appears; when Tom opens a course he does not teach, then he gets the 403 page.\n235-6. Given Pat is Sam's parent, when Pat opens `/my-courses`, then Sam's courses are listed under Sam's name, and the Roster tab is not shown on the course page.\n236-7. Given a student opens the Roster tab, then only classmate names are displayed and the API response contains no emails.\n237-\n238-## Test Requirements\n239-\n240-- Unit: course code/name defaults, capacity check.\n241-- Integration: auto-enroll on section add, move-section transaction, reactivation of DROPPED enrollment, `getAccessibleStudentIds` for teachers.\nsrc/server/http.ts\n\nsrc/server:\naudit.ts\nauth\ncsv.ts\ndb.ts\nhttp.ts\nservices\n(eval):1: no matches found: src/server/http/*.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36f35059-30cc-4350-81e2-330ee67c124d","uuid":"4c208004-0ef7-4be7-9119-34eb17b09069","timestamp":"2026-10-27T16:32:31.272Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"201:## API\n202-\n203-| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n204-|---|---|---|\n205-| `GET /api/sections?academicYearId=` | ADMIN, TEACHER | |\n206-| `POST /api/sections` · `PATCH /api/sections/:id` · `DELETE /api/sections/:id` | ADMIN | Delete only when no members and no courses |\n207-| `POST /api/sections/:id/members` | ADMIN | `{ studentIds: string[], overrideCapacity? }` |\n208-| `DELETE /api/sections/:id/members/:studentId` | ADMIN | |\n209-| `POST /api/students/:id/move-section` | ADMIN | `{ to