{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X2F9zSY5wJf2Y4fNrn3RVD","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36f35059-30cc-4350-81e2-330ee67c124d","uuid":"1f0414db-1f5a-45f7-8884-44924a72dd12","timestamp":"2026-10-27T16:33:45.163Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-05\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md (REST API surface + Data Flow) and 05-classes-enrollment.md's API table; 17 endpoints (the table's '·'-joined rows are expanded). Conventions shared by every endpoint, not repeated per entry: (1) every handler is wrapped in withHandler() from src/server/http.ts, which maps ZodError->VALIDATION_ERROR 400, AppError->its code, Prisma P2002->CONFLICT 409, P2025->NOT_FOUND 404; (2) success = ok() -> { data }, lists = paginated() -> { data: [...], meta: { page, pageSize, total } } — the real helper nests pagination under `meta`, unlike the PRD's flat example; follow the helper; (3) list query conventions: page (default 1), pageSize (default 20, max 100), sort, order=asc|desc, q; (4) auth: every route calls requireRole(...) from src/server/auth/requireRole.ts (NFR-7 stand-in; no permissions.ts/requireUser()); course-scoped reads additionally call assertCanViewCourse from src/server/auth/course-access.ts (FR-18); (5) every write calls audit() inside the same $transaction (FR-24) via the service/engine, never at the route layer; (6) handlers are thin: zod parse -> one service call -> envelope. Shared shapes are named under `schemas` and referenced as \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/schemas/<Name>\\\".\",\n\n  \"schemas\": {\n    \"Section\": {\n      \"id\": \"string\", \"academicYearId\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"gradeLevel\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"order\": \"number\" },\n      \"name\": \"string\", \"homeroomTeacherId\": \"string|null\", \"homeroomTeacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" },\n      \"roomId\": \"string|null\", \"room\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"capacity\": \"number (1-60)\",\n      \"memberCount\": \"number\", \"courseCount\": \"number\", \"createdAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"updatedAt\": \"ISO 8601\"\n    },\n    \"SectionInput\": {\n      \"academicYearId\": \"string (required on create)\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string (min 1)\",\n      \"homeroomTeacherId\": \"string|null (must be role=TEACHER; at most one section per teacher per year -> CONFLICT)\",\n      \"roomId\": \"string|null\", \"capacity\": \"int 1-60, default 30\"\n    },\n    \"Course\": {\n      \"id\": \"string\", \"academicYearId\": \"string\", \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"subject\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"color\": \"string\" },\n      \"sectionId\": \"string|null\", \"section\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"room\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" } },\n      \"teacherId\": \"string\", \"teacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"coTeacherIds\": \"string[]\", \"coTeachers\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }],\n      \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"kind\": \"CORE|ELECTIVE\", \"description\": \"string|null\", \"capacity\": \"number|null\",\n      \"archivedAt\": \"ISO 8601|null\", \"enrolledCount\": \"number (ACTIVE only)\", \"createdAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"updatedAt\": \"ISO 8601\"\n    },\n    \"CourseInput\": {\n      \"academicYearId\": \"string (required on create)\", \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"sectionId\": \"string|null (required iff kind=CORE — single zod refinement shared with the dialog, FR-14)\",\n      \"teacherId\": \"string (role=TEACHER)\", \"coTeacherIds\": \"string[] (max 3, role=TEACHER)\", \"name\": \"string (default '<Subject> – <Section>')\",\n      \"code\": \"string (default '<SUBJECTCODE>-<SECTION>', transformed to uppercase; unique per year -> CONFLICT)\", \"kind\": \"CORE|ELECTIVE (default CORE)\",\n      \"capacity\": \"int>=1|null\", \"description\": \"string|null\"\n    },\n    \"Enrollment\": {\n      \"id\": \"string\", \"courseId\": \"string\", \"studentId\": \"string\", \"student\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"avatarUrl\": \"string|null\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string|null\" },\n      \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED\", \"enrolledAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"droppedAt\": \"ISO 8601|null\"\n    },\n    \"EnrollStudentsInput\": { \"studentIds\": \"string[] (min 1)\", \"overrideCapacity\": \"boolean (optional, default false)\" },\n    \"EnrollResult\": { \"enrolled\": \"number (new ACTIVE rows)\", \"reactivated\": \"number (DROPPED->ACTIVE)\", \"alreadyActive\": \"number\" },\n    \"CapacityConflict\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"CONFLICT\", \"message\": \"Section 7A is full (30/30). | Course MATH-7A is full (30/30).\" } }\n  },\n\n  \"endpoints\": [\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections\",\n      \"description\": \"List sections for an academic year (defaults to current). Roles: ADMIN, TEACHER. Service: sections-service.listSections.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"query\": { \"academicYearId\": \"string (optional, defaults to current AcademicYear)\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string (optional)\", \"q\": \"string (optional, name search)\", \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int<=100\", \"sort\": \"name|gradeLevel|memberCount (default gradeLevel)\", \"order\": \"asc|desc\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Section\" }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } }, \"403\": \"FORBIDDEN (STUDENT/PARENT)\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections\",\n      \"description\": \"Create a section. Role: ADMIN. Homeroom-teacher-per-year check runs inside the write transaction (system-design Decision 3). Audits section.create.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/SectionInput\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Section\" } }, \"409\": \"CONFLICT — duplicate name in year (P2002), or teacher already homeroom of another section this year\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-3\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"PATCH\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"Update a section (partial SectionInput, academicYearId immutable). Role: ADMIN. Capacity may not be lowered below current memberCount. Audits section.update.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": \"Partial<SectionInput> without academicYearId\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Section\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\", \"409\": \"CONFLICT (name/homeroom uniqueness)\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR (capacity < memberCount)\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-3\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"DELETE\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"Delete a section. Role: ADMIN. Allowed only when it has no members and no courses. Audits section.delete.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\", \"409\": \"CONFLICT — 'Section 7A still has members or courses.'\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id/members\",\n      \"description\": \"Add students to a section and auto-enroll them ACTIVE in every non-archived CORE course of the section (reactivating DROPPED rows), all in one $transaction via roster-engine.enrollSectionCoreCourses with batched createMany/updateMany. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.member.add + enrollment.*.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollStudentsInput\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"201\": { \"data\": { \"added\": \"number\", \"enrollments\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollResult\" } } },\n        \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }, \"CONFLICT — 'Sam Student is already in section 7A for 2026–2027.' (SectionMember @@unique P2002, mapped to the friendly message by the service)\"],\n        \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — student not role=STUDENT or wrong grade level\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\"\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-4\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-2\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"DELETE\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id/members/:studentId\",\n      \"description\": \"Remove a student from a section; their ACTIVE enrollments in this section's CORE courses become DROPPED with droppedAt=now (electives untouched) via roster-engine.dropSectionCoreCourses, same transaction. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.member.remove + enrollment.drop.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"studentId\": \"string\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"removed\": true, \"droppedEnrollments\": \"number\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND (student not a member)\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-4\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id/move-section\",\n      \"description\": \"Move a student to another section of the same academic year in a single $transaction: remove membership + drop source CORE enrollments, add membership + enroll/reactivate destination CORE enrollments (roster-engine.moveStudentSection). Electives unchanged. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.member.move + enrollment.*.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string (studentId)\" }, \"body\": { \"toSectionId\": \"string\", \"overrideCapacity\": \"boolean (optional, default false)\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"fromSectionId\": \"string\", \"toSectionId\": \"string\", \"dropped\": \"number\", \"enrollments\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollResult\" } } },\n        \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }],\n        \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — destination in a different academic year, or same as source\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND — student has no section this year, or toSectionId unknown\"\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id/core-courses\",\n      \"description\": \"Bulk-create one CORE course per item (default name '<Subject> – <Section>', code '<SUBJECTCODE>-<SECTION>') and enroll all current section members in each, one $transaction. Subjects must be non-archived. Role: ADMIN. Audits course.create + enrollment.* per course.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"items\": [{ \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"teacherId\": \"string (role=TEACHER)\" }], \"_constraints\": \"items min 1, subjectIds unique\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"courses\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" }], \"enrollmentsCreated\": \"number\" } }, \"409\": \"CONFLICT — course code already exists this year (P2002)\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-5\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/sections/copy-to-year\",\n      \"description\": \"Structural copy of all sections from one year to a future, non-current year: name, room, capacity copied; gradeLevel advanced to the next GradeLevel by `order` (sections at the top grade are skipped); no members, no homeroom teacher, no courses. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.create per copy.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"body\": { \"fromYearId\": \"string\", \"toYearId\": \"string (must be a future, non-current AcademicYear)\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"created\": \"number\", \"skipped\": [{ \"name\": \"string\", \"reason\": \"no next grade level | name already exists in target year\" }] } }, \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — toYearId is current or not in the future\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/courses\",\n      \"description\": \"List courses. ADMIN sees all; TEACHER sees courses they teach/co-teach; STUDENT/PARENT see courses with an ACTIVE enrollment for self/linked child (scoping done in courses-service, not by client filter). Excludes archived unless includeArchived=true (ADMIN only).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"query\": { \"academicYearId\": \"string (optional, default current)\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"teacherId\": \"string\", \"kind\": \"CORE|ELECTIVE\", \"sectionId\": \"string\", \"includeArchived\": \"boolean\", \"q\": \"string (name/code)\", \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int<=100\", \"sort\": \"code|name|enrolledCount\", \"order\": \"asc|desc\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/courses\",\n      \"description\": \"Create a course. Role: ADMIN. A new CORE course on a section enrolls all current section members ACTIVE in the same transaction (FR-10). Audits course.create (+ enrollment.* if CORE).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CourseInput\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" } }, \"409\": \"CONFLICT — code already used this year\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — e.g. kind=CORE without sectionId, >3 coTeachers\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"PATCH\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"Update a course (partial CourseInput; academicYearId/sectionId/kind immutable after creation to avoid silent roster rewrites). Archive via { archived: true } (sets archivedAt), unarchive via { archived: false }. Role: ADMIN. Audits course.update / course.archive.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": \"Partial<CourseInput> without academicYearId/sectionId/kind, plus archived?: boolean\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\", \"409\": \"CONFLICT (code)\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR (capacity < enrolledCount)\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"Course header/overview data for /courses/[courseId]. Gated by assertCanViewCourse (ADMIN all; TEACHER teacher/co-teacher; STUDENT ACTIVE enrollment; PARENT linked child ACTIVE enrollment).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" } }, \"403\": \"FORBIDDEN\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\", \"FR-17\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-23\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id/roster\",\n      \"description\": \"Course roster, ACTIVE enrollments by default. Gated by assertCanViewCourse; PARENT gets FORBIDDEN (Roster tab not shown). Shape from courses-service.getCourseRoster(id, viewerRole) — the same function the Roster tab server component uses.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"query\": { \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED|ALL (default ACTIVE; DROPPED/ALL only for ADMIN/TEACHER)\", \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int<=100\", \"q\": \"string\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200 (ADMIN, TEACHER)\": { \"data\": [{ \"enrollmentId\": \"string\", \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED\", \"enrolledAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"droppedAt\": \"ISO 8601|null\", \"student\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"avatarUrl\": \"string|null\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string|null\", \"profileUrl\": \"/students/:id\" } }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } },\n        \"200 (STUDENT)\": { \"data\": [{ \"name\": \"string\" }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" }, \"_privacy\": \"Projection is names only — no ids, emails, admission numbers, avatars or profile links; status forced to ACTIVE (NFR-4)\" },\n        \"403\": \"FORBIDDEN (no view access, or PARENT)\"\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id/enrollments\",\n      \"description\": \"Enroll students directly in a course (create or reactivate DROPPED; same semantics as the roster engine helper). Role: ADMIN. Refused for CORE courses (membership is managed via the section). Capacity checked via checkCapacityOrThrow. Audits enrollment.create / enrollment.reactivate.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollStudentsInput\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollResult\" } }, \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }, \"CONFLICT — 'Core course enrollment is managed via section 7A.'\"], \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — non-student ids\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"PATCH\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/enrollments/:id\",\n      \"description\": \"Drop or reactivate a single enrollment (DROPPED sets droppedAt=now; ACTIVE clears it and runs checkCapacityOrThrow). Historical data is retained either way. Role: ADMIN. Audits enrollment.drop / enrollment.reactivate.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED\", \"overrideCapacity\": \"boolean (optional, only meaningful for ACTIVE)\" } },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Enrollment\" } }, \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }], \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/me/courses\",\n      \"description\": \"Current user's courses for /my-courses, current academic year, non-archived. TEACHER: taught/co-taught; STUDENT: ACTIVE enrollments; PARENT: grouped by linked child; ADMIN: empty list (admins use /admin/courses). Role: any (requireRole(...ALL_ROLES), NFR-7 stand-in identity).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200 (TEACHER)\": { \"data\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"subjectColor\": \"string\", \"section\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"enrolledCount\": \"number\" }] },\n        \"200 (STUDENT)\": { \"data\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"subjectColor\": \"string\", \"teacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" } }] },\n        \"200 (PARENT)\": { \"data\": [{ \"child\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"courses\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"subjectColor\": \"string\", \"teacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" } }] }] }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-19\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":109,"newStart":1,"newLines":197,"lines":[" {","-  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-20T06:01:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-05\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:30:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\","," ","-  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (Components 3, 8, 11, 15, 16, 17) and 04-notifications.md's 'API' table, which fully specifies method/path/role/notes for all endpoints (the table's 'POST /api/notifications/:id/read · /unread' row is two endpoints) — 11 endpoints total, not the 12 mentioned in system-design.md's prose; the PRD table and FR-21's own endpoint list both enumerate 11, confirmed by direct count. Two items carried forward, unresolved here because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) every non-ADMIN, non-CRON_SECRET endpoint below calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) as the stand-in for a real requireUser() per system-design.md's Overview/Component 12 finding — src/server/auth/permissions.ts does not exist yet (confirmed: only requireRole.ts's ADMIN-placeholder and student-access.ts are present in src/server/auth/), so 'own notifications only' / 'own preferences only' scoping is written against the request's userId param today and must be swapped to the real session identity when PRD-01 lands, not re-derived; ALL_ROLES itself is a local const in src/config/navigation.ts today, not exported — dev-planning needs to export it (or import the four literals) for route call sites to use it; (2) list/count responses use the real paginated()/ok() shapes from src/server/http.ts (data + nested meta for lists, data for single resources), confirmed directly against src/server/http.ts and the existing src/app/api/users/route.ts pattern rather than assumed.\",","+  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md (REST API surface + Data Flow) and 05-classes-enrollment.md's API table; 17 endpoints (the table's '·'-joined rows are expanded). Conventions shared by every endpoint, not repeated per entry: (1) every handler is wrapped in withHandler() from src/server/http.ts, which maps ZodError->VALIDATION_ERROR 400, AppError->its code, Prisma P2002->CONFLICT 409, P2025->NOT_FOUND 404; (2) success = ok() -> { data }, lists = paginated() -> { data: [...], meta: { page, pageSize, total } } — the real helper nests pagination under `meta`, unlike the PRD's flat example; follow the helper; (3) list query conventions: page (default 1), pageSize (default 20, max 100), sort, order=asc|desc, q; (4) auth: every route calls requireRole(...) from src/server/auth/requireRole.ts (NFR-7 stand-in; no permissions.ts/requireUser()); course-scoped reads additionally call assertCanViewCourse from src/server/auth/course-access.ts (FR-18); (5) every write calls audit() inside the same $transaction (FR-24) via the service/engine, never at the route layer; (6) handlers are thin: zod parse -> one service call -> envelope. Shared shapes are named under `schemas` and referenced as \\\"$ref\\\": \\\"#/schemas/<Name>\\\".\","," ","-  \"conventions\": {","-    \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<resource or array>\" },","-    \"listEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"[...]\", \"meta\": { \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 20, \"total\": 0 } },","-    \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": {} } },","-    \"errorCodes\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR (400)\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED (401)\", \"FORBIDDEN (403)\", \"NOT_FOUND (404)\", \"CONFLICT (409)\", \"RATE_LIMITED (429)\", \"INTERNAL (500)\", \"INVALID_TOKEN (410)\"],","-    \"pagination\": \"?page= (default 1), ?pageSize= (default 20, max 100), per src/server/http.ts parsePagination()\",","-    \"auth\": \"Own-row routes call requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (placeholder for PRD-01's requireUser(); see note). ADMIN-only routes call requireRole('ADMIN') directly — already real today via src/server/auth/requireRole.ts. POST /api/internal/email/dispatch checks Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET} itself, not requireRole (NFR-8).\",","-    \"security\": \"Notification.link values are validated server-side as '/'-prefixed relative paths before any write that sets them (NFR-5); this is a notify()-time invariant (Component 3), not re-validated at the read endpoints below.\"","+  \"schemas\": {","+    \"Section\": {","+      \"id\": \"string\", \"academicYearId\": \"string\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"gradeLevel\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"order\": \"number\" },","+      \"name\": \"string\", \"homeroomTeacherId\": \"string|null\", \"homeroomTeacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" },","+      \"roomId\": \"string|null\", \"room\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"capacity\": \"number (1-60)\",","+      \"memberCount\": \"number\", \"courseCount\": \"number\", \"createdAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"updatedAt\": \"ISO 8601\"","+    },","+    \"SectionInput\": {","+      \"academicYearId\": \"string (required on create)\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string (min 1)\",","+      \"homeroomTeacherId\": \"string|null (must be role=TEACHER; at most one section per teacher per year -> CONFLICT)\",","+      \"roomId\": \"string|null\", \"capacity\": \"int 1-60, default 30\"","+    },","+    \"Course\": {","+      \"id\": \"string\", \"academicYearId\": \"string\", \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"subject\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"color\": \"string\" },","+      \"sectionId\": \"string|null\", \"section\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"room\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" } },","+      \"teacherId\": \"string\", \"teacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"coTeacherIds\": \"string[]\", \"coTeachers\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }],","+      \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"kind\": \"CORE|ELECTIVE\", \"description\": \"string|null\", \"capacity\": \"number|null\",","+      \"archivedAt\": \"ISO 8601|null\", \"enrolledCount\": \"number (ACTIVE only)\", \"createdAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"updatedAt\": \"ISO 8601\"","+    },","+    \"CourseInput\": {","+      \"academicYearId\": \"string (required on create)\", \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"sectionId\": \"string|null (required iff kind=CORE — single zod refinement shared with the dialog, FR-14)\",","+      \"teacherId\": \"string (role=TEACHER)\", \"coTeacherIds\": \"string[] (max 3, role=TEACHER)\", \"name\": \"string (default '<Subject> – <Section>')\",","+      \"code\": \"string (default '<SUBJECTCODE>-<SECTION>', transformed to uppercase; unique per year -> CONFLICT)\", \"kind\": \"CORE|ELECTIVE (default CORE)\",","+      \"capacity\": \"int>=1|null\", \"description\": \"string|null\"","+    },","+    \"Enrollment\": {","+      \"id\": \"string\", \"courseId\": \"string\", \"studentId\": \"string\", \"student\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"avatarUrl\": \"string|null\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string|null\" },","+      \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED\", \"enrolledAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"droppedAt\": \"ISO 8601|null\"","+    },","+    \"EnrollStudentsInput\": { \"studentIds\": \"string[] (min 1)\", \"overrideCapacity\": \"boolean (optional, default false)\" },","+    \"EnrollResult\": { \"enrolled\": \"number (new ACTIVE rows)\", \"reactivated\": \"number (DROPPED->ACTIVE)\", \"alreadyActive\": \"number\" },","+    \"CapacityConflict\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"CONFLICT\", \"message\": \"Section 7A is full (30/30). | Course MATH-7A is full (30/30).\" } }","   },"," ","   \"endpoints\": [","     {","       \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/notifications\",","-      \"description\": \"Any role. Own notifications only (userId scoped server-side). Backs both the /notifications page (paginated, filterable) and, with pageSize=10 and no filters, the bell popover's recent-10 list — one implementation (Component 11), not two query paths.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"unread\": \"boolean?\", \"category\": \"\\\"ACCOUNT\\\"|\\\"ACADEMIC\\\"|\\\"ATTENDANCE\\\"|\\\"COMMUNICATION\\\"|\\\"FINANCE\\\"|\\\"SYSTEM\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int? (default 1)\", \"pageSize\": \"int? (default 20, max 100)\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"type\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"title\": \"string\", \"body\": \"string|null\", \"link\": \"string|null\", \"readAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections\",","+      \"description\": \"List sections for an academic year (defaults to current). Roles: ADMIN, TEACHER. Service: sections-service.listSections.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"query\": { \"academicYearId\": \"string (optional, defaults to current AcademicYear)\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string (optional)\", \"q\": \"string (optional, name search)\", \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int<=100\", \"sort\": \"name|gradeLevel|memberCount (default gradeLevel)\", \"order\": \"asc|desc\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Section\" }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } }, \"403\": \"FORBIDDEN (STUDENT/PARENT)\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/unread-count\",","-      \"description\": \"Any role. Own count only. Backed by the Notification(userId, readAt, createdAt) composite index; must respond under 50ms (NFR-3). Polled by the bell every 30s while the tab is visible.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"count\": \"int\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"method\": \"POST\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections\",","+      \"description\": \"Create a section. Role: ADMIN. Homeroom-teacher-per-year check runs inside the write transaction (system-design Decision 3). Audits section.create.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/SectionInput\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Section\" } }, \"409\": \"CONFLICT — duplicate name in year (P2002), or teacher already homeroom of another section this year\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-3\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","     },","     {","+      \"method\": \"PATCH\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id\",","+      \"description\": \"Update a section (partial SectionInput, academicYearId immutable). Role: ADMIN. Capacity may not be lowered below current memberCount. Audits section.update.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": \"Partial<SectionInput> without academicYearId\" },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Section\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\", \"409\": \"CONFLICT (name/homeroom uniqueness)\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR (capacity < memberCount)\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-3\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","+    },","+    {","+      \"method\": \"DELETE\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id\",","+      \"description\": \"Delete a section. Role: ADMIN. Allowed only when it has no members and no courses. Audits section.delete.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\", \"409\": \"CONFLICT — 'Section 7A still has members or courses.'\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","+    },","+    {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/read\",","-      \"description\": \"Owner only (the notification's userId must match the caller). Sets readAt=now if not already set; idempotent. NOT_FOUND if the id doesn't belong to the caller (never reveals another user's notification exists).\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": \"datetime\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id/members\",","+      \"description\": \"Add students to a section and auto-enroll them ACTIVE in every non-archived CORE course of the section (reactivating DROPPED rows), all in one $transaction via roster-engine.enrollSectionCoreCourses with batched createMany/updateMany. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.member.add + enrollment.*.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollStudentsInput\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": {","+        \"201\": { \"data\": { \"added\": \"number\", \"enrollments\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollResult\" } } },","+        \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }, \"CONFLICT — 'Sam Student is already in section 7A for 2026–2027.' (SectionMember @@unique P2002, mapped to the friendly message by the service)\"],","+        \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — student not role=STUDENT or wrong grade level\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\"","+      },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-4\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-2\", \"NFR-3\"]","     },","     {","+      \"method\": \"DELETE\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id/members/:studentId\",","+      \"description\": \"Remove a student from a section; their ACTIVE enrollments in this section's CORE courses become DROPPED with droppedAt=now (electives untouched) via roster-engine.dropSectionCoreCourses, same transaction. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.member.remove + enrollment.drop.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"studentId\": \"string\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"removed\": true, \"droppedEnrollments\": \"number\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND (student not a member)\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-4\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","+    },","+    {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/unread\",","-      \"description\": \"Owner only. Clears readAt. Same ownership/NOT_FOUND rule as /read.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": null } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/students/:id/move-section\",","+      \"description\": \"Move a student to another section of the same academic year in a single $transaction: remove membership + drop source CORE enrollments, add membership + enroll/reactivate destination CORE enrollments (roster-engine.moveStudentSection). Electives unchanged. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.member.move + enrollment.*.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string (studentId)\" }, \"body\": { \"toSectionId\": \"string\", \"overrideCapacity\": \"boolean (optional, default false)\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": {","+        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"fromSectionId\": \"string\", \"toSectionId\": \"string\", \"dropped\": \"number\", \"enrollments\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollResult\" } } },","+        \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }],","+        \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — destination in a different academic year, or same as source\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND — student has no section this year, or toSectionId unknown\"","+      },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/read-all\",","-      \"description\": \"Any role. Sets readAt=now on every unread Notification row owned by the caller (bulk UPDATE, not per-row). Backs the popover footer's 'Mark all as read' and the /notifications page's bulk action.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"updatedCount\": \"int\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections/:id/core-courses\",","+      \"description\": \"Bulk-create one CORE course per item (default name '<Subject> – <Section>', code '<SUBJECTCODE>-<SECTION>') and enroll all current section members in each, one $transaction. Subjects must be non-archived. Role: ADMIN. Audits course.create + enrollment.* per course.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"items\": [{ \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"teacherId\": \"string (role=TEACHER)\" }], \"_constraints\": \"items min 1, subjectIds unique\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"courses\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" }], \"enrollmentsCreated\": \"number\" } }, \"409\": \"CONFLICT — course code already exists this year (P2002)\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-5\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-3\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",","-      \"description\": \"Any role. Returns the caller's NotificationPreference rows merged with Component 2's registry defaults for every type visible to the caller's role (so the client never has to do the merge).\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"type\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"label\": \"string\", \"description\": \"string\", \"mandatoryInApp\": \"boolean\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" } ] },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"method\": \"POST\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/sections/copy-to-year\",","+      \"description\": \"Structural copy of all sections from one year to a future, non-current year: name, room, capacity copied; gradeLevel advanced to the next GradeLevel by `order` (sections at the top grade are skipped); no members, no homeroom teacher, no courses. Role: ADMIN. Audits section.create per copy.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"body\": { \"fromYearId\": \"string\", \"toYearId\": \"string (must be a future, non-current AcademicYear)\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"created\": \"number\", \"skipped\": [{ \"name\": \"string\", \"reason\": \"no next grade level | name already exists in target year\" }] } }, \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — toYearId is current or not in the future\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-6\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"PUT\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",","-      \"description\": \"Any role. Upserts one {type, inApp, email} preference row for the caller. Rejects inApp=false for mandatoryInApp types with VALIDATION_ERROR (FR-22), independent of the disabled-Switch client affordance.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"type\": \"string (registry key, required)\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-19\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"method\": \"GET\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/courses\",","+      \"description\": \"List courses. ADMIN sees all; TEACHER sees courses they teach/co-teach; STUDENT/PARENT see courses with an ACTIVE enrollment for self/linked child (scoping done in courses-service, not by client filter). Excludes archived unless includeArchived=true (ADMIN only).\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"query\": { \"academicYearId\": \"string (optional, default current)\", \"gradeLevelId\": \"string\", \"subjectId\": \"string\", \"teacherId\": \"string\", \"kind\": \"CORE|ELECTIVE\", \"sectionId\": \"string\", \"includeArchived\": \"boolean\", \"q\": \"string (name/code)\", \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int<=100\", \"sort\": \"code|name|enrolledCount\", \"order\": \"asc|desc\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } } },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/internal/email/dispatch\",","-      \"description\": \"Requires Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET}; 401 via the standard error envelope on mismatch (NFR-8), not requireRole. Runs Component 8's dispatchEmails() once (recovers stuck SENDING rows, claims and sends a batch, applies retry backoff, runs the daily purge check). Called by an external scheduler or the npm run worker:email loop script.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"batchSize\": \"int? (default 50)\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"sent\": \"int\", \"failed\": \"int\", \"retried\": \"int\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-17\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-8\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/courses\",","+      \"description\": \"Create a course. Role: ADMIN. A new CORE course on a section enrolls all current section members ACTIVE in the same transaction (FR-10). Audits course.create (+ enrollment.* if CORE).\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CourseInput\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" } }, \"409\": \"CONFLICT — code already used this year\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — e.g. kind=CORE without sectionId, >3 coTeachers\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","     },","     {","+      \"method\": \"PATCH\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id\",","+      \"description\": \"Update a course (partial CourseInput; academicYearId/sectionId/kind immutable after creation to avoid silent roster rewrites). Archive via { archived: true } (sets archivedAt), unarchive via { archived: false }. Role: ADMIN. Audits course.update / course.archive.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": \"Partial<CourseInput> without academicYearId/sectionId/kind, plus archived?: boolean\" },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" } }, \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\", \"409\": \"CONFLICT (code)\", \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR (capacity < enrolledCount)\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","+    },","+    {","       \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Paginated EmailOutbox rows (created/recipient/subject/status/attempts/lastError), filterable by status.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"status\": \"\\\"PENDING\\\"|\\\"SENDING\\\"|\\\"SENT\\\"|\\\"FAILED\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int? (default 1)\", \"pageSize\": \"int? (default 20, max 100)\" },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\", \"recipient\": \"string\", \"subject\": \"string\", \"status\": \"string\", \"attempts\": \"int\", \"lastError\": \"string|null\", \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime|null\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id\",","+      \"description\": \"Course header/overview data for /courses/[courseId]. Gated by assertCanViewCourse (ADMIN all; TEACHER teacher/co-teacher; STUDENT ACTIVE enrollment; PARENT linked child ACTIVE enrollment).\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Course\" } }, \"403\": \"FORBIDDEN\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\", \"FR-17\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-23\"]","     },","     {","-      \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log/:id/retry\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Resets the row to attempts=0, status=PENDING, nextAttemptAt=now — the same shape Component 8's dispatcher expects on its next pass; this endpoint does not send anything itself.\",","-      \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"attempts\": 0, \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime\" } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"method\": \"GET\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id/roster\",","+      \"description\": \"Course roster, ACTIVE enrollments by default. Gated by assertCanViewCourse; PARENT gets FORBIDDEN (Roster tab not shown). Shape from courses-service.getCourseRoster(id, viewerRole) — the same function the Roster tab server component uses.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"query\": { \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED|ALL (default ACTIVE; DROPPED/ALL only for ADMIN/TEACHER)\", \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int<=100\", \"q\": \"string\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": {","+        \"200 (ADMIN, TEACHER)\": { \"data\": [{ \"enrollmentId\": \"string\", \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED\", \"enrolledAt\": \"ISO 8601\", \"droppedAt\": \"ISO 8601|null\", \"student\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"avatarUrl\": \"string|null\", \"admissionNumber\": \"string|null\", \"profileUrl\": \"/students/:id\" } }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } },","+        \"200 (STUDENT)\": { \"data\": [{ \"name\": \"string\" }], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" }, \"_privacy\": \"Projection is names only — no ids, emails, admission numbers, avatars or profile links; status forced to ACTIVE (NFR-4)\" },","+        \"403\": \"FORBIDDEN (no view access, or PARENT)\"","+      },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-4\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"POST\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/admin/notifications/test\",","-      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Calls Component 3's notify({ type: 'system.test', userIds: [caller.id], ... }) so the admin receives one in-app notification (and, per their own preferences, one EmailOutbox row) to verify delivery end to end.\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/courses/:id/enrollments\",","+      \"description\": \"Enroll students directly in a course (create or reactivate DROPPED; same semantics as the roster engine helper). Role: ADMIN. Refused for CORE courses (membership is managed via the section). Capacity checked via checkCapacityOrThrow. Audits enrollment.create / enrollment.reactivate.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollStudentsInput\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"201\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/EnrollResult\" } }, \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }, \"CONFLICT — 'Core course enrollment is managed via section 7A.'\"], \"400\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR — non-student ids\", \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-3\"]","+    },","+    {","+      \"method\": \"PATCH\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/enrollments/:id\",","+      \"description\": \"Drop or reactivate a single enrollment (DROPPED sets droppedAt=now; ACTIVE clears it and runs checkCapacityOrThrow). Historical data is retained either way. Role: ADMIN. Audits enrollment.drop / enrollment.reactivate.\",","+      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": \"string\" }, \"body\": { \"status\": \"ACTIVE|DROPPED\", \"overrideCapacity\": \"boolean (optional, only meaningful for ACTIVE)\" } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/Enrollment\" } }, \"409\": [{ \"$ref\": \"#/schemas/CapacityConflict\" }], \"404\": \"NOT_FOUND\" },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-23\", \"FR-24\"]","+    },","+    {","+      \"method\": \"GET\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/me/courses\",","+      \"description\": \"Current user's courses for /my-courses, current academic year, non-archived. TEACHER: taught/co-taught; STUDENT: ACTIVE enrollments; PARENT: grouped by linked child; ADMIN: empty list (admins use /admin/courses). Role: any (requireRole(...ALL_ROLES), NFR-7 stand-in identity).\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"queued\": true } },","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"responseSchema\": {","+        \"200 (TEACHER)\": { \"data\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"subjectColor\": \"string\", \"section\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"enrolledCount\": \"number\" }] },","+        \"200 (STUDENT)\": { \"data\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"subjectColor\": \"string\", \"teacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" } }] },","+        \"200 (PARENT)\": { \"data\": [{ \"child\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" }, \"courses\": [{ \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"code\": \"string\", \"subjectColor\": \"string\", \"teacher\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\" } }] }] }","+      },","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-19\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-7\"]","     }","   ],","   \"status\": \"complete\""]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-20T06:01:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"note\": \"Derived from system-design.md's Component Breakdown/Data Flow (Components 3, 8, 11, 15, 16, 17) and 04-notifications.md's 'API' table, which fully specifies method/path/role/notes for all endpoints (the table's 'POST /api/notifications/:id/read · /unread' row is two endpoints) — 11 endpoints total, not the 12 mentioned in system-design.md's prose; the PRD table and FR-21's own endpoint list both enumerate 11, confirmed by direct count. Two items carried forward, unresolved here because they are sequencing/confirmation items for dev-planning, not contract-shape questions: (1) every non-ADMIN, non-CRON_SECRET endpoint below calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) as the stand-in for a real requireUser() per system-design.md's Overview/Component 12 finding — src/server/auth/permissions.ts does not exist yet (confirmed: only requireRole.ts's ADMIN-placeholder and student-access.ts are present in src/server/auth/), so 'own notifications only' / 'own preferences only' scoping is written against the request's userId param today and must be swapped to the real session identity when PRD-01 lands, not re-derived; ALL_ROLES itself is a local const in src/config/navigation.ts today, not exported — dev-planning needs to export it (or import the four literals) for route call sites to use it; (2) list/count responses use the real paginated()/ok() shapes from src/server/http.ts (data + nested meta for lists, data for single resources), confirmed directly against src/server/http.ts and the existing src/app/api/users/route.ts pattern rather than assumed.\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<resource or array>\" },\n    \"listEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"[...]\", \"meta\": { \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 20, \"total\": 0 } },\n    \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": {} } },\n    \"errorCodes\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR (400)\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED (401)\", \"FORBIDDEN (403)\", \"NOT_FOUND (404)\", \"CONFLICT (409)\", \"RATE_LIMITED (429)\", \"INTERNAL (500)\", \"INVALID_TOKEN (410)\"],\n    \"pagination\": \"?page= (default 1), ?pageSize= (default 20, max 100), per src/server/http.ts parsePagination()\",\n    \"auth\": \"Own-row routes call requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (placeholder for PRD-01's requireUser(); see note). ADMIN-only routes call requireRole('ADMIN') directly — already real today via src/server/auth/requireRole.ts. POST /api/internal/email/dispatch checks Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET} itself, not requireRole (NFR-8).\",\n    \"security\": \"Notification.link values are validated server-side as '/'-prefixed relative paths before any write that sets them (NFR-5); this is a notify()-time invariant (Component 3), not re-validated at the read endpoints below.\"\n  },\n\n  \"endpoints\": [\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Own notifications only (userId scoped server-side). Backs both the /notifications page (paginated, filterable) and, with pageSize=10 and no filters, the bell popover's recent-10 list — one implementation (Component 11), not two query paths.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"unread\": \"boolean?\", \"category\": \"\\\"ACCOUNT\\\"|\\\"ACADEMIC\\\"|\\\"ATTENDANCE\\\"|\\\"COMMUNICATION\\\"|\\\"FINANCE\\\"|\\\"SYSTEM\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int? (default 1)\", \"pageSize\": \"int? (default 20, max 100)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"type\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"title\": \"string\", \"body\": \"string|null\", \"link\": \"string|null\", \"readAt\": \"datetime|null\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/unread-count\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Own count only. Backed by the Notification(userId, readAt, createdAt) composite index; must respond under 50ms (NFR-3). Polled by the bell every 30s while the tab is visible.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"count\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/read\",\n      \"description\": \"Owner only (the notification's userId must match the caller). Sets readAt=now if not already set; idempotent. NOT_FOUND if the id doesn't belong to the caller (never reveals another user's notification exists).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": \"datetime\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/:id/unread\",\n      \"description\": \"Owner only. Clears readAt. Same ownership/NOT_FOUND rule as /read.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"readAt\": null } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/notifications/read-all\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Sets readAt=now on every unread Notification row owned by the caller (bulk UPDATE, not per-row). Backs the popover footer's 'Mark all as read' and the /notifications page's bulk action.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"updatedCount\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Returns the caller's NotificationPreference rows merged with Component 2's registry defaults for every type visible to the caller's role (so the client never has to do the merge).\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"type\": \"string\", \"category\": \"string\", \"label\": \"string\", \"description\": \"string\", \"mandatoryInApp\": \"boolean\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" } ] },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"PUT\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",\n      \"description\": \"Any role. Upserts one {type, inApp, email} preference row for the caller. Rejects inApp=false for mandatoryInApp types with VALIDATION_ERROR (FR-22), independent of the disabled-Switch client affordance.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"type\": \"string (registry key, required)\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"inApp\": \"boolean\", \"email\": \"boolean\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-19\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/internal/email/dispatch\",\n      \"description\": \"Requires Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET}; 401 via the standard error envelope on mismatch (NFR-8), not requireRole. Runs Component 8's dispatchEmails() once (recovers stuck SENDING rows, claims and sends a batch, applies retry backoff, runs the daily purge check). Called by an external scheduler or the npm run worker:email loop script.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"batchSize\": \"int? (default 50)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"sent\": \"int\", \"failed\": \"int\", \"retried\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-17\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Paginated EmailOutbox rows (created/recipient/subject/status/attempts/lastError), filterable by status.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": { \"status\": \"\\\"PENDING\\\"|\\\"SENDING\\\"|\\\"SENT\\\"|\\\"FAILED\\\"?\", \"page\": \"int? (default 1)\", \"pageSize\": \"int? (default 20, max 100)\" },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": [ { \"id\": \"string\", \"createdAt\": \"datetime\", \"recipient\": \"string\", \"subject\": \"string\", \"status\": \"string\", \"attempts\": \"int\", \"lastError\": \"string|null\", \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime|null\" } ], \"meta\": { \"page\": \"int\", \"pageSize\": \"int\", \"total\": \"int\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/admin/email-log/:id/retry\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Resets the row to attempts=0, status=PENDING, nextAttemptAt=now — the same shape Component 8's dispatcher expects on its next pass; this endpoint does not send anything itself.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"attempts\": 0, \"nextAttemptAt\": \"datetime\" } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/admin/notifications/test\",\n      \"description\": \"ADMIN only. Calls Component 3's notify({ type: 'system.test', userIds: [caller.id], ... }) so the admin receives one in-app notification (and, per their own preferences, one EmailOutbox row) to verify delivery end to end.\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"queued\": true } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01X2F9zSY5wJf2Y4fNrn3RVD","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
