 \"Every existing route handler (33 route.ts files) changes from requireRole(...) to await requireRole(...), backed by the real session. Paths, request shapes and response shapes don't change. New possible responses on all of them:\",\n    \"responses\": {\n      \"401\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"UNAUTHENTICATED\" }, \"source\": \"middleware (no session) or requireUser/requireRole (session revoked)\" },\n      \"403\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"FORBIDDEN\" }, \"source\": \"requireRole role mismatch, or the middleware cross-origin check on mutations\" }\n    },\n    \"unchanged\": [\"/api/health stays public\"],\n    \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-28\", \"FR-29\", \"NFR-7\", \"NFR-9\"]\n  },\n\n  \"explicitlyAbsent\": [\n    { \"item\": \"No sign-up / register endpoint\", \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-37\"] },\n    { \"item\": \"No admin user-management, SSO, MFA or magic-link endpoints\", \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-11\"] },\n    { \"item\": \"No /api/v1 prefix; existing /api convention kept\", \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-9\"] }\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n"}}}
