d-05\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:31:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-1\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T00:04:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\","," ","   \"status\": \"complete\",","-  \"endpointCount\": 17,","+  \"endpointCount\": 8,","+  \"artifacts\": [","+    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",","+    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",","+    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",","+    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"","+  ],","+  \"notes\": [","+    \"8 endpoints: 4 Auth.js protocol endpoints served by the single /api/auth/[...nextauth] route file, plus 4 custom route files (accept-invite, forgot-password, reset-password, account/password).\",","+    \"Intake blockers FR-1, FR-25 and FR-28/29 were resolved in system-design.md (additive migration, keep the existing users.ts signatures, async requireRole with 50 awaited call sites in 43 files).\",","+    \"The existing 33 route handlers keep their paths and shapes but gain 401/403 responses (see changedBehaviourOnExistingEndpoints).\"","+  ],","   \"blockers\": [","-    {","-      \"severity\": \"advisory\",","-      \"description\": \"NFR-7 (carried from intake, resolved as system-design Decision 2): routes use the requireRole(...) stand-in from src/server/auth/requireRole.ts; course-scoped reads add assertCanViewCourse from the new src/server/auth/course-access.ts. No permissions.ts/requireUser() is introduced here — that consolidation belongs to PRD-01. Identity-dependent scoping (GET /api/me/courses, GET /api/courses non-ADMIN, roster role projection) inherits the stand-in's single-identity behaviour until PRD-01 lands.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"severity\": \"advisory\",","-      \"description\": \"FR-20 (carried from intake, resolved as system-design Decision 1): add optional `group?: string` to NavItem in src/config/navigation.ts; 'Sections'/'Courses' get group 'Administration' (ADMIN only), 'My courses' stays ungrouped. No API impact.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"severity\": \"advisory\",","-      \"description\": \"List envelope: the PRD shows flat { data, page, pageSize, total }, but the real paginated() helper in src/server/http.ts returns { data, meta: { page, pageSize, total } }. Contracts follow the helper; do not hand-roll the PRD shape.\"","-    },","-    {","-      \"severity\": \"advisory\",","-      \"description\": \"Contract-level decisions not spelled out in the PRD (dev-planning should implement as written in api-contracts.json): POST /api/courses/:id/enrollments refuses CORE courses with CONFLICT; PATCH /api/courses/:id treats sectionId/kind/academicYearId as immutable; move-section and PATCH /api/enrollments/:id accept optional overrideCapacity; GET /api/me/courses returns an empty list for ADMIN; copy-to-year skips top-grade sections and reports them in `skipped`.\"","-    }","+    \"NFR-6 (carried forward, not blocking dev-planning): Dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and stop and report it if not.\"","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-05\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:31:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 17,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"NFR-7 (carried from intake, resolved as system-design Decision 2): routes use the requireRole(...) stand-in from src/server/auth/requireRole.ts; course-scoped reads add assertCanViewCourse from the new src/server/auth/course-access.ts. No permissions.ts/requireUser() is introduced here — that consolidation belongs to PRD-01. Identity-dependent scoping (GET /api/me/courses, GET /api/courses non-ADMIN, roster role projection) inherits the stand-in's single-identity behaviour until PRD-01 lands.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"FR-20 (carried from intake, resolved as system-design Decision 1): add optional `group?: string` to NavItem in src/config/navigation.ts; 'Sections'/'Courses' get group 'Administration' (ADMIN only), 'My courses' stays ungrouped. No API impact.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"List envelope: the PRD shows flat { data, page, pageSize, total }, but the real paginated() helper in src/server/http.ts returns { data, meta: { page, pageSize, total } }. Contracts follow the helper; do not hand-roll the PRD shape.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"advisory\",\n      \"description\": \"Contract-level decisions not spelled out in the PRD (dev-planning should implement as written in api-contracts.json): POST /api/courses/:id/enrollments refuses CORE courses with CONFLICT; PATCH /api/courses/:id treats sectionId/kind/academicYearId as immutable; move-section and PATCH /api/enrollments/:id accept optional overrideCapacity; GET /api/me/courses returns an empty list for ADMIN; copy-to-year skips top-grade sections and reports them in `skipped`.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KGjTBNhcMUhmhPr9jjGJZY","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
