{"duration_api_ms":72007,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"579a4bd9-1ad7-4baf-96fe-8a4735bbff00","total_cost_usd":0.6329224000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":18,"cache_creation_input_tokens":47549,"cache_read_input_tokens":378992,"output_tokens":8833,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":439},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":47549,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":59589,"cache_creation_input_tokens":706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":706},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":8833,"cacheReadInputTokens":378992,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47549,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6329224000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":439,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":47549,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":11,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've written `api-contracts.json` and then `handoff-to-dev-planning.json` for ticket abcd-1, both with status `complete`, so the architect phase is finished. Both files replaced versions left over from ticket abcd-05.\n\n`api-contracts.json` defines 8 endpoints:\n- **4 sign-in endpoints from the auth library, all served by one route file (`/api/auth/[...nextauth]`):**\n  - `GET /api/auth/csrf`\n  - `GET /api/auth/session`\n  - `POST /api/auth/callback/credentials`\n  - `POST /api/auth/signout`\n- **4 custom endpoints:**\n  - `POST /api/auth/accept-invite`\n  - `POST /api/auth/forgot-password`\n  - `POST /api/auth/reset-password`\n  - `POST /api/account/password`\n\nEvery requirement id cited in the contracts exists in `requirements.json`, and the file parses as valid JSON.\n\nChoices I made that differ from the template or need attention:\n- **Paths:** I kept the project's existing `/api/...` paths instead of the template's `/api/v1/...`, because the requirements forbid renaming routes (NFR-9).\n- **Sign-up:** the contracts say explicitly that there is no sign-up endpoint (FR-37).\n- **Existing endpoints:** the 33 existing route handlers keep their paths and shapes but can now return 401 (not signed in) and 403 (wrong role). I recorded this in a `changedBehaviourOnExistingEndpoints` section.\n- **Blocker carried forward:** the developer must confirm the MUI docs server (`mui-mcp`) is reachable before writing any UI (NFR-6). This doesn't block planning.\n- **Old planning files:** `artifacts/dev-planning/*` still belong to ticket abcd-05. They will be stale until the dev-planning phase runs for abcd-1.","ttft_ms":1785,"type":"result","duration_ms":75808,"uuid":"cdeaff58-a7e9-4d7b-afec-ba14098268f5","ttft_stream_ms":890,"time_to_request_ms":92,"first_content_frame_ms":890,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":8833,"cacheReadInputTokens":378992,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47549,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6329224000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":439,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":47549,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
