ack-relations on Course, Period and Room. @dnd-kit/core must be added as a pinned dependency.\",\n    \"NFR-5: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fbc9b880-e954-4c6c-9604-bc78956eb872","uuid":"c1a93af3-40a7-4f08-bae1-bdc498afa690","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:19:13.579Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"artifacts/:\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x   7 ikramaansari  staff   224 Oct 16 20:20 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 63 ikramaansari  staff  2016 Nov  4 20:31 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   8 ikramaansari  staff   256 Nov  5 10:18 architect\ndrwxr-xr-x   5 ikramaansari  staff   160 Nov  4 19:59 dev\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 ikramaansari  staff   192 Nov  4 12:06 dev-planning\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 ikramaansari  staff   192 Nov  5 10:13 intake\ndrwxr-xr-x   7 ikramaansari  staff   224 Oct 16 20:25 telemetry\n\nartifacts/architect/:\ntotal 200\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  5 10:18 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff    224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  14194 Nov  4 12:04 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   1407 Nov  4 12:05 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  21939 Nov  5 10:15 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  34096 Nov  5 10:18 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  13355 Nov  5 10:15 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff    396 Nov  4 12:05 threat-model-notes.json\n\nartifacts/dev-planning/:\ntotal 72\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 ikramaansari  staff    192 Nov  4 12:06 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff    224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   5623 Nov  4 12:06 file-ownership-matrix.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   5201 Nov  4 12:06 file-structure.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  16017 Nov  4 12:06 implementation-plan.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  st