T-7A.\",\n    \"FR-21: No listed API returns free rooms for a day/period. The Architect should pick the smallest option (recommended: ADMIN-only GET /api/timetable/free-rooms).\",\n    \"FR-7: The confirmation slot count is not covered by the API. Default: GET /api/school-days includes slotCount per day.\",\n    \"FR-4/NFR-6: A new additive migration is needed, with back-relations on Course, Period and Room. @dnd-kit/core must be added as a pinned dependency.\",\n    \"NFR-5: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01S6s6Gwjz7VK3nKCQPvJANq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
