{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CYS9KeNaZYTmqHyNNQ7HJg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"id\": \"FR-1\", \"description\": \"Add enum PeriodKind { CLASS BREAK LUNCH ASSEMBLY } and model Period (name, startTime/endTime 'HH:MM' strings in school timezone, kind default CLASS, order Int @unique, createdAt/updatedAt) exactly as specified.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7Functional Requirements FR-1 Data model\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-2\", \"description\": \"Add model SchoolDay { dayOfWeek Int @id (ISO 1=Mon\\u20267=Sun), isTeaching Boolean @default(true) }.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-1 Data model\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-3\", \"description\": \"Add model TimetableSlot (academicYearId, courseId \\u2192 Course onDelete Cascade, dayOfWeek 1\\u20137, periodId \\u2192 Period, roomId? \\u2192 Room, timestamps) with @@unique([courseId, dayOfWeek, periodId]) and @@index([academicYearId, dayOfWeek, periodId]).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-1 Data model\"}\nFR-4\n{\"id\": \"FR-5\", \"description\": \"Bell schedule page /admin/timetable/periods (ADMIN): an ordered MUI Table of periods (name, start, end, kind) with add / edit / delete / reorder. Times are edited with MUI X TimeField.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-2.1\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-6\", \"description\": \"Period validation (shared Zod + service): times are 'HH:MM' 24-hour, endTime is after startTime, and periods must not overlap any other period.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-2.2\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-7\", \"description\": \"Teaching days editor: seven MUI ToggleButtons (Mon\\u2013Sun). Turning off a day that has slots shows a confirmation with the number of slots to be removed, and confirming deletes those slots and marks the day non-teaching.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-2.3; Acceptance Criteria 6\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-8\", \"description\": \"Deleting a period that still has slots is refused with 409 CONFLICT, and the message/details give the count of affected slots.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-2.4\"}\nFR-9\nFR-10\nFR-11\nFR-12\nFR-13\n{\"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"validateSlot(input) in src/server/timetable/timetable-service.ts returns ALL clashes (not just the first). When moving a slot (PATCH), the slot itself is excluded from comparison.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-3 (closing sentence); FR-4.3 move\"}\nFR-15\nFR-16\nFR-17\nFR-18\nFR-19\n{\"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"If the server rejects a drop or move, the card snaps back and an error toast (useToast) lists every clash returned in details.clashes[].\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-4.5\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"Clicking a slot opens an MUI Popover with an Autocomplete to change the room. The picker lists only rooms free at that day/period.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD FR-4.6\"}\nFR-22\nFR-23\nFR-24\nFR-25\nFR-26\nFR-27\nFR-28\nFR-29\nFR-30\nFR-31\nFR-32\n{\"id\": \"FR-33\", \"description\": \"Periods API: GET /api/periods (any role, ordered). POST /api/periods, PATCH and DELETE /api/periods/:id, and POST /api/periods/reorder { periodIds } are ADMIN only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-34\", \"description\": \"School days API: GET /api/school-days (any role) and PUT /api/school-days (ADMIN).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-35\", \"description\": \"GET /api/timetable?view=section|teacher|room&id=&academicYearId= returns slots with course, teacher and room. ADMIN may use any view. TEACHER may use only their own teacher view and sections they are homeroom teacher of; anything else is 403.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-36\", \"description\": \"GET /api/timetable/availability?courseId= (ADMIN) returns { '<day>-<periodId>': [clash messages] } for that course's academic year.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API; FR-4.4\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-37\", \"description\": \"Slots API (ADMIN): POST /api/timetable/slots { courseId, dayOfWeek, periodId, roomId? }, PATCH /api/timetable/slots/:id and DELETE /api/timetable/slots/:id. A clash returns 409 CONFLICT with details.clashes[] and saves nothing. academicYearId is derived from the course server-side.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API; Acceptance Criteria 1\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-38\", \"description\": \"GET /api/me/timetable?studentId= (any role) returns the caller's own timetable. studentId is required for a PARENT with multiple children and must be a linked child; otherwise 403.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"PRD \\u00a7API; Roles\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-39\", \"description\": \"Zod schemas for periods, school days, slots and timetable queries live in src/lib/validators/timetable.ts, shared by the forms and the handlers.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"Platform Context \\u00a7Fixed technology decisions (Validation) and \\u00a7Code layout\"}\n{\"id\": \"FR-40\", \"description\": \"Write AuditLog rows via audit() for slot create/move/delete, period create/update/delete/reorder, and teaching-day changes (including the cascade-deleted slot count).\", \"confidence\": \"LOW\", \"source\": \"Platform Context \\u00a7Code layout ('Mutations that change records owned by someone else write an AuditLog row'). Whether school-wide admin config counts as 'owned by someone else' is assumed.\"}\nFR-41\nFR-42\nFR-43\nFR-44\nFR-45\nNFR-1\nNFR-2\nNFR-3\nNFR-4\nNFR-5\nNFR-6\n{\"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"Security: every handler and server page enforces role and per-entity access server-side via requireUser/requireRole and the existing access helpers. Hiding UI is never the only protection.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Platform Context \\u00a7Code layout (requireRole) and \\u00a7Roles\"}\n{\"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"API conventions: thin handlers (Zod \\u2192 service \\u2192 JSON), the { data } / { error: { code, message, details } } shape, and the standard error codes (409 CONFLICT for clashes and for period delete-with-slots).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Platform Context \\u00a7Code layout\"}\nNFR-9\nNFR-10\nNFR-11\nNFR-12\nNFR-13\nNFR-14\nNFR-15\nNFR-16\n{\n \"method\": \"GET\",\n \"path\": \"/api/notifications\",\n \"routeFile\": \"src/app/api/notifications/route.ts\",\n \"description\": \"Paginated list of the caller's own notifications, newest first. 'unread=true' gives readAt IS NULL, and 'category' gives type IN typesInCategory(category).\",\n \"auth\": \"requireUser\",\n \"requestSchema\": {\n  \"query\": {\n   \"unread\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"enum\": [\n     \"true\",\n     \"false\"\n    ],\n    \"optional\": true\n   },\n   \"category\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"enum\": [\n     \"ACCOUNT\",\n     \"ACADEMIC\",\n     \"ATTENDANCE\",\n     \"COMMUNICATION\",\n     \"FINANCE\",\n     \"SYSTEM\"\n    ],\n    \"optional\": true\n   },\n   \"page\": {\n    \"type\": \"integer\",\n    \"minimum\": 1,\n    \"default\": 1\n   },\n   \"pageSize\": {\n    \"type\": \"integer\",\n    \"minimum\": 1,\n    \"maximum\": 100,\n    \"default\": 20\n   }\n  }\n },\n \"responseSchema\": {\n  \"data\": {\n   \"type\": \"array\",\n   \"items\": {\n    \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Notification\"\n   }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n   \"page\": \"integer\",\n   \"pageSize\": \"integer\",\n   \"total\": \"integer\"\n  }\n },\n \"errors\": [\n  \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n  \"UNAUTHENTICATED\"\n ],\n \"requirementIds\": [\n  \"FR-34\",\n  \"FR-24\",\n  \"FR-26\",\n  \"NFR-11\"\n ]\n}\ndict_keys(['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'conventions', 'sharedSchemas', 'endpoints', 'nonHttpContracts', 'status'])","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fbc9b880-e954-4c6c-9604-bc78956eb872","uuid":"867d5855-213a-4e5e-9336-840639