 \"src/app/api/notifications/[id]/unread/route.ts\",","-      \"description\": \"Marks one notification unread (readAt = null). Same owner scoping and 404 rule as /read.\",","-      \"auth\": \"requireUser (owner only)\",","-      \"requestSchema\": { \"params\": { \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } },","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"id\"], \"properties\": { \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } } },","-      \"errors\": [\"UNAUTHENTICATED\", \"NOT_FOUND\"],","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-36\", \"FR-26\"]","+      \"path\": \"/api/periods/reorder\",","+      \"routeFile\": \"src/app/api/periods/reorder/route.ts\",","+      \"description\": \"Set display order from the full id list (index 0 → order 1). The id set must equal the existing set exactly, else 400. Two-phase write in one transaction. Audited as period.reorder.\",","+      \"auth\": \"requireRole('ADMIN')\",","+      \"requestSchema\": {","+        \"body\": { \"periodIds\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": \"string\", \"minItems\": 1, \"uniqueItems\": true } },","+        \"zod\": \"periodReorderSchema\"","+      },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Period\" } } },","+      \"errors\": [\"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", \"FORBIDDEN\"],","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-33\", \"FR-5\", \"FR-40\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"GET\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",","-      \"routeFile\": \"src/app/api/me/notification-preferences/route.ts\",","-      \"description\": \"Returns visibleTypesFor(me.role) (registry types with the caller's role, excluding emailOnly) merged with the caller's NotificationPreference rows through resolvePrefs. It is not paginated because the registry is small.\",","-      \"auth\": \"requireUser\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/school-days\",","+      \"routeFile\": \"src/app/api/school-days/route.ts\",","+      \"description\": \"All 7 days, Mon→Sun, each with slotCount (all academic years) so the confirm dialog can show how many slots switching a day off will remove.\",","+      \"auth\": \"requireUser (any role)\",","       \"requestSchema\": {},","-      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NotificationPreferenceItem\" } } },","+      \"responseSchema\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/SchoolDayWithCount\" }, \"length\": 7 } },","       \"errors\": [\"UNAUTHENTICATED\"],","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-37\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-28\", \"FR-29\"]","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-34\", \"FR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"method\": \"PUT\",","-      \"path\": \"/api/me/notification-preferences\",","-      \"routeFile\": \"src/app/api/me/notification-preferences/route.ts\",","-      \"description\": \"Upserts one preference on userId_type. It returns VALIDATION_ERROR for an unknown type, an emailOnly type, a type not visible to the caller's role, or inApp=false on a mandatoryInApp type.\",","-      \"auth\": \"requireUser\",","+      \"path\": \"/api/school-days\",","+      \"routeFile\": \"src/app/api/school-days/route.ts\",","+      \"description\": \"Replace all 7 teaching flags. In one transaction, deletes every slot (all years) on days switching true→false, then updates the rows. Audited as schoolDay.update { changed, deletedSlotCount }.\",","+      \"auth\": \"requireRole('ADMIN')\",","       \"requestSchema\": {","-        \"body\": {","-          \"type\": \"object\",","-          \"required\": [\"type\", \"inApp\", \"email\"],","-          \"additionalProperties\": false,","-          \"properties\": { \"type\": { \"type\": \"string\" }, \"inApp\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" }, \"email\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" } },","-          \"zod\": \"updatePreferenceBody (src/lib/validators/notifications.ts)\"","+        \"body\": { \"days\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"$