ck dev-planning): dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is not.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":11,"newStart":1,"newLines":11,"lines":[" {","-  \"ticketId\": \"SH-4\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T12:31:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"SH-6\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T06:21:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\","," ","   \"status\": \"complete\",","-  \"endpointCount\": 11,","+  \"endpointCount\": 14,","   \"artifacts\": [","     \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",","     \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\","]},{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":13,"newStart":13,"newLines":13,"lines":["     \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"","   ],","   \"notes\": [","-    \"11 endpoints in 9 route files: 5 user notification endpoints, GET/PUT for preferences, 3 ADMIN endpoints and 1 CRON_SECRET-gated internal dispatch endpoint. All of them sit under /api with no /v1 and reuse the ok/paginated/apiError envelopes from src/server/http.ts. No new error codes.\",","-    \"Intake blockers FR-1, FR-4/FR-16 and FR-40 are resolved in system-design.md: one additive migration, sendAuthEmail enqueues directly and still throws, and the seed creates 3 per user and skips users that are missing.\",","-    \"New finding B1: '/api/internal/' must be added to PUBLIC_API_PATHS, otherwise the middleware returns 401 to cron before the dispatch handler runs.\",","-    \"Earlier dev-planning artifacts on disk belong to ticket abcd-1 and must be regenerated for SH-4.\"","+    \"14 endpoints in 10 route files, all under /api (no /v1), using the existing ok()/apiError envelopes from src/server/http.ts. CONFLICT (409) already exists, so no new error codes are needed.\",","+    \"The intake blockers are resolved in system-design.md: FR-21 is handled by the new ADMIN GET /api/timetable/free-rooms (D1), FR-7 by slotCount in GET /api/school-days (D3), FR-44/FR-43 by the accepted seed defaults, and FR-4/NFR-6 by one additive migration plus exact-pinned @dnd-kit/core@6.3.1.\",","+    \"GET /api/timetable/availability takes an optional roomId (D2), which goes beyond the PRD's courseId-only signature.\",","+    \"The api-contracts.json and handoff files previously on disk belonged to SH-4 and have been replaced. The dev-planning and dev artifacts on disk are also stale and must be regenerated for SH-6.\"","   ],","   \"blockers\": [","-    \"NFR-10 (carried forward, does not block dev-planning): dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is not.\"","+    \"NFR-5 (carried forward, does not block dev-planning): dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is not.\"","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-4\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T12:31:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 11,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"11 endpoints in 9 route files: 5 user notification endpoints, GET/PUT for preferences, 3 ADMIN endpoints and 1 CRON_SECRET-gated internal dispatch endpoint. All of them sit under /api with no /v1 and reuse the ok/paginated/apiError envelopes from src/server/http.ts. No new error codes.\",\n    \"Intake blockers FR-1, FR-4/FR-16 and FR-40 are resolved in system-design.md: one additive migration, sendAuthEmail enqueues directly and still throws, and the seed creates 3 per user and skips users that are missing.\",\n    \"New finding B1: '/api/internal/' must be added to PUBLIC_API_PATHS, otherwise the middleware returns 401 to cron before the dispatch handler runs.\",\n    \"Earlier dev-planning artifacts on disk belong to ticket abcd-1 and must be regenerated for SH-4.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-10 (carried forward, does not block dev-planning): dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is not.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DoidC11BSBLpEizZjgiEfe","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
