{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDeyH2THPK118NZ4U5J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written the API contracts for SH-6 and the handoff file, so the architect phase is complete. A script check confirmed the contracts file is valid JSON and every requirement id it cites exists in `requirements.json`.\n\n- **`api-contracts.json`**: 14 endpoints across 10 route files, all under `/api` with no `/v1`, following the project's existing convention:\n  - **Periods** (5): `GET`/`POST /api/periods`, `PATCH`/`DELETE /api/periods/{id}`, `POST /api/periods/reorder`. Deleting a period that still has slots returns 409 with `{ slotCount }`.\n  - **School days** (2): `GET`/`PUT /api/school-days`. `GET` includes a slot count per day, which the confirm dialog needs.\n  - **Viewing timetables** (2): `GET /api/timetable` and `GET /api/me/timetable`, with the per-role access rules written into each contract.\n  - **Editor support** (2): `GET /api/timetable/availability` (optional `roomId`) and `GET /api/timetable/free-rooms`.\n  - **Slots** (3): `POST /api/timetable/slots`, `PATCH`/`DELETE /api/timetable/slots/{id}`. A clash returns 409 and lists every clash in `details.clashes[]`.\n  - It also documents the three service functions later PRDs will call directly (`getScheduleForDate`, `getCurrentSlot`, `validateSlot`).\n- **`handoff-to-dev-planning.json`**: status complete, 14 endpoints, next phase dev-planning.\n\nThings to know:\n- **Two endpoints differ from the PRD:**\n  - `free-rooms` is a new admin-only endpoint that resolves intake's open question for the room picker.\n  - `availability` takes an optional `roomId` the PRD doesn't mention, so the red cells shown while dragging match what the server will actually accept.\n- **Old files replaced:** the contracts and handoff files that were already in `artifacts/architect/` belonged to ticket SH-4, and I overwrote them. The files in `artifacts/dev-planning/` and `artifacts/dev/` are also from earlier tickets and need to be regenerated for SH-6.\n- **Open blocker (NFR-5):** before writing any UI, dev must confirm the mui-mcp docs server is reachable and stop if it isn't. This doesn't hold up dev-planning."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":850,"cache_read_input_tokens":62021,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":850},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fbc9b880-e954-4c6c-9604-bc78956eb872","uuid":"f7d00859-c8f6-452a-b6f9-46e61b72ebd1","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:20:55.347Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDexj39ieVMeGzwJQL9"}
