1), using the existing ok()/apiError envelopes from src/server/http.ts. CONFLICT (409) already exists, so no new error codes are needed.\",\n    \"The intake blockers are resolved in system-design.md: FR-21 is handled by the new ADMIN GET /api/timetable/free-rooms (D1), FR-7 by slotCount in GET /api/school-days (D3), FR-44/FR-43 by the accepted seed defaults, and FR-4/NFR-6 by one additive migration plus exact-pinned @dnd-kit/core@6.3.1.\",\n    \"GET /api/timetable/availability takes an optional roomId (D2), which goes beyond the PRD's courseId-only signature.\",\n    \"The api-contracts.json and handoff files previously on disk belonged to SH-4 and have been replaced. The dev-planning and dev artifacts on disk are also stale and must be regenerated for SH-6.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-5 (carried forward, does not block dev-planning): dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is not.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-6\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T05:20:55.948Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"consideredKeywords\": [\n    \"authentication\",\n    \"authorization\",\n    \"encryption\",\n    \"pii\",\n    \"secrets\",\n    \"input validation\"\n  ],\n  \"missingConsiderations\": [\n    \"authentication\",\n    \"authorization\",\n    \"encryption\",\n    \"pii\",\n    \"secrets\",\n    \"input validation\"\n  ]\n}{\n  \"intake-main\": {\n    \"sessionId\": \"11ca0c89-dbfd-4c24-b1d8-a82da51658f9\",\n    \"ts\": \"2026-11-05T06:36:32.674Z\",\n    \"phase\": \"intake\"\n  },\n  \"arch-research-stack\": {\n    \"sessionId\": \"a9ff751b-b713-4810-9c30-1cad791c6970\",\n    \"ts\": \"2026-11-05T06:38:59.111Z\",\n    \"phase\": \"architect\"\n  },\n  \"arch-research-reqs\": {\n    \"sessionId\": \"608f2610-ae4e-4b2e-af6e-d46d1dae17cd\",\n    \"ts\": \"2026-11-05T06:38:59.071Z\",\n    \"phase\": \"architect\"\n  },\n  \"