tauth]). Called implicitly by signIn()/signOut(). Called directly only by tests/e2e/helpers/auth.ts (signInAs) for the cookie sign-in flow.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"csrfToken\"], \"properties\": { \"csrfToken\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-2\", \"FR-34\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/signout\",\n      \"description\": \"Auth.js sign-out (served by /api/auth/[...nextauth]). Called only through signOut({ redirectTo: '/login' }) from the shell user menu (C7). Clears the session cookie.\",\n      \"auth\": \"session cookie (no-op if absent)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"csrfToken\"],\n        \"properties\": { \"csrfToken\": { \"type\": \"string\" } }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"note\": \"Framework redirect; client navigates to /login.\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\", \"NFR-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/forgot-password\",\n      \"description\": \"Request a password reset link (C2 /forgot-password). Always returns the same 200 body whether or not the account exists (no enumeration). IP limit 10/h → 429; per-email limit 3/h is SILENT (still 200, no token). For an ACTIVE, non-archived user: createToken(PASSWORD_RESET, 60 min), sendAuthEmail('password-reset') → EmailOutbox, audit auth.password.reset_requested. The UI shows the success message on 200 AND on 429.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"forgotPasswordSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"email\"],\n        \"properties\": { \"email\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Email\" } }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"message\": \"If an account exists for that email, we've sent a reset link.\" } },\n        \"400\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" } } },\n        \"429\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"RATE_LIMITED\", \"message\": \"Too many requests. Wait a few minutes and try again.\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-31\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-10\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/reset-password\",\n      \"description\": \"Set a new password from a reset link (C3 /reset-password/[token]). verifyToken(PASSWORD_RESET) → policy → bcrypt 12 → transaction(consume token, set hash, passwordChangedAt=now, failedLoginCount=0, lockedUntil=null) → audit auth.password.reset. Success → UI goes to /login?reset=1. Other sessions are revoked within 5 min through the passwordChangedAt recheck.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public (token-gated)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"resetPasswordSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"token\", \"password\", \"confirm\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"token\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"note\": \"raw token from the URL; never logged or audited\" },\n          \"password\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\" },\n          \"confirm\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"note\": \"must equal password. Field is `confirm`, NOT `confirmPassword` (system-design C3 wording is wrong).\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Ok\" } },\n        \"400\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" }, \"note\": \"policy failures come back under fieldErrors.password (incl. 'This password is too common. Choose another.')\" } },\n        \"410\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"INVALID_TOKEN\", \"message\": \"This link is invalid or has expired.\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-10\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-8\", \"NFR-10\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/accept-invite\",\n      \"description\": \"Activate an invited account (C4 /invite/[token]). verifyToken(INVITE) → policy → bcrypt 12 → transaction(consume token, set hash, status=ACTIVE, passwordChangedAt=now) → audit auth.invite.accepted. Does NOT create a session: the client then calls signIn('credentials') with the returned email and the password just set, and goes to /dashboard. On 410 the PAGE renders the FR-13 copy ('This invitation link is invalid or has expired. Ask the school office to send a new one.'), not the service message.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public (token-gated)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"acceptInviteSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"token\", \"password\", \"confirm\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"token\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n          \"password\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\" },\n          \"confirm\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"email\"], \"properties\": { \"email\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Email\" } } } },\n        \"400\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" } } },\n        \"410\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"INVALID_TOKEN\", \"message\": \"This link is invalid or has expired.\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-15\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-8\", \"NFR-10\", \"NFR-14\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/account/password\",\n      \"description\": \"Signed-in password change (C5 /account/security). requireUser → changePasswordSchema → bcrypt compare current → policy → update hash + passwordChangedAt → audit auth.password.changed → unstable_update({ reauth: true }) re-issues THIS session so only other sessions are revoked (within 5 min). Success → useToast 'Password updated'.\",\n      \"auth\": \"session required (requireUser; middleware returns 401 UNAUTHENTICATED JSON without a session)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"changePasswordSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"currentPassword\", \"newPassword\", \"confirm\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"currentPassword\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n          \"newPassword\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\" },\n          \"confirm\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Ok\" } },\n        \"400\": {\n          \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" } },\n          \"cases\": {\n            \"wrongCurrent\": \"{ message: 'Current password is incorrect.', details: { fieldErrors: { currentPassword: ['Current password is incorrect.'] } } }\",\n            \"policyFailure\": \"details.fieldErrors.password (NOT newPassword) — assertPasswordAllowed hard-codes the `password` key. ChangePasswordForm must remap password → newPassword before applyFieldErrors(), or the error renders nowhere. Client-side Zod already catches all rules except common-password, so this case only appears for common passwords.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"401\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"UNAUTHENTICATED\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-9\", \"NFR-10\", \"NFR-11\"]\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"unauthenticatedBehaviour\": {\n    \"description\": \"middleware.ts (existing): unauthenticated /api/* requests other than /api/health, /api/auth/* and public-routes.ts paths return 401 { error: { code: 'UNAUTHENTICATED' } }; unauthenticated (app) page requests redirect to /login?callbackUrl=<path>.\",\n    \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\", \"NFR-9\"]\n  },\n\n  \"designCorrections\": [\n    \"system-design.md C3 posts `confirmPassword`; the real field is `confirm` (resetPasswordSchema / acceptInviteSchema / changePasswordSchema).\",\n    \"system-design.md R3 says INVALID_TOKEN is 400; src/server/http.ts maps it to 410.\",\n    \"system-design.md C5 doesn't cover common-password errors on /api/account/password: they arrive under fieldErrors.password and must be remapped to newPassword on the client. Fix this in ChangePasswordForm, not in the service (NFR-13).\"\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0195ygKwithjRsyQmQ1yyGm3","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03b5fb20-9d6a-438e-b088-27287cde2484","uuid":"c24c7a8f-80d9-4df6-be01-7669f1f9360a","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:42:25.689Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention; no /api/v1 prefix — NFR-13 forbids renaming routes)\",\n    \"scope\": \"SH-1 adds NO new endpoints (system-design.md §1, ADR-1). Every contract below documents an EXISTING route that the new pages (C1–C5) and tests (C12) call. Dev must not modify src/app/api/** or src/server/**.\",\n    \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\" },\n    \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"string\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": \"unknown?\" } },\n    \"errorCodes\": {\n      \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n      \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n      \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n      \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n      \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n      \"INVALID_TOKEN\": 410,\n      \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429,\n      \"INTERNAL\": 500\n    },\n    \"validationErrorDetails\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR details are Zod flatten() output: { formErrors: string[], fieldErrors: { [field]: string[] } }. Service-raised policy errors use the same { fieldErrors } shape, so applyFieldErrors() handles both.\",\n    \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler → (requireUser) → parseBody(schema from src/lib/validators/auth.ts) → services/auth.ts → ok(). All helpers in src/server/http.ts.\",\n    \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-10\", \"NFR-11\", \"NFR-13\"]\n  },\n\n  \"sharedSchemas\": {\n    \"Email\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"email\", \"note\": \"trimmed and lower-cased by emailField before use\" },\n    \"NewPassword\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 10,\n      \"maxLength\": 128,\n      \"note\": \"≥1 letter, ≥1 digit, ≠ user email, not in common-passwords.txt (server-side only). FR-15.\"\n    },\n    \"Ok\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"ok\"], \"properties\": { \"ok\": { \"const\": true } } },\n    \"FieldErrors\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"formErrors\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } },\n        \"fieldErrors\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"endpoints\": [\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/callback/credentials\",\n      \"description\": \"Auth.js credentials sign-in (served by /api/auth/[...nextauth]). Called ONLY through signIn('credentials', { email, password, redirect: false }) from next-auth/react, which fetches the CSRF token itself. Runs authorizeCredentials: IP rate limit (10 / 5 min), user lookup, bcrypt or DUMMY_HASH compare, status and lock checks, lockout counter, audit. Used by C1 /login, C4 post-invite sign-in, and the e2e signInAs helper.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"email\", \"password\", \"csrfToken\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"email\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Email\" },\n          \"password\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n          \"csrfToken\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"note\": \"from GET /api/auth/csrf; added automatically by signIn()\" },\n          \"callbackUrl\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"note\": \"sanitised by the redirect callback; the client also applies safeCallbackUrl()\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"note\": \"Not the {data} envelope — Auth.js framework response. signIn(..., { redirect: false }) resolves to the object below.\",\n        \"success\": { \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"sideEffects\": \"sets the HttpOnly session cookie (8h JWT); failedLoginCount=0, lastLoginAt=now; audit auth.login.success\" },\n        \"failure\": {\n          \"ok\": false,\n          \"error\": \"CredentialsSignin\",\n          \"code\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\"invalid\", \"disabled\", \"rate_limited\", \"locked:<N>\"],\n            \"uiMapping\": {\n              \"locked:<N>\": \"This account is temporarily locked. Try again in N minutes.\",\n              \"disabled\": \"This account is disabled. Contact the school office.\",\n              \"rate_limited\": \"Too many attempts. Wait a few minutes and try again.\",\n              \"*\": \"Email or password is incorrect.\"\n            },\n            \"note\": \"Map with loginErrorMessage(code) in LoginForm.tsx (C1). Each failure audits auth.login.failure { email, reason }; the 5th consecutive failure also audits auth.lockout and returns locked:15.\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-5\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"NFR-2\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-14\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"GET\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/csrf\",\n      \"description\": \"Auth.js CSRF token (served by /api/auth/[...nextauth]). Called implicitly by signIn()/signOut(). Called directly only by tests/e2e/helpers/auth.ts (signInAs) for the cookie sign-in flow.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {},\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"csrfToken\"], \"properties\": { \"csrfToken\": { \"type\": \"string\" } } },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-2\", \"FR-34\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/signout\",\n      \"description\": \"Auth.js sign-out (served by /api/auth/[...nextauth]). Called only through signOut({ redirectTo: '/login' }) from the shell user menu (C7). Clears the session cookie.\",\n      \"auth\": \"session cookie (no-op if absent)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"csrfToken\"],\n        \"properties\": { \"csrfToken\": { \"type\": \"string\" } }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": { \"note\": \"Framework redirect; client navigates to /login.\" },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\", \"NFR-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/forgot-password\",\n      \"description\": \"Request a password reset link (C2 /forgot-password). Always returns the same 200 body whether or not the account exists (no enumeration). IP limit 10/h → 429; per-email limit 3/h is SILENT (still 200, no token). For an ACTIVE, non-archived user: createToken(PASSWORD_RESET, 60 min), sendAuthEmail('password-reset') → EmailOutbox, audit auth.password.reset_requested. The UI shows the success message on 200 AND on 429.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"forgotPasswordSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"email\"],\n        \"properties\": { \"email\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Email\" } }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"message\": \"If an account exists for that email, we've sent a reset link.\" } },\n        \"400\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" } } },\n        \"429\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"RATE_LIMITED\", \"message\": \"Too many requests. Wait a few minutes and try again.\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-31\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-10\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/reset-password\",\n      \"description\": \"Set a new password from a reset link (C3 /reset-password/[token]). verifyToken(PASSWORD_RESET) → policy → bcrypt 12 → transaction(consume token, set hash, passwordChangedAt=now, failedLoginCount=0, lockedUntil=null) → audit auth.password.reset. Success → UI goes to /login?reset=1. Other sessions are revoked within 5 min through the passwordChangedAt recheck.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public (token-gated)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"resetPasswordSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"token\", \"password\", \"confirm\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"token\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"note\": \"raw token from the URL; never logged or audited\" },\n          \"password\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\" },\n          \"confirm\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"note\": \"must equal password. Field is `confirm`, NOT `confirmPassword` (system-design C3 wording is wrong).\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Ok\" } },\n        \"400\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" }, \"note\": \"policy failures come back under fieldErrors.password (incl. 'This password is too common. Choose another.')\" } },\n        \"410\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"INVALID_TOKEN\", \"message\": \"This link is invalid or has expired.\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-10\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-8\", \"NFR-10\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/auth/accept-invite\",\n      \"description\": \"Activate an invited account (C4 /invite/[token]). verifyToken(INVITE) → policy → bcrypt 12 → transaction(consume token, set hash, status=ACTIVE, passwordChangedAt=now) → audit auth.invite.accepted. Does NOT create a session: the client then calls signIn('credentials') with the returned email and the password just set, and goes to /dashboard. On 410 the PAGE renders the FR-13 copy ('This invitation link is invalid or has expired. Ask the school office to send a new one.'), not the service message.\",\n      \"auth\": \"public (token-gated)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"acceptInviteSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"token\", \"password\", \"confirm\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"token\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n          \"password\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\" },\n          \"confirm\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [\"email\"], \"properties\": { \"email\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Email\" } } } },\n        \"400\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" } } },\n        \"410\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"INVALID_TOKEN\", \"message\": \"This link is invalid or has expired.\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-15\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-8\", \"NFR-10\", \"NFR-14\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"method\": \"POST\",\n      \"path\": \"/api/account/password\",\n      \"description\": \"Signed-in password change (C5 /account/security). requireUser → changePasswordSchema → bcrypt compare current → policy → update hash + passwordChangedAt → audit auth.password.changed → unstable_update({ reauth: true }) re-issues THIS session so only other sessions are revoked (within 5 min). Success → useToast 'Password updated'.\",\n      \"auth\": \"session required (requireUser; middleware returns 401 UNAUTHENTICATED JSON without a session)\",\n      \"requestSchema\": {\n        \"contentType\": \"application/json\",\n        \"zod\": \"changePasswordSchema\",\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"currentPassword\", \"newPassword\", \"confirm\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"currentPassword\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 },\n          \"newPassword\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/NewPassword\" },\n          \"confirm\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"responseSchema\": {\n        \"200\": { \"data\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/Ok\" } },\n        \"400\": {\n          \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"details\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/FieldErrors\" } },\n          \"cases\": {\n            \"wrongCurrent\": \"{ message: 'Current password is incorrect.', details: { fieldErrors: { currentPassword: ['Current password is incorrect.'] } } }\",\n            \"policyFailure\": \"details.fieldErrors.password (NOT newPassword) — assertPasswordAllowed hard-codes the `password` key. ChangePasswordForm must remap password → newPassword before applyFieldErrors(), or the error renders nowhere. Client-side Zod already catches all rules except common-password, so this case only appears for common passwords.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"401\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"UNAUTHENTICATED\" } }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-9\", \"NFR-10\", \"NFR-11\"]\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"unauthenticatedBehaviour\": {\n    \"description\": \"middleware.ts (existing): unauthenticated /api/* requests other than /api/health, /api/auth/* and public-routes.ts paths return 401 { error: { code: 'UNAUTHENTICATED' } }; unauthenticated (app) page requests redirect to /login?callbackUrl=<path>.\",\n    \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\", \"NFR-9\"]\n  },\n\n  \"designCorrections\": [\n    \"system-design.md C3 posts `confirmPassword`; the real field is `confirm` (resetPasswordSchema / acceptInviteSchema / changePasswordSchema).\",\n    \"system-design.md R3 says INVALID_TOKEN is 400; src/server/http.ts maps it to 410.\",\n    \"system-design.md C5 doesn't cover common-password errors on /api/account/password: they arrive under fieldErrors.password and must be remapped to newPassword on the client. Fix this in ChangePasswordForm, not in the service (NFR-13).\"\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":11,"newStart":1,"newLines":12,"lines":[" {","-  \"ticketId\": \"SH-6\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T06:20:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:10:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\","," ","   \"conventions\": {","-    \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention, no /api/v1 prefix; NFR-9 forbids renaming routes)\",","+    \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention; no /api/v1 prefix — NFR-13 forbids renaming routes)\",","+    \"scope\": \"SH-1 adds NO new endpoints (system-design.md §1, ADR-1). Every contract below documents an EXISTING route that the new pages (C1–C5) and tests (C12) call. Dev must not modify src/app/api/** or src/server/**.\",","     \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\" },","     \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"string\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": \"unknown?\" } },","     \"errorCodes\": {"]},{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":368,"newStart":14,"newLines":200,"lines":["       \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,","       \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,","       \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,","-      \"CONFLICT\": 409","+      \"CONFLICT\": 409,","+      \"INVALID_TOKEN\": 410,","+      \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429,","+      \"INTERNAL\": 500","     },","-    \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler → requireUser/requireRole → parseQuery/parseBody (Zod from src/lib/validators/timetable.ts) → timetable-service → ok(), all from src/server/http.ts. No new error codes. Prisma P2002 (the @@unique backstop) is already mapped to 409 by withHandler.\",","-    \"statusCodes\": \"POST create → 201 via ok(data, { status: 201 }); everything else 200. DELETE returns { data: { id } }.\",","-    \"academicYear\": \"academicYearId is never accepted on slot writes; it is derived from course.academicYearId (FR-37).\",","-    \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-7\", \"NFR-8\", \"NFR-9\", \"FR-39\"]","+    \"validationErrorDetails\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR details are Zod flatten() output: { formErrors: string[], fieldErrors: { [field]: string[] } }. Service-raised policy errors use the same { fieldErrors } shape, so applyFieldErrors() handles both.\",","+    \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler → (requireUser) → parseBody(schema from src/lib/validators/auth.ts) → services/auth.ts → ok(). All helpers in src/server/http.ts.\",","+    \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-10\", \"NFR-11\", \"NFR-13\"]","   },"," ","   \"sharedSchemas\": {","-    \"PeriodKind\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"CLASS\", \"BREAK\", \"LUNCH\", \"ASSEMBLY\"] },","-    \"HHMM\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^([01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d$\", \"note\": \"24-hour, school timezone\" },","-    \"Period\": {","-      \"type\": \"object\",","-      \"required\": [\"id\", \"name\", \"startTime\", \"endTime\", \"kind\", \"order\"],","-      \"properties\": {","-        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },","-        \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"maxLength\": 50 },","-        \"startTime\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/HHMM\" },","-        \"endTime\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/HHMM\" },","-        \"kind\": { \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/PeriodKind\" },","-        \"order\": { \"type\": \"integer\" }","-      }","+    \"Email\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"email\", \"note\": \"trimmed and lower-cased by emailField before use\" },","+    \"NewPassword\": {","+      \"type\": \"string\",","+      \"minLength\": 10,","+      \"maxLength\": 128,","+      \"no