{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjKtQsTsuze4crbwzW8q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U8H764vm1ERMV6YnVUDxJm","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:12:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 7,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"SH-1 adds no endpoints. The 7 contracts document existing routes: 4 business routes (forgot-password, reset-password, accept-invite, account/password) and 3 Auth.js routes (callback/credentials, csrf, signout) that the new pages and tests call. src/app/api/** and src/server/** stay untouched.\",\n    \"Fixes to system-design.md from reading the code (details in api-contracts.json designCorrections): the confirm field is `confirm`, not `confirmPassword`; INVALID_TOKEN is HTTP 410, not 400; on /api/account/password, common-password errors come back under fieldErrors.password, so ChangePasswordForm must remap them to newPassword.\",\n    \"The api-contracts.json and handoff files that were on disk belonged to SH-6 and have been replaced. These files are also stale (SH-6) and must be regenerated for SH-1: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*, artifacts/qa/* and artifacts/ui-verification/*.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0) before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",\n    \"FR-32 (LOW, needs human sign-off): keep AuditLog.ip and do not rename it to ipAddress.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":67809,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03b5fb20-9d6a-438e-b088-27287cde2484","uuid":"be182fb4-6e54-4b59-91ee-fe33e512ac50","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:42:36.581Z","request_id":"req_011CgjKtQdaFBnSKjC2ejjEn","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01U8H764vm1ERMV6YnVUDxJm":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:12:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 7,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"SH-1 adds no endpoints. The 7 contracts document existing routes: 4 business routes (forgot-password, reset-password, accept-invite, account/password) and 3 Auth.js routes (callback/credentials, csrf, signout) that the new pages and tests call. src/app/api/** and src/server/** stay untouched.\",\n    \"Fixes to system-design.md from reading the code (details in api-contracts.json designCorrections): the confirm field is `confirm`, not `confirmPassword`; INVALID_TOKEN is HTTP 410, not 400; on /api/account/password, common-password errors come back under fieldErrors.password, so ChangePasswordForm must remap them to newPassword.\",\n    \"The api-contracts.json and handoff files that were on disk belonged to SH-6 and have been replaced. These files are also stale (SH-6) and must be regenerated for SH-1: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*, artifacts/qa/* and artifacts/ui-verification/*.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0) before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",\n    \"FR-32 (LOW, needs human sign-off): keep AuditLog.ip and do not rename it to ipAddress.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n"}}}
