{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013Qd7URNaCGy6nYKYJF82wT","type":"tool_result","content":"total 72\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 ikramaansari  staff    192 Nov  6 10:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 ikramaansari  staff    352 Nov  5 11:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   1664 Nov  6 10:30 handoff-to-architect.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  20140 Nov  6 10:30 requirements.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    771 Nov  6 10:30 tech-stack.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   4904 Nov  6 10:30 user-stories.md\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T05:29:02Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 51,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 94,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"GREENFIELD within brownfield: there is no attendance code yet. Design the models and migration (raw SQL CHECK plus two partial unique indexes), src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts, src/lib/validators/attendance.ts, the 10 API routes, the /attendance/take pages, the student and course Attendance tabs, /admin/attendance, the nav entries, the seed data and the tests.\",\n    \"REUSE: getScheduleForDate (timetable-service), notifyStudentAndParents/notify, assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, audit(), toCsv(), getSchoolSettings/updateSchoolSettings, and the components in src/components/<Name>/ (DataTable, StatCard, UserAvatar, PageHeader, Toast/useToast). These are not in src/components/shared/.\",\n    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM): there is no school settings page and src/app/api/settings/school/ is empty. Default: add a minimal admin attendance-settings UI and PATCH route built on updateSchoolSettings().\",\n    \"FR-16 (LOW): the daily register route is unspecified. Default: /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]?date=, reusing the course register component.\",\n    \"FR-23 (LOW): metadata for attendance.corrected and attendance.register_missing is unspecified. Default: ATTENDANCE category, email false; recipients are PARENT+STUDENT and TEACHER respectively.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T17:41:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 7,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"SH-1 adds no endpoints. The 7 contracts document existing routes: 4 business routes (forgot-password, reset-password, accept-invite, account/password) and 3 Auth.js routes (callback/credentials, csrf, signout) that C1\\u2013C9 call. src/app/api/** and src/server/** stay untouched.\",\n    \"Regenerated against the 17:30 system-design.md (C1\\u2013C9). Corrections from reading the code (see api-contracts.json designCorrections): the confirm field is `confirm`, not `confirmPassword`; on /api/account/password, policy errors arrive under fieldErrors.password and ChangePasswordForm must remap them to newPassword.\",\n    \"Downstream artifacts predate this design (dev-planning 11:47, dev, qa, threat-model-notes.json 11:42) and must be regenerated from C1\\u2013C9.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0) before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",\n    \"FR-32 (LOW, needs human sign-off): keep AuditLog.ip and do not rename it to ipAddress.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T17:40:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention; no /api/v1 prefix — NFR-13 forbids renaming routes)\",\n    \"scope\": \"SH-1 adds NO new endpoints (system-design.md §1, ADR-1, NFR-13). Every contract below documents an EXISTING route that the new pages (C1–C5), shell (C7) and tests (C8, C9) call. Dev must not modify src/app/api/** or src/server/**.\",\n    \"successEnvelope\": {\n      \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\"\n    },\n    \"errorEnvelope\": {\n      \"error\": {\n        \"code\": \"string\",\n        \"message\": \"string\",\n        \"details\": \"unknown?\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"errorCodes\": {\n      \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n      \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n      \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n      \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n      \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n      \"INVALID_TOKEN\": 410,\n      \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429,\n      \"INTERNAL\": 500\n    },\n    \"validationErrorDetails\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR details are Zod flatten() output: { formErrors: string[], fieldErrors: { [field]: string[] } }. Service-raised policy errors use the same { fieldErrors } shape, so applyFieldErrors() handles both.\",\n    \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler → (requireUser) → parseBody(schema from src/lib/validators/auth.ts) → services/auth.ts → ok(). All helpers in src/server/http.ts.\",\n    \"requirementIds\": [\n      \"NFR-10\",\n      \"NFR-11\",\n      \"NFR-13\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"sharedSchemas\": {\n    \"Email\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"form","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f90400c-337b-4bd2-a543-f73a5eb37374","uuid":"8f4cc346-4aa1-4d1c-aabe-adf0780dc351","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:34:49.539Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 72\ndrwxr-xr-x   6 ikramaansari  staff    192 Nov  6 10:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 ikramaansari  staff    352 Nov  5 11:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   1664 Nov  6 10:30 handoff-to-architect.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  20140 Nov  6 10:30 requirements.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaa