{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DV6Zg6EFy3k7Vtym6fHJpx","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f90400c-337b-4bd2-a543-f73a5eb37374","uuid":"5dbcdfc3-61d7-4a38-a917-64754c2f26be","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:36:01.965Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T06:46:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 10,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"10 new routes matching system-design §4 / FR-35. Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes, error codes and pagination come from src/server/http.ts.\",\n    \"PUT /api/attendance/register returns the same Register shape as GET, so RegisterForm re-renders from the response. Roster errors are VALIDATION_ERROR with details.invalidStudentIds / details.missingStudentIds.\",\n    \"PATCH /api/settings/school is deliberately strict: only attendanceMode and attendanceAlertThreshold (FR-5 default).\",\n    \"Stale SH-1 files remain and must be regenerated, not reused: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing any UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",\n    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM), FR-16 (LOW), FR-23 (LOW): built on the intake defaults (PATCH /api/settings/school plus a settings tab; /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]; corrected/register_missing metadata). Human sign-off is needed if these defaults should change.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":10,"newStart":1,"newLines":11,"lines":[" {","-  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T17:41:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T06:46:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\",","+","   \"status\": \"complete\",","-  \"endpointCount\": 7,","+  \"endpointCount\": 10,","   \"artifacts\": [","     \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",","     \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\","]},{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":13,"newStart":13,"newLines":14,"lines":["     \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"","   ],","   \"notes\": [","-    \"SH-1 adds no endpoints. The 7 contracts document existing routes: 4 business routes (forgot-password, reset-password, accept-invite, account/password) and 3 Auth.js routes (callback/credentials, csrf, signout) that C1\\u2013C9 call. src/app/api/** and src/server/** stay untouched.\",","-    \"Regenerated against the 17:30 system-design.md (C1\\u2013C9). Corrections from reading the code (see api-contracts.json designCorrections): the confirm field is `confirm`, not `confirmPassword`; on /api/account/password, policy errors arrive under fieldErrors.password and ChangePasswordForm must remap them to newPassword.\",","-    \"Downstream artifacts predate this design (dev-planning 11:47, dev, qa, threat-model-notes.json 11:42) and must be regenerated from C1\\u2013C9.\"","+    \"10 new routes matching system-design §4 / FR-35. Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes, error codes and pagination come from src/server/http.ts.\",","+    \"PUT /api/attendance/register returns the same Register shape as GET, so RegisterForm re-renders from the response. Roster errors are VALIDATION_ERROR with details.invalidStudentIds / details.missingStudentIds.\",","+    \"PATCH /api/settings/school is deliberately strict: only attendanceMode and attendanceAlertThreshold (FR-5 default).\",","+    \"Stale SH-1 files remain and must be regenerated, not reused: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*.\"","   ],","   \"blockers\": [","-    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0) before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",","-    \"FR-32 (LOW, needs human sign-off): keep AuditLog.ip and do not rename it to ipAddress.\"","+    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing any UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",","+    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM), FR-16 (LOW), FR-23 (LOW): built on the intake defaults (PATCH /api/settings/school plus a settings tab; /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]; corrected/register_missing metadata). Human sign-off is needed if these defaults should change.\"","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"","-}","\\ No newline at end of file","+}"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T17:41:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 7,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"SH-1 adds no endpoints. The 7 contracts document existing routes: 4 business routes (forgot-password, reset-password, accept-invite, account/password) and 3 Auth.js routes (callback/credentials, csrf, signout) that C1\\u2013C9 call. src/app/api/** and src/server/** stay untouched.\",\n    \"Regenerated against the 17:30 system-design.md (C1\\u2013C9). Corrections from reading the code (see api-contracts.json designCorrections): the confirm field is `confirm`, not `confirmPassword`; on /api/account/password, policy errors arrive under fieldErrors.password and ChangePasswordForm must remap them to newPassword.\",\n    \"Downstream artifacts predate this design (dev-planning 11:47, dev, qa, threat-model-notes.json 11:42) and must be regenerated from C1\\u2013C9.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0) before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",\n    \"FR-32 (LOW, needs human sign-off): keep AuditLog.ip and do not rename it to ipAddress.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DV6Zg6EFy3k7Vtym6fHJpx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
