{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UeFYC1uHMsJofbJ2tkszFB","type":"tool_result","content":"SH-8 ['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'prd', 'runMode', 'brownfieldFindings', 'functionalRequirements', 'nonFunctionalRequirements', 'overallConfidencePct', 'clarificationLog', 'status']\n{\"id\": \"FR-1\", \"description\": \"Add the FileObject Prisma model (ownerId\\u2192User, originalName, mimeType, sizeBytes, unique storageKey '<yyyy>/<mm>/<cuid>.<ext>', sha256, context, nullable contextId, createdAt, index on [context, contextId]) with a migration.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1 File storage (Prisma block)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-3\", \"description\": \"POST /api/files (multipart, any signed-in user) accepts one file plus context and creates a FileObject with contextId null.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1.2; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-8\", \"description\": \"GET /api/files/:id streams the file with the stored MIME type, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, and Content-Disposition: attachment. It uses inline for images and PDFs only when ?inline=1.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1.4; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"DELETE /api/files/:id is allowed for the owner or ADMIN, only while the file is unattached (contextId null). It removes both the row and the stored bytes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Add the ContentStatus enum (DRAFT, SCHEDULED, PUBLISHED) and the Module, Lesson, LessonAttachment, LessonLink and LessonProgress models exactly as specified, including the cascade deletes and the composite PK [lessonId, studentId] on LessonProgress.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 Content data model\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"Validate content fields with Zod in src/lib/validators/content.ts: module title \\u2264120, lesson title \\u2264150, contentMarkdown \\u2264100,000 chars, estimatedMinutes 1\\u2013600, link URLs http(s) only, and videoUrl YouTube/Vimeo only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 field comments; Code layout (validators)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"Students see a per-module progress bar ('3 of 5 complete'), a course-level progress bar and a 'Continue' button that opens the first incomplete visible lesson.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4.2; Acceptance Criterion 5\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Lessons can be reordered within and across modules with @dnd-kit/sortable drag handles on MUI Accordion/List items, with up/down IconButtons as the keyboard alternative. The order persists through POST /api/courses/:id/content/reorder with the full ordering { modules: [{ id, lessonIds: [] }] }.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4.3; API table; Acceptance Criterion 7\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"The lesson editor has an attachments section (FileUpload with reorder) and a links section (title + URL rows). Both are saved via PATCH /api/lessons/:id as attachments and links arrays.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5.2; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-33\", \"description\": \"For students, the first lesson view upserts LessonProgress.firstViewedAt, and a 'Mark as complete' button toggles completedAt via POST /api/lessons/:id/progress { completed }. Only ACTIVE enrolled students may do this.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6.3; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-34\", \"description\": \"Teachers get a 'Progress' Drawer on the lesson viewer that lists enrolled students with Viewed/Completed status and dates, served by GET /api/lessons/:id/progress (manage).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6.4; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-35\", \"description\": \"Register a 'Learning' student tab showing per-course content progress (course, lessons completed / visible, percentage, last activity) via GET /api/students/:id/learning (assertCanViewStudent).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7.1; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-40\", \"description\": \"Logo upload: the school settings page uses FileUpload (single image, PNG/JPG/WebP/SVG, max 2 MB, context 'logo') instead of a logo URL field, and stores the resulting /api/files/<id> URL in SchoolSettings.logoUrl.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"FR-9.1 (storage of the URL in logoUrl inferred; existing column reused, no rename)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-43\", \"description\": \"Content API: GET/POST /api/courses/:id/modules (GET filters by visibility per role and includes lessons and the caller's progress), PATCH/DELETE /api/modules/:id, POST /api/modules/:id/lessons, GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/lessons/:id, using the PRD response/error envelope and the access checks in the API table.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"API table; Code layout (response shape)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-44\", \"description\": \"GET /api/lessons/:id returns NOT_FOUND to STUDENT/PARENT callers when the lesson is not visible under the visibility rules.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"API table ('view (visibility rules)'); FR-3.1\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"POST /api/files is rate limited to 60 uploads per user per hour (RATE_LIMITED 429), reusing rateLimit() from src/server/rate-limit.ts.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements 1\"}\n\n{\n \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention, no /api/v1 prefix; NFR-10 forbids renaming routes)\",\n \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler \\u2192 requireUser/requireRole \\u2192 parseQuery/parseBody (schemas from src/lib/validators/attendance.ts) \\u2192 resource assert \\u2192 attendance-service \\u2192 ok()/paginated(). Every helper comes from src/server/http.ts (system-design \\u00a73.1).\",\n \"successEnvelope\": {\n  \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\"\n },\n \"paginatedEnvelope\": {\n  \"data\": \"<responseSchema>[]\",\n  \"meta\": {\n   \"page\": \"int\",\n   \"pageSize\": \"int \\u2264 100\",\n   \"total\": \"int\"\n  }\n },\n \"errorEnvelope\": {\n  \"error\": {\n   \"code\": \"ApiErrorCode\",\n   \"message\": \"string\",\n   \"details\": \"unknown?\"\n  }\n },\n \"errorCodes\": {\n  \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n  \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n  \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n  \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n  \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n  \"INTERNAL\": 500\n },\n \"validationErrorDetails\": \"A ZodError maps to VALIDATION_ERROR with details = zod flatten() { formErrors, fieldErrors }. Service-raised NFR-3 roster errors use details { invalidStudentIds: string[] } or { missingStudentIds: string[] }.\",\n \"dates\": \"Date-only values are 'yyyy-MM-dd' strings interpreted in SchoolSettings.timezone. Timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC. Display uses formatInSchoolTz (ADR-5).\",\n \"ids\": \"All ids are cuid strings.\",\n \"requirementIds\": [\n  \"FR-35\",\n  \"FR-36\",\n  \"NFR-7\",\n  \"NFR-8\"\n ]\n}\n{\n \"method\": \"GET\",\n \"path\": \"/api/attendance/today\",\n \"description\": \"The teacher's meetings for today in the school timezone (getScheduleForDate) joined with today's sessions, with the current slot flagged. Includes daily homeroom entries when attendanceMode is DAILY_HOMEROOM or BOTH. Guard: requireRole('TEACHER','ADMIN'). An ADMIN gets [] meetings plus no homeroom entries unless they are a homeroom teacher.\",\n \"requestSchema\": {\n  \"query\": {}\n },\n \"responseSchema\": {\n  \"data\": {\n   \"date\": {\n    \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/DateOnly\"\n   },\n   \"meetings\": {\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n     \"kind\": \"'course'\",\n     \"courseId\": \"string\",\n     \"courseName\": \"string\",\n     \"sectionName\": \"string\",\n     \"periodId\": \"string\",\n     \"periodName\": \"string\",\n     \"startTime\": \"HH:mm\",\n     \"endTime\": \"HH:mm\",\n     \"isCurrent\": \"boolean\",\n     \"taken\": \"null | { at: ISO date-time, by: UserRef }\"\n    }\n   },\n   \"dailyRegisters\": {\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n     \"kind\": \"'section'\",\n     \"sectionId\": \"string\",\n     \"sectionName\": \"string\",\n     \"taken\": \"null | { at, by: UserRef }\"\n    }\n   }\n  }\n },\n \"errors\": [\n  \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n  \"FORBIDDEN\"\n ],\n \"requirementIds\": [\n  \"FR-6\",\n  \"FR-7\",\n  \"FR-35\"\n ]\n}\n['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'conventions', 'sharedSchemas', 'endpoints', 'status']","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6816f41d-5eba-4155-b675-82c03913b1ab","uuid":"35016d05-955b-4e07-b9ef-d707093565dc","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:08:42.102Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"SH-8 ['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'prd', 'runMode', 'brownfieldFindings', 'functionalRequirements', 'nonFunctionalRequirements', 'overallConfidencePct', 'clarificationLog', 'status']\n{\"id\": \"FR-1\", \"description\": \"Add the FileObject Prisma model (ownerId\\u2192User, originalName, mimeType, sizeBytes, unique storageKey '<yyyy>/<mm>/<cuid>.<ext>', sha256, context, nullable contextId, createdAt, index on [context, contextId]) with a migration.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1 File storage (Prisma block)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-3\", \"description\": \"POST /api/files (multipart, any signed-in user) accepts one file plus context and creates a FileObject with contextId null.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1.2; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-8\", \"description\": \"GET /api/files/:id streams the file with the stored MIME type, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, and Content-Disposition: attachment. It uses inline for images and PDFs only when ?inline=1.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1.4; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"DELETE /api/files/:id is allowed for the owner or ADMIN, only while the file is unattached (contextId null). It removes both the row and the stored bytes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Add the ContentStatus enum (DRAFT, SCHEDULED, PUBLISHED) and the Module, Lesson, LessonAttachment, LessonLink and LessonProgress models exactly as specified, including the cascade deletes and the composite PK [lessonId, studentId] on LessonProgress.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 Content data model\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"Validate content fields with Zod in src/lib/validators/content.ts: module title \\u2264120, lesson title \\u2264150, contentMarkdown \\u2264100,000 chars, estimatedMinutes 1\\u2013600, link URLs http(s) only, and videoUrl YouTube/Vimeo only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 field comments; Code layout (validators)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"Students see a per-module progress bar ('3 of 5 complete'), a course-level progress bar and a 'Continue' button that opens the first incomplete visible lesson.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4.2; Acceptance Criterion 5\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Lessons can be reordered within and across modules with @dnd-kit/sortable drag handles on MUI Accordion/List items, with up/down IconButtons as the keyboard alternative. The order persists through POST /api/courses/:id/content/reorder with the full ordering { modules: [{ id, lessonIds: [] }] }.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4.3; API table; Acceptance Criterion 7\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"The lesson editor has an attachments section (FileUpload with reorder) and a links section (title + URL rows). Both are saved via PATCH /api/lessons/:id as attachments and links arrays.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5.2; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-33\", \"description\": \"For students, the first lesson view upserts LessonProgress.firstViewedAt, and a 'Mark as complete' button toggles completedAt via POST /api/lessons/:id/progress { completed }. Only ACTIVE enrolled students may do this.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6.3; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-34\", \"description\": \"Teachers get a 'Progress' Drawer on the lesson viewer that lists enrolled students with Viewed/Completed status and dates, served by GET /api/lessons/:id/progress (manage).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6.4; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-35\", \"description\": \"Register a 'Learning' student tab showing per-course content progress (course, lessons completed / visible, percentage, last activity) via GET /api/students/:id/learning (assertCanViewStudent).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7.1; API table\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-40\", \"description\": \"Logo upload: the school settings page uses FileUpload (single image, PNG/JPG/WebP/SVG, max 2 MB, context 'logo') instead of a logo URL field, and stores the resulting /api/files/<id> URL in SchoolSettings.logoUrl.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"FR-9.1 (storage of the URL in logoUrl inferred; existing column reused, no rename)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-43\", \"description\": \"Content API: GET/POST /api/courses/:id/modules (GET filters by visibility per role and includes lessons and the caller's progress), PATCH/DELETE /api/modules/:id, POST /api/modules/:id/lessons, GET/PATCH/DELETE /api/lessons/:id, using the PRD response/error envelope and the access checks in the API table.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"API table; Code layout (response shape)\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"FR-44\", \"description\": \"GET /api/lessons/:id returns NOT_FOUND to STUDENT/PARENT callers when the lesson is not visible under the visibility rules.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"API table ('view (visibility rules)'); FR-3.1\"}\n\n{\"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"POST /api/files is rate limited to 60 uploads per user per hour (RATE_LIMITED 429), reusing rateLimit() from src/server/rate-limit.ts.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements 1\"}\n\n{\n \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention, no /api/v1 prefix; NFR-10 forbids renaming routes)\",\n \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler \\u2192 requireUser/requireRole \\u2192 parseQuery/parseBody (schemas from src/lib/validators/attendance.ts) \\u2192 resource assert \\u2192 attendance-service \\u2192 ok()/paginated(). Every helper comes from src/server/http.ts (system-design \\u00a73.1).\",\n \"successEnvelope\": {\n  \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\"\n },\n \"paginatedEnvelope\": {\n  \"data\": \"<responseSchema>[]\",\n  \"meta\": {\n   \"page\": \"int\",\n   \"pageSize\": \"int \\u2264 100\",\n   \"total\": \"int\"\n  }\n },\n \"errorEnvelope\": {\n  \"error\": {\n   \"code\": \"ApiErrorCode\",\n   \"message\": \"string\",\n   \"details\": \"unknown?\"\n  }\n },\n \"errorCodes\": {\n  \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n  \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n  \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n  \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n  \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n  \"INTERNAL\": 500\n },\n \"validationErrorDetails\": \"A ZodError maps to VALIDATION_ERROR with details = zod flatten() { formErrors, fieldErrors }. Service-raised NFR-3 roster errors use details { invalidStudentIds: string[] } or { missingStudentIds: string[] }.\",\n \"dates\": \"Date-only values are 'yyyy-MM-dd' strings interpreted in SchoolSettings.timezone. Timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC. Display uses formatInSchoolTz (ADR-5).\",\n \"ids\": \"All ids are cuid strings.\",\n \"requirementIds\": [\n  \"FR-35\",\n  \"FR-36\",\n  \"NFR-7\",\n  \"NFR-8\"\n ]\n}\n{\n \"method\": \"GET\",\n \"path\": \"/api/attendance/today\",\n \"description\": \"The teacher's meetings for today in the school timezone (getScheduleForDate) joined with today's sessions, with the current slot flagged. Includes daily homeroom entries when attendanceMode is DAILY_HOMEROOM or BOTH. Guard: requireRole('TEACHER','ADMIN'). An ADMIN gets [] meetings plus no homeroom entries unless they are a homeroom teacher.\",\n \"requestSchema\": {\n  \"query\": {}\n },\n \"responseSchema\": {\n  \"data\": {\n   \"date\": {\n    \"$ref\": \"#/sharedSchemas/DateOnly\"\n   },\n   \"meetings\": {\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n     \"kind\": \"'course'\",\n     \"courseId\": \"string\",\n     \"courseName\": \"string\",\n     \"sectionName\": \"string\",\n     \"periodId\": \"string\",\n     \"periodName\": \"string\",\n     \"startTime\": \"HH:mm\",\n     \"endTime\": \"HH:mm\",\n     \"isCurrent\": \"boolean\",\n     \"taken\": \"null | { at: ISO date-time, by: UserRef }\"\n    }\n   },\n   \"dailyRegisters\": {\n    \"type\": \"array\",\n    \"items\": {\n     \"kind\": \"'section'\",\n     \"sectionId\": \"string\",\n     \"sectionName\": \"string\",\n     \"taken\": \"null | { at, by: UserRef }\"\n    }\n   }\n  }\n },\n \"errors\": [\n  \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n  \"FORBIDDEN\"\n ],\n \"requirementIds\": [\n  \"FR-6\",\n  \"FR-7\",\n  \"FR-35\"\n ]\n}\n['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'conventions', 'sharedSchemas', 'endpoints', 'status']","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UeFYC1uHMsJofbJ2tkszFB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
