{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SGWALnXNLmwwnL2W2k9mR2","type":"tool_result","content":"```prisma\nmodel FileObject {\n  id            String   @id @default(cuid())\n  ownerId       String                     // uploader\n  owner         User     @relation(fields: [ownerId], references: [id])\n  originalName  String                     // sanitised\n  mimeType      String\n  sizeBytes     Int\n  storageKey    String   @unique           // \"<yyyy>/<mm>/<cuid>.<ext>\"\n  sha256        String\n  context       String                     // \"lesson\", \"assignment\", \"submission\", \"message\", \"logo\", \"admission\"…\n  contextId     String?                    // id of the owning record once attached\n  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())\n  @@index([context, contextId])\n}\n```\n```prisma\nenum ContentStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED }\n\nmodel Module {\n  id          String        @id @default(cuid())\n  courseId    String\n  course      Course        @relation(fields: [courseId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title       String                       // max 120\n  description String?\n  order       Int\n  status      ContentStatus @default(DRAFT)\n  publishAt   DateTime?\n  createdAt   DateTime      @default(now())\n  updatedAt   DateTime      @updatedAt\n  lessons     Lesson[]\n}\n\nmodel Lesson {\n  id              String        @id @default(cuid())\n  moduleId        String\n  module          Module        @relation(fields: [moduleId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title           String                    // max 150\n  contentMarkdown String        @default(\"\") // max 100,000 chars\n  videoUrl        String?                   // YouTube or Vimeo only\n  estimatedMinutes Int?                     // 1–600\n  order           Int\n  status          ContentStatus @default(DRAFT)\n  publishAt       DateTime?\n  createdAt       DateTime      @default(now())\n  updatedAt       DateTime      @updatedAt\n  attachments     LessonAttachment[]\n  links           LessonLink[]\n  progress        LessonProgress[]\n}\n\nmodel LessonAttachment {\n  id        String     @id @default(cuid())\n  lessonId  String\n  lesson    Lesson     @relation(fields: [lessonId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  fileId    String\n  file      FileObject @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id])\n  order     Int\n}\n\nmodel LessonLink {\n  id        String @id @default(cuid())\n  lessonId  String\n  lesson    Lesson @relation(fields: [lessonId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title     String\n  url       String                          // http(s) only\n  order     Int\n}\n\nmodel LessonProgress {\n  lessonId     String\n  lesson       Lesson   @relation(fields: [lessonId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  studentId    String\n  firstViewedAt DateTime @default(now())\n  completedAt  DateTime?\n  @@id([lessonId, studentId])\n}\n```","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6816f41d-5eba-4155-b675-82c03913b1ab","uuid":"e847571f-2eb5-4a38-83b0-f46f95d7adff","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:25:39.813Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"```prisma\nmodel FileObject {\n  id            String   @id @default(cuid())\n  ownerId       String                     // uploader\n  owner         User     @relation(fields: [ownerId], references: [id])\n  originalName  String                     // sanitised\n  mimeType      String\n  sizeBytes     Int\n  storageKey    String   @unique           // \"<yyyy>/<mm>/<cuid>.<ext>\"\n  sha256        String\n  context       String                     // \"lesson\", \"assignment\", \"submission\", \"message\", \"logo\", \"admission\"…\n  contextId     String?                    // id of the owning record once attached\n  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())\n  @@index([context, contextId])\n}\n```\n```prisma\nenum ContentStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED }\n\nmodel Module {\n  id          String        @id @default(cuid())\n  courseId    String\n  course      Course        @relation(fields: [courseId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title       String                       // max 120\n  description String?\n  order       Int\n  status      ContentStatus @default(DRAFT)\n  publishAt   DateTime?\n  createdAt   DateTime      @default(now())\n  updatedAt   DateTime      @updatedAt\n  lessons     Lesson[]\n}\n\nmodel Lesson {\n  id              String        @id @default(cuid())\n  moduleId        String\n  module          Module        @relation(fields: [moduleId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title           String                    // max 150\n  contentMarkdown String        @default(\"\") // max 100,000 chars\n  videoUrl        String?                   // YouTube or Vimeo only\n  estimatedMinutes Int?                     // 1–600\n  order           Int\n  status          ContentStatus @default(DRAFT)\n  publishAt       DateTime?\n  createdAt       DateTime      @default(now())\n  updatedAt       DateTime      @updatedAt\n  attachments     LessonAttachment[]\n  links           LessonLink[]\n  progress        LessonProgress[]\n}\n\nmodel LessonAttachment {\n  id        String     @id @default(cuid())\n  lessonId  String\n  lesson    Lesson     @relation(fields: [lessonId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  fileId    String\n  file      FileObject @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id])\n  order     Int\n}\n\nmodel LessonLink {\n  id        String @id @default(cuid())\n  lessonId  String\n  lesson    Lesson @relation(fields: [lessonId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title     String\n  url       String                          // http(s) only\n  order     Int\n}\n\nmodel LessonProgress {\n  lessonId     String\n  lesson       Lesson   @relation(fields: [lessonId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  studentId    String\n  firstViewedAt DateTime @default(now())\n  completedAt  DateTime?\n  @@id([lessonId, studentId])\n}\n```","stderr":"","interrup