{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019NrehegSP4Z1gBVYVYtKo5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"SH-9\",\n3\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T09:05:00Z\",\n4\t  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n5\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n6\t  \"status\": \"complete\",\n7\t  \"requirementsCount\": 78,\n8\t  \"overallConfidencePct\": 95,\n9\t  \"blockers\": [\n10\t    \"DEPENDENCY GAP: PRD-08 (SH-8) failed QA. Its UI layer was never built: there is no FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView or Markdown editor component. PRD-09 FR-9/19/20/29/30 depend on them. Architect must decide how to cover this, e.g. build the minimal shared FileUpload and MarkdownView/MarkdownEditor in src/components/ inside this ticket. The backend is reusable as-is: POST /api/files (context field), GET /api/files/[id]?inline=1, registerFileAccess and the files service.\",\n11\t    \"ENV BREAK: @mui/x-internals 9.15.0 is mismatched with @mui/x-data-grid 9.5.0, so DataTable/DataGrid pages fail to compile. FR-17 (the teacher assignments table) needs it. Either align the MUI X versions in package.json or the lockfile, or render the table without DataGrid. This needs a decision.\",\n12\t    \"ENV BREAK: vitest.config.ts imports 'vitest/config.js', which does not resolve, so `npm test` does not start (NFR-13). Fix the import to 'vitest/config', or keep using vitest.tmp.config.ts.\",\n13\t    \"ENV BREAK: next.config.js has CSP script-src 'self', which blocks hydration in a real browser. The NFR-14 Playwright flow needs bypassCSP (as before) or a CSP fix.\",\n14\t    \"studentTabs has no renderer, so the FR-41 Assignments student tab will be registered but not visible until a tab bar exists on /students/[id]/*.\",\n15\t    \"LOW-confidence defaults to confirm: FR-15 (duplicate keeps the same dueAt), FR-52 (archived behaviour), FR-60 (NO_SUBMISSION excluded from missing and reminders).\",\n16\t    \"REUSE: notifyStudentAndParents(), notify() + NOTIFICATION_TYPES (category ACADEMIC), audit(), assertCanViewCourse/assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, registerBuiltInContexts in src/server/files/contexts.ts (add 'assignment' and 'submission'), the maintenance hook in src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts (add sendDueReminders()), the courseTabs/studentTabs registries, formatInSchoolTz, and the ConfirmDialog/EmptyState/PageHeader/useToast/DataTable components.\",\n17\t    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0 and MUI X 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n18\t  ],\n19\t  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n20\t}\n21\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"000b1731-dbaf-472c-b7e3-65e8ca26353f","uuid":"965b9fec-f661-4275-84c7-5901f81c8538","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:29:46.874Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/intake/handoff-to-architect.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-9\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T09:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 78,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 95,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"DEPENDENCY GAP: PRD-08 (SH-8) failed QA. Its UI layer was never built: there is no FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView or Markdown editor component. PRD-09 FR-9/19/20/29/30 depend on them. Architect must decide how to cover this, e.g. build the minimal shared FileUpload and MarkdownView/MarkdownEditor in src/components/ inside this ticket. The backend is reusable as-is: POST /api/files (context field), GET /api/files/[id]?inline=1, registerFileAccess and the files service.\",\n    \"ENV BREAK: @mui/x-internals 9.15.0 is mismatched with @mui/x-data-grid 9.5.0, so DataTable/DataGrid pages fail to compile. FR-17 (the teacher assignments table) needs it. Either align the MUI X versions in package.json or the lockfile, or render the table without DataGrid. This needs a decision.\",\n    \"ENV BREAK: vitest.config.ts imports 'vitest/config.js', which does not resolve, so `npm test` does not start (NFR-13). Fix the import to 'vitest/config', or keep using vitest.tmp.config.ts.\",\n    \"ENV BREAK: next.config.js has CSP script-src 'self', which blocks hydration in a real browser. The NFR-14 Playwright flow needs bypassCSP (as before) or a CSP fix.\",\n    \"studentTabs has no renderer, so the FR-41 Assignments student tab will be registered but not visible until a tab bar exists on /students/[id]/*.\",\n    \"LOW-confidence defaults to confirm: FR-15 (duplicate keeps the same dueAt), FR-52 (archived behaviour), FR-60 (NO_SUBMISSION excluded from missing and reminders).\",\n    \"REUSE: notifyStudentAndParents(), notify() + NOTIFICATION_TYPES (category ACADEMIC), audit(), assertCanViewCourse/assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, registerBuiltInContexts in src/server/files/contexts.ts (add 'assignment' and 'submission'), the maintenance hook in src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts (add sendDueReminders()), the courseTabs/studentTabs registries, formatInSchoolTz, and the ConfirmDialog/EmptyState/PageHeader/useToast/DataTable components.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for @mui/material@9.5.0 and MUI X 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n","numLines":21,"startLine":1,"totalLines":21}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019NrehegSP4Z1gBVYVYtKo5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
