{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cw2gKb9AUALRx1UWKJubot","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n3\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T06:46:00Z\",\n4\t  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n5\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"status\": \"complete\",\n8\t  \"endpointCount\": 10,\n9\t  \"artifacts\": [\n10\t    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n11\t    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n12\t    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n13\t    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n14\t  ],\n15\t  \"notes\": [\n16\t    \"10 new routes matching system-design §4 / FR-35. Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes, error codes and pagination come from src/server/http.ts.\",\n17\t    \"PUT /api/attendance/register returns the same Register shape as GET, so RegisterForm re-renders from the response. Roster errors are VALIDATION_ERROR with details.invalidStudentIds / details.missingStudentIds.\",\n18\t    \"PATCH /api/settings/school is deliberately strict: only attendanceMode and attendanceAlertThreshold (FR-5 default).\",\n19\t    \"Stale SH-1 files remain and must be regenerated, not reused: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*.\"\n20\t  ],\n21\t  \"blockers\": [\n22\t    \"NFR-6 (carried forward; does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing any UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",\n23\t    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM), FR-16 (LOW), FR-23 (LOW): built on the intake defaults (PATCH /api/settings/school plus a settings tab; /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]; corrected/register_missing metadata). Human sign-off is needed if these defaults should change.\"\n24\t  ],\n25\t  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n26\t}\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"000b1731-dbaf-472c-b7e3-65e8ca26353f","uuid":"2da3c288-852a-4f1b-b258-97db93