ge.\"","+    \"NFR-6 (hard gate for dev, does not block dev-planning): dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs for @mui/material 9.5.0 / MUI X 9.5.0) before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is unreachable.\",","+    \"ADR-2: the @mui/x-internals 9.1.0 override must be verified (npm ls + compile) before UI work; otherwise use the D2 fallbacks (MUI Table for FR-17, datetime-local for FR-9).\",","+    \"D11 relaxes X-Frame-Options to SAMEORIGIN for /api/files/:id only. Reviewer sign-off is recommended; the fallback is a PDF 'Open' link.\",","+    \"FR-41: studentTabs has no renderer, so the Assignments student tab will not be visible (the page works by URL). The platform CSP nonce fix is also out of scope (e2e uses bypassCSP).\",","+    \"LOW-confidence intake defaults adopted (FR-15, FR-52, FR-60; see D12). Human sign-off is needed if they should change.\"","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T06:46:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 10,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"10 new routes matching system-design §4 / FR-35. Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes, error codes and pagination come from src/server/http.ts.\",\n    \"PUT /api/attendance/register returns the same Register shape as GET, so RegisterForm re-renders from the response. Roster errors are VALIDATION_ERROR with details.invalidStudentIds / details.missingStudentIds.\",\n    \"PATCH /api/settings/school is deliberately strict: only attendanceMode and attendanceAlertThreshold (FR-5 default).\",\n    \"Stale SH-1 files remain and must be regenerated, not reused: artifacts/archi