wnload route. A reviewer should sign off; the fallback is an \"Open\" link instead.\n- The Assignments tab on student pages won't show up, because nothing displays that tab bar yet. The page itself works by direct URL.\n- Some low-confidence defaults from intake were adopted as written: what copying an assignment does, how archived assignments behave, and that assignments needing no submission are never counted as missing. Someone should confirm them.\n\n`threat-model-notes.json`, and everything under `artifacts/dev-planning/` and `artifacts/dev/`, are still from earlier tickets and need to be regenerated, not reused.","ttft_ms":2576,"type":"result","duration_ms":159315,"uuid":"9773fe7e-1397-4b7f-9d2e-723dd7b5ce4d","ttft_stream_ms":1573,"time_to_request_ms":109,"first_content_frame_ms":1574,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":18743,"cacheReadInputTokens":489382,"cacheCreationInputTokens":56344,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9235684,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1099,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":56344,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
