{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ASwSeLdrdQc3NU35c63Ske","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# PRD-10: Quizzes & Online Exams\n5:## Summary\n9:## Platform Context (shared by every SchoolHub PRD)\n13:### Fixed technology decisions\n32:### UI component rule (mandatory — applies to every screen in this PRD)\n41:### Code layout and conventions\n56:### Roles\n60:### Assumptions and constraints\n66:## Background\n70:## Goals\n76:## Out of Scope\n82:## User Stories\n91:## Functional Requirements\n93:### FR-1 Data model\n183:### FR-2 Question types and auto-grading (`src/server/quiz/grading.ts`)\n195:### FR-3 Quiz builder (`/courses/[courseId]/quizzes/[quizId]/edit`)\n202:### FR-4 Course quizzes tab\n205:### FR-5 Quiz player (`/quizzes/[quizId]/take`)\n215:### FR-6 Results\n220:### FR-7 Manual grading (`/courses/[courseId]/quizzes/[quizId]/grade`)\n224:### FR-8 Analytics tab (teacher)\n228:### FR-9 Accommodations\n231:### FR-10 Notifications\n235:## API\n239:| `GET /api/courses/:id/quizzes` | view course | Role-shaped |\n240:| `POST /api/courses/:id/quizzes` | manage | |\n241:| `GET /api/quizzes/:id` | manage → full incl. answers; student → no `correct` fields ever | |\n242:| `PATCH /api/quizzes/:id` · `DELETE /api/quizzes/:id` | manage | Delete only without attempts |\n243:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/questions` · `PATCH /api/questions/:id` · `DELETE /api/questions/:id` | manage | Edit limits per FR-3.5 |\n244:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/questions/reorder` | manage | |\n245:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/regrade` | manage | |\n246:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/attempts` | STUDENT | Start or resume |\n247:| `GET /api/attempts/:id` | owner, manage | Student: questions without answers until results visible |\n248:| `PUT /api/attempts/:id/answers/:questionId` | owner | `{ response }`; `409` after deadline |\n249:| `POST /api/attempts/:id/submit` | owner | |\n250:| `PUT /api/attempts/:id/answers/:questionId/grade` | manage | `{ pointsAwarded, feedback }` |\n251:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/release-results` | manage | |\n252:| `GET /api/quizzes/:id/analytics` | manage | `?format=csv` |\n253:| `PUT /api/quizzes/:id/accommodations/:studentId` | manage | |\n255:## Non-Functional Requirements\n261:## Acceptance Criteria\n273:## Test Requirements\n279:## Seed Data","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2cdffa8-12d1-4e17-864e-e6653bd23adc","uuid":"491e8318-2a80-4544-98f1-dd27ec409b19","timestamp":"2026-11-09T07:06:53.616Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1:# PRD-10: Quizzes & Online Exams\n5:## Summary\n9:## Platform Context (shared by every SchoolHub PRD)\n13:### Fixed technology decisions\n32:### UI component rule (mandatory — applies to every screen in this PRD)\n41:### Code layout and conventions\n56:### Roles\n60:### Assumptions and constraints\n66:## Background\n70:## Goals\n76:## Out of Scope\n82:## User Stories\n91:## Functional Requirements\n93:### FR-1 Data model\n183:### FR-2 Question types and auto-grading (`src/server/quiz/grading.ts`)\n195:### FR-3 Quiz builder (`/courses/[courseId]/quizzes/[quizId]/edit`)\n202:### FR-4 Course quizzes tab\n205:### FR-5 Quiz player (`/quizzes/[quizId]/take`)\n215:### FR-6 Results\n220:### FR-7 Manual grading (`/courses/[courseId]/quizzes/[quizId]/grade`)\n224:### FR-8 Analytics tab (teacher)\n228:### FR-9 Accommodations\n231:### FR-10 Notifications\n235:## API\n239:| `GET /api/courses/:id/quizzes` | view course | Role-shaped |\n240:| `POST /api/courses/:id/quizzes` | manage | |\n241:| `GET /api/quizzes/:id` | manage → full incl. answers; student → no `correct` fields ever | |\n242:| `PATCH /api/quizzes/:id` · `DELETE /api/quizzes/:id` | manage | Delete only without attempts |\n243:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/questions` · `PATCH /api/questions/:id` · `DELETE /api/questions/:id` | manage | Edit limits per FR-3.5 |\n244:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/questions/reorder` | manage | |\n245:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/regrade` | manage | |\n246:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/attempts` | STUDENT | Start or resume |\n247:| `GET /api/attempts/:id` | owner, manage | Student: questions without answers until results visible |\n248:| `PUT /api/attempts/:id/answers/:questionId` | owner | `{ response }`; `409` after deadline |\n249:| `POST /api/attempts/:id/submit` | owner | |\n250:| `PUT /api/attempts/:id/answers/:questionId/grade` | manage | `{ pointsAwarded, feedback }` |\n251:| `POST /api/quizzes/:id/release-results` | manage | |\n252:| `GET /api/quizzes/:id/analytics` | manage | `?format=csv` |\n253:| `PUT /api/quizzes/:id/accommodations/:studentId` | manage | |\n255:## Non-Functional Requirements\n261:## Acceptance Criteria\n273:## Test Requirements\n279:## Seed Data","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ASwSeLdrdQc3NU35c63Ske","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
