ing workspace reads, the analytics page reads, or the accommodations list. Server pages call the services directly.\",\n    \"Stale leftovers from SH-9: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/* and artifacts/dev/* must be regenerated for SH-10, not reused.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"devGates\": [\n    \"NFR-4 / ADR-7: dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) before writing any UI component; if it is unreachable, stop and report. This does not block dev-planning.\",\n    \"ADR-2: the partial unique index quiz_attempt_one_in_progress_uq is raw SQL in the migration. Dev and CI must use prisma migrate, never db push.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":748,"cache_read_input_tokens":82763,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":748,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2cdffa8-12d1-4e17-864e-e6653bd23adc","uuid":"916d65a5-028a-4859-b59b-98654dbdde3a","timestamp":"2026-11-09T07:09:29.602Z","request_id":"req_011CgrwAjtWHNLgftvWAd5Wp","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01FjbPiCuFCcpHQ7ronMVLB9":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-10\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T13:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 19,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"19 endpoint entries.