-41 (migration, sync hooks, seed), NFR-7/NFR-9/NFR-12 (UI, reuse and test rules). These are covered in system-design §2.1, §2.2, §2.5 and §6. Print pages call services directly (nonHttpContracts).\",\n    \"Stale leftovers from SH-10: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*, artifacts/qa/* and artifacts/ui-verification/* must be regenerated for SH-11, not reused.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"devGates\": [\n    \"NFR-7: dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) before writing any UI component, especially the DataGrid keyboard editing for FR-20. If it's unreachable, stop and report. This does not block dev-planning.\",\n    \"FR-1/ADR-3: the partial unique index grading_scale_one_default is raw SQL in the migration. Use prisma migrate, never db push.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":939,"cache_read_input_tokens":83051,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":939},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2823560b-6b63-4da8-95f5-9dff2410c0ed","uuid":"54147981-69d2-4670-8495-d00c39b6b553","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:12:02.710Z","request_id":"req_011CgsLEkVkzQe2nCWEt8Nef","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012eFL8y6HMCiHGrK2MDdANE":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-11\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T17:45:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 20,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-ana