ted.\",","-    \"Decimals: input number|string ≤ 2 dp (validators/assignments.ts `decimal` pattern). Output: points and weights are fixed2 strings; computed percents are 1 dp strings or null.\",","-    \"Shared shapes live in api-contracts.json `components` (StudentTermResult, ReportCardSnapshotV1, Bands, …). validators/gradebook.ts and snapshot.ts should mirror them.\",","-    \"Contract decisions beyond system-design: PUT grade and PUT term-override return the recomputed StudentTermResult. PATCH scale isDefault:false on the current default is a VALIDATION_ERROR. The first scale created always becomes the default. mark-missing works on any source but only touches score-null rows. Report-card comments are max 1,000 chars. Unpublish reason is 1–500 chars. GET /api/report-cards mode A includes NOT_GENERATED rows.\",","-    \"No HTTP surface (by design) for FR-1, FR-3–FR-7, FR-41 (migration, sync hooks, seed), NFR-7/NFR-9/NFR-12 (UI, reuse and test rules). These are covered in system-design §2.1, §2.2, §2.5 and §6. Print pages call services directly (nonHttpContracts).\",","-    \"Stale leftovers from SH-10: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*, artifacts/qa/* and artifacts/ui-verification/* must be regenerated for SH-11, not reused.\"","+    \"12 endpoints across 10 route files (matching system-design §2.6 and the PRD API table, FR-34), plus 2 existing endpoints extended without contract change: /api/internal/email/dispatch (publishDueAnnouncements, FR-27) and /api/files/:id (the 'announcement' context, FR-30).\",","+    \"Base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, pagination (default 20, max 100; manage max 50) and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. RATE_LIMITED 429 already exists in ApiErrorCode.\",","+    \"Error policy: targeting violations → 403 (AC-3). Non-member, not-visible or non-owner access to a specific announcement → 404. State conflicts (author editing ARCHIVED, ack without requiresAck, remind when !requiresAck) → 409. Second reminder within 24h → 429 with details.retryAfter (FR-25, ADR-4).\",","+    \"Contract decisions beyond system-design: zero-recipient publish returns VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason='NO_RECIPIENTS'. PATCH mode=draft on a PUBLISHED row is 409 (archive instead). Archive is idempotent. Ack also sets readAt if it was empty. Remind with nobody left still claims the throttle and returns notified: 0. On feed page 1, pinned items are lifted to the top and meta.total excludes them. Manage accepts an optional ?status filter on displayStatus. Percentages are integers rounded half-up, or null when the denominator is 0.\",","+    \"Schema addition: Announcement.lastRemindedAt DateTime? (FR-25), already listed in system-design §1.\",","+    \"NotifyInput gains an optional mandatoryInApp override (system-design A9) so announcement.published stays a single type key (FR-26).\",","+    \"Shared DTOs (AudienceRow, AnnouncementInput, FeedItem, AnnouncementDetail, AudienceCounts) are in api-contracts.json `components`. src/lib/validators/announcements.ts should mirror them.\"","   ],","-  \"blockers\": [],","-  \"devGates\": [","-    \"NFR-7: dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) before writing any UI component, especially the DataGrid keyboard editing for FR-20. If it's unreachable, stop and report. This does not block dev-planning.\",","-    \"FR-1/ADR-3: the partial unique index grading_scale_one_default is raw SQL in the migration. Use prisma migrate, never db push.\"","-  ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-11\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T17:45:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 20,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"20 endpoint entries across 15 route files, matching system-design §2.3 and the PRD API table. POST /api/grade-items/:id/mark-missing is the only route not in the PRD (FR-24 bulk action).\",\n    \"Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. No endpoint is paginated.\",\n    \"Decimals: input number|string ≤ 2 dp (validators/assignments.ts `decimal` pattern). Output: points and weights are fixed2 strings; computed percents are 1 dp strings or null.\",\n    \"Shared shapes live in api-contracts.json `components` (StudentTermResult, ReportCardSnapshotV1, Bands, …). validators/gradebook.ts and snapshot.ts should mirror them.\",\n    \"Contract decisions beyond system-design: PUT grade and PUT term-override return the recomputed StudentTermResult. PATCH scale isDefault:false on the current default is a VALIDATION_ERROR. The first scale created always becomes the default. mark-missing works on any source but only touches score-null rows. Report-card comments are max 1,000 chars. Unpublish reason is 1–500 chars. GET /api/report-cards mode A includes NOT_GENERATED rows.\",\n    \"No HTTP surface (by design) for FR-1, FR-3–FR-7, FR-41 (migration, sync hooks, seed), NFR-7/NFR-9/NFR-12 (UI, reuse and test rules). These are covered in system-design §2.1, §2.2, §2.5 and §6. Print pages call services directly (nonHttpContracts).\",\n    \"Stale leftovers from SH-10: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/*, artifacts/dev/*, artifacts/qa/* and artifacts/ui-verification/* must be regenerated for SH-11, not reused.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"devGates\": [\n    \"NFR-7: dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) before writing any UI component, especially the DataGrid keyboard editing for FR-20. If it's unreachable, stop and report. This does not block dev-planning.\",\n    \"FR-1/ADR-3: the partial unique index grading_scale_one_default is raw SQL in the migration. Use prisma migrate, never db push.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MS3qNGU55NVCNRqCrQmdRy","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
