  \"Decisions made beyond system-design: leave refusals use details.reason 'ONE_TO_ONE' or 'CREATOR_OF_STUDENT_GROUP'. A review requires a note; a dismissal does not. Safeguarding GET /conversations/:id returns 404 when involvesStudent is false. The message poll returns hasMore only in initial and 'before' mode. The dispatch summary gains messageEmails {sent, deferred, dropped}.\",\n    \"Carried risks from system-design §1: there is no user-admin UI for isSafeguardingLead; mui-mcp must be used in dev (NFR-5); the rate limiter is per-process; students/[id] needs a new layout.tsx.\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/messaging.ts should mirror the DTOs in api-contracts.json `components`.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":11,"newStart":1,"newLines":11,"lines":[" {","-  \"ticketId\": \"SH-12\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T19:35:00Z\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"SH-13\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T22:42:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"architect\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\","," ","   \"status\": \"complete\",","-  \"endpointCount\": 12,","+  \"endpointCount\": 23,","   \"blockers\": [],","   \"artifacts\": [","     \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\","]},{"oldStart":14,"oldLines":13,"newStart":14,"newLines":12,"lines":["     \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"","   ],","   \"notes\": [","-    \"12 endpoints across 10 route files (matching system-design §2.6 and the PRD API table, FR-34), plus 2 existing endpoints extended without contract change: /api/internal/email/dispatch (publishDueAnnouncements, FR-27) and /api/files/:id (the 'announcement' context, FR-30).\",","-    \"Base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, pagination (default 20, max 100; manage max 50) and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. RATE_LIMITED 429 already exists in ApiErrorCode.\",","-    \"Error policy: targeting violations → 403 (AC-3). Non-member, not-visible or non-owner access to a specific announcement → 404. State conflicts (author editing ARCHIVED, ack without requiresAck, remind when !requiresAck) → 409. Second reminder within 24h → 429 with details.retryAfter (FR-25, ADR-4).\",","-    \"Contract decisions beyond system-design: zero-recipient publish returns VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason='NO_RECIPIENTS'. PATCH mode=draft on a PUBLISHED row is 409 (archive instead). Archive is idempotent. Ack also sets readAt if it was empty. Remind with nobody left still claims the throttle and returns notified: 0. On feed page 1, pinned items are lifted to the top and meta.total excludes them. Manage accepts an optional ?status filter on displayStatus. Percentages are integers rounded half-up, or null when the denominator is 0.\",","-    \"Schema addition: Announcement.lastRemindedAt DateTime? (FR-25), already listed in system-design §1.\",","-    \"NotifyInput gains an optional mandatoryInApp override (system-design A9) so announcement.published stays a single type key (FR-26).\",","-    \"Shared DTOs (AudienceRow, AnnouncementInput, FeedItem, AnnouncementDetail, AudienceCounts) are in api-contracts.json `components`. src/lib/validators/announcements.ts should mirror them.\"","+    \"There are 23 endpoints. 21 are new routes from system-design §3.3. 2 are existing routes that get extended: PATCH /api/users/:id (isSafeguardingLead, FR-2) and POST /api/internal/email/dispatch (processPendingMessageEmails, FR-20). The file routes gain the 'message' context with no contract change (FR-27).\",","+    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. VALIDATION_ERROR maps to 400, not 422, so the 422 mentioned for isSafeguardingLead in system-design §1 should be read as 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.\",","+    \"Error policy: a non-participant or a participant who has left gets 404. Contact rules, relationship ended, the edit window and safeguarding access give 403 with details.reason. A duplicate OPEN report or reviewing a non-OPEN report gives 409. The rate limit gives 429 with details.retryAfterMs.\",","+    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: leave refusals use details.reason 'ONE_TO_ONE' or 'CREATOR_OF_STUDENT_GROUP'. A review requires a note; a dismissal does not. Safeguarding GET /conversations/:id returns 404 when involvesStudent is false. The message poll returns hasMore only in initial and 'before' mode. The dispatch summary gains messageEmails {sent, deferred, dropped}.\",","+    \"Carried risks from system-design §1: there is no user-admin UI for isSafeguardingLead; mui-mcp must be used in dev (NFR-5); the rate limiter is per-process; students/[id] needs a new layout.tsx.\",","+    \"src/lib/validators/messaging.ts should mirror the DTOs in api-contracts.json `components`.\"","   ],","   \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-12\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T19:35:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 12,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"12 endpoints across 10 route files (matching system-design §2.6 and the PRD API table, FR-34), plus 2 existing endpoints extended without contract change: /api/internal/email/dispatch (publishDueAnnouncements, FR-27) and /api/files/:id (the 'announcement' context, FR-30).\",\n    \"Base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, pagination (default 20, max 100; manage max 50) and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. RATE_LIMITED 429 already exists in ApiErrorCode.\",\n    \"Error policy: targeting violations → 403 (AC-3). Non-member, not-visible or non-owner access to a specific announcement → 404. State conflicts (author editing ARCHIVED, ack without requiresAck, remind when !requiresAck) → 409. Second reminder within 24h → 429 with details.retryAfter (FR-25, ADR-4).\",\n    \"Contract decisions beyond system-design: zero-recipient publish returns VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason='NO_RECIPIENTS'. PATCH mode=draft on a PUBLISHED row is 409 (archive instead). Archive is idempotent. Ack also sets readAt if it was empty. Remind with nobody left still claims the throttle and returns notified: 0. On feed page 1, pinned items are lifted to the top and meta.total excludes them. Manage accepts an optional ?status filter on displayStatus. Percentages are integers rounded half-up, or null when the denominator is 0.\",\n    \"Schema addition: Announcement.lastRemindedAt DateTime? (FR-25), already listed in system-design §1.\",\n    \"NotifyInput gains an optional mandatoryInApp override (system-design A9) so announcement.published stays a single type key (FR-26).\",\n    \"Shared DTOs (AudienceRow, AnnouncementInput, FeedItem, AnnouncementDetail, AudienceCounts) are in api-contracts.json `components`. src/lib/validators/announcements.ts should mirror them.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017c6ztowkxAUu3AxUUFX7Rm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
