{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LTpU9LsmGWRkTFuwCE7Qc8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-13\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T22:40:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"replaces\": \"This file replaces the stale SH-12 contracts.\",\n    \"basePath\": \"/api. This is the existing SchoolHub convention, not /api/v1. Route files are src/app/api/**/route.ts. (FR-28)\",\n    \"handlerPipeline\": \"withHandler → requireUser / requireRole, or requireSafeguardingLead for safeguarding routes → parseQuery / parseBody with schemas from src/lib/validators/messaging.ts → one service call in src/server/messaging/* → ok(data) / ok(data, {status:201}) / paginated(data, meta). (NFR-6)\",\n    \"envelopes\": {\n      \"success\": \"{ data: T }\",\n      \"list\": \"{ data: T[], meta: { page, pageSize, total } } for page-based lists. Pagination comes from parsePagination: default page size 20, max 100.\",\n      \"error\": \"{ error: { code, message, details? } }\"\n    },\n    \"errorCodes\": {\n      \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n      \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n      \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n      \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n      \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n      \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429\n    },\n    \"errorPolicy\": [\n      \"If the caller is not a participant, or has left (leftAt is set), the API returns 404 NOT_FOUND. A conversation cuid is never treated as authorisation. (NFR-1)\",\n      \"A contact-rule violation on create returns 403 FORBIDDEN, and nothing is written. (FR-6)\",\n      \"A send after the relationship has ended returns 403 FORBIDDEN with details.reason='RELATIONSHIP_ENDED'. (FR-7)\",\n      \"An edit or delete by someone other than the sender, more than 15 minutes after sending, or on an already-deleted message returns 403 FORBIDDEN. details.reason is 'NOT_SENDER', 'EDIT_WINDOW_EXPIRED' or 'ALREADY_DELETED'. (FR-15)\",\n      \"A rate-limit hit returns 429 RATE_LIMITED with details.retryAfterMs. (NFR-4)\",\n      \"A caller who is not an ADMIN with isSafeguardingLead=true (read from the database) gets 403 FORBIDDEN on /api/safeguarding/*. (FR-23, NFR-1)\"\n    ],\n    \"ids\": \"All ids are cuid strings. All timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC strings. The client renders them in the school timezone. (NFR-6)\"\n  },\n\n  \"components\": {\n    \"UserSummary\": { \"id\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"role\": \"ADMIN|TEACHER|STUDENT|PARENT\", \"avatarUrl\": \"string|null\" },\n    \"Attachment\": { \"fileId\": \"string\", \"name\": \"string\", \"mimeType\": \"string\", \"size\": \"number\", \"url\": \"string (/api/files/:id, gated by the 'message' file context, FR-27)\" },\n    \"MessageDTO\": {\n      \"id\": \"string\",\n      \"conversationId\": \"string\",\n      \"sender\": \"UserSummary\",\n      \"body\": \"string|null (null when deleted)\",\n      \"deleted\": \"boolean\",\n      \"editedAt\": \"string|null\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"string\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"string\",\n      \"attachments\": \"Attachment[] (empty when deleted)\",\n      \"isOwn\": \"boolean\",\n      \"canEdit\": \"boolean (isOwn, not deleted, and now - createdAt ≤ 15 min)\"\n    },\n    \"ConversationListItem\": {\n      \"id\": \"string\",\n      \"subject\": \"string|null\",\n      \"participants\": \"UserS\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-13\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T22:42:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 23,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"There are 23 endpoints. 21 are new routes from system-design §3.3. 2 are existing routes that get extended: PATCH /api/users/:id (isSafeguardingLead, FR-2) and POST /api/internal/email/dispatch (processPendingMessageEmails, FR-20). The file routes gain the 'message' context with no contract change (FR-27).\",\n    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. VALIDATION_ERROR maps to 400, not 422, so the 422 mentioned for isSafeguardingLead in system-design §1 should be read as 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.\",\n    \"Error policy: a non-participant or a participant who has left gets 404. Contact rules, relationship ended, the edit window and safeguarding access give 403 with details.reason. A duplicate OPEN report or reviewing a non-OPEN report gives 409. The rate limit gives 429 with details.retryAfterMs.\",\n    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: leave refusals use details.reason 'ONE_TO_ONE' or 'CREATOR_OF_STUDENT_GROUP'. A review requires a note; a dismissal does not. Safeguarding GET /conversations/:id returns 404 when involvesStudent is false. The message poll returns hasMore only in initial and 'before' mode. The dispatch summary gains messageEmails {sent, deferred, dropped}.\",\n    \"Carried risks from system-design §1: there is no user-admin UI for isSafeguardingLead; mui-mcp must be used in dev (NFR-5); the rate limiter is per-process; students/[id] needs a new layout.tsx.\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/messaging.ts should mirror the DTOs in api-contracts.json `components`.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n\nsrc/lib:\ndates.ts\nenv.ts\nlogger.ts\nmessaging\nvalidators\nvideo.ts\n\nsrc/server:\nassignments\nattendance\naudit.ts\nauth\ncontent\ncourses\ncsv.ts\ndb.ts\nemail\nenrollment\nfiles\ngradebook\nhttp.ts\nmessaging\nnotifications\nquiz\nrate-limit.ts\nreport-cards\nsections\nservices\nstorage.ts\ntimetable\n(eval):1: no matches found: src/lib/api*.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f1e9cdf-3174-43b4-adaa-4e6aa4038a8c","uuid":"b933b6e5-2236-496f-bf37-eebd97e5bab2","timestamp":"2026-11-09T18:54:09.054Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"ticket