en; teachers may still change it.\",\n149\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n150\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-4.4; AC-2\"\n151\t    },\n152\t    {\n153\t      \"id\": \"FR-25\",\n154\t      \"description\": \"Teachers may select EXCUSED in the register only when an approved note covers that student/date/period; ADMIN can always set EXCUSED (relaxes current ADMIN-only rule in attendance-service).\",\n155\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n156\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-4.5\"\n157\t    },\n158\t    {\n159\t      \"id\": \"FR-26\",\n160\t      \"description\": \"Parent is notified of the review decision including the reviewer's note (absence_note.reviewed, default email true).\",\n161\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n162\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-4.6; AC-4\"\n163\t    },\n164\t    {\n165\t      \"id\": \"FR-27\",\n166\t      \"description\": \"PRD-07 attendance.absent notifications are suppressed for a student when a PENDING or APPROVED note covers that date/period.\",\n167\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n168\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-4.7; AC-2\"\n169\t    },\n170\t    {\n171\t      \"id\": \"FR-28\",\n172\t      \"description\": \"Admin creates/edits ConferenceEvent at /admin/conferences (title, date, booking window, slot length, eligible grade levels); teachers teaching eligible students are notified (conference.slots_requested).\",\n173\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n174\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.1; API POST/PATCH /api/conferences\"\n175\t    },\n176\t    {\n177\t      \"id\": \"FR-29\",\n178\t      \"description\": \"Teacher availability page /conferences/[id]/availability: pick time ranges and location; system regenerates unbooked slots of slotMinutes; teachers can remove unbooked slots and block individual slots.\",\n179\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n180\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.2; API PUT /api/conferences/:id/availability\"\n181\t    },\n182\t    {\n183\t      \"id\": \"FR-30\",\n184\t      \"description\": \"Parent booking