iption, due date, optional linked CalendarEvent, audience; parents of audience students notified (consent.requested, default email true).\",\n221\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n222\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.1\"\n223\t    },\n224\t    {\n225\t      \"id\": \"FR-37\",\n226\t      \"description\": \"Parents see pending consent forms on the child overview and at /consent-forms; responding requires Granted/Declined and a typed signature matching the parent's name case-insensitively, plus optional comment.\",\n227\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n228\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.2; AC-7\"\n229\t    },\n230\t    {\n231\t      \"id\": \"FR-38\",\n232\t      \"description\": \"One response per student (any linked parent); responses may be changed until dueAt and every change is audited.\",\n233\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n234\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.2\"\n235\t    },\n236\t    {\n237\t      \"id\": \"FR-39\",\n238\t      \"description\": \"Creator/admin tracking page shows per-student status (Granted, Declined, No response) with filters, CSV export (?format=csv), and 'Remind non-responders' throttled to once per 24 hours.\",\n239\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n240\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.3; API tracking/remind\"\n241\t    },\n242\t    {\n243\t      \"id\": \"FR-40\",\n244\t      \"description\": \"Maintenance run sends a reminder 48 hours before dueAt to parents with no response.\",\n245\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n246\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.4\"\n247\t    },\n248\t    {\n249\t      \"id\": \"FR-41\",\n250\t      \"description\": \"Register file context 'absence-note' readable by the submitting parent, other linked parents, homeroom teacher and admins.\",\n251\t      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n252\t      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-7.1\"\n253\t    },\n254\t    {\n255\t      \"id\": \"FR-42\",\n256\t      \"description\": \"Navigation entries: Parents — My children, Absence notes, Conferences, Consent forms; Teachers — Absen