3.1; AC-8\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Child overview is the default landing page for parents after sign-in (within 2 clicks of sign-in).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3 heading; Goals 1; AC-8\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-9\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Today' card shows the child's schedule for today or a holiday message (PRD-06/14 data).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3.2 Today\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Attendance' card shows term rate, absences and lates this term, last 5 marks and a 'Report an absence' button.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3.2 Attendance\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Assignments' card shows missing assignments (red) and those due in the next 7 days.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3.2 Assignments\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-12\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Recent grades' card shows last 5 returned/visible grades with course and score, plus current percent per course.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3.2 Recent grades\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Announcements' card shows the last 3 unread announcements for this child.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3.2 Announcements (PRD-12 Announcement model not present in workspace)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-14\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Upcoming events' card shows the next 5 calendar items.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-3.2 Upcoming events\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Overview 'Teachers' card lists the child's teachers with subject and a 'Message' button (PRD-13 messaging).\",