ource\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.1; API POST/PATCH /api/conferences\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-29\",\n      \"description\": \"Teacher availability page /conferences/[id]/availability: pick time ranges and location; system regenerates unbooked slots of slotMinutes; teachers can remove unbooked slots and block individual slots.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.2; API PUT /api/conferences/:id/availability\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-30\",\n      \"description\": \"Parent booking page /conferences/[id] shows, for each of the selected child's teachers with slots, available slots as time buttons; booking is atomic (UPDATE … WHERE bookedByParentId IS NULL) with an optional note.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-31\",\n      \"description\": \"Booking rules: max one slot per teacher per child; overlapping bookings with other teachers are rejected with message 'You already have a meeting with <teacher> at <time>'.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.3; AC-6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-32\",\n      \"description\": \"Reschedule = cancel + book; cancellation allowed until bookingClosesAt (booking only within booking window).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-33\",\n      \"description\": \"Booking/cancellation notifies parent and teacher (conference.booked, conference.cancelled) with an .ics attachment link.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-34\",\n      \"description\": \"Teacher day view lists booked slots in order with student, parent and note, and is printable.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-35\",\n      \"description\": \"Booked conference slots appear on both parties' calendars as PRD-14 source 'My meetings'.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-5.7 (PRD-14 calendar UI/aggregation not present in workspace)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-36\",\n      \"description\": \"Admins (any audience) and teachers (courses they manage) create consent forms at /consent-forms/new with title, Markdown description, due date, optional linked CalendarEvent, audience; parents of audience students notified (consent.requested, default email true).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-37\",\n      \"description\": \"Parents see pending consent forms on the child overview and at /consent-forms; responding requires Granted/Declined and a typed signature matching the parent's name case-insensitively, plus optional comment.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.2; AC-7\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-38\",\n      \"description\": \"One response per student (any linked parent); responses may be changed until dueAt and every change is audited.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-39\",\n      \"description\": \"Creator/admin tracking page shows per-student status (Granted, Declined, No response) with filters, CSV export (?format=csv), and 'Remind non-responders' throttled to once per 24 hours.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.3; API tracking/remind\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-40\",\n      \"description\": \"Maintenance run sends a reminder 48 hours before dueAt to parents with no response.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-6.4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-41\",\n      \"description\": \"Register file context 'absence-note' readable by the submitting parent, other linked parents, homeroom teacher and admins.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-7.1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-42\",\n      \"description\": \"Navigation entries: Parents — My children, Absence notes, Conferences, Consent forms; Teachers — Absence notes (homeroom only), Conferences; Admins — Conferences, Consent forms, Absence notes.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-8.1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-43\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement the REST API table (me/children/summary, students/:id/overview, absence-notes CRUD/review, conferences, availability, slots, book/cancel, consent-forms, responses, tracking, remind) with role checks enforced server-side via requireRole/access helpers and the standard response/error shapes.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 API table; Platform Context conventions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-44\",\n      \"description\": \"Register new notification types absence_note.submitted, absence_note.reviewed, conference.slots_requested, conference.booked, conference.cancelled, consent.requested (and consent reminder) in src/server/notifications/types.ts.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 FR-4/5/6 notify keys; Platform Context notifications rule (reminder key name not specified)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-45\",\n      \"description\": \"Seed data: one pending and one approved absence note for Grade 7; 'Autumn conferences' 3 weeks out for Grade 7 with Tom and Tina slots 15:00–17:00 (10 min), two booked; consent form 'Science Museum Trip' for Grade 7 due in 10 days linked to a calendar event with 40% responses.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Seed Data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-46\",\n      \"description\": \"Tests: unit (absence coverage matching whole-day/periods/multi-day, slot generation, signature match); integration (approval updates/pre-fill, concurrent atomic booking, notification suppression); Playwright (absence note → approve → register EXCUSED; book conference slot; sign consent).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Test Requirements\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nonFunctionalRequirements\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Concurrency: two simultaneous bookings of the same slot → exactly one succeeds; the other gets 'That slot was just taken' (409 CONFLICT) and refreshed slots.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 NFR-1; AC-5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Performance: child overview first section paints < 1 s; full page < 2 s.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 NFR-2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Auditability: absence approvals, consent responses and changes write AuditLog entries including IP address.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 NFR-3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-4\",\n      \"description\": \"UI component rule: Material UI only (@mui/material v9, icons, MUI X data-grid/date-pickers/charts/scheduler); every component looked up via mui-mcp (useMuiDocs + fetchDocs) before use; banned libraries (Tailwind, shadcn, Radix, Chakra, lucide-react, notistack, etc.) never imported; toasts via shared useToast(), confirmations via Dialog, pickers via Autocomplete; MCP unreachable = blocker. QA must verify.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Platform Context — UI component rule (item 6 mandates recording as NFR)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Security/access: every handler and server page enforces access server-side; parents only for linked students, homeroom teachers only for their section, consent tracking only creator/admin.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Platform Context — Roles; code conventions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Brownfield: reuse existing models/services/components/helpers (audit(), notify(), files contexts, attendance-service, AudienceType/audience.ts, DataTable, FileUpload, MarkdownView, ConfirmDialog, UserAvatar); new services in src/server/<feature>/<feature>-service.ts; no renames, no re-scaffolding.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Platform Context — Code layout and conventions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Quality gates: npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run test stay green; TypeScript strict; Zod validators in src/lib/validators/<feature>.ts shared by forms and handlers; no console.log (use logger).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Platform Context — Constraints; conventions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Date handling: timestamps stored UTC, displayed and date rules (absence windows, 'today', due dates, 48h reminder) evaluated in SchoolSettings.timezone; date-only fields use @db.Date.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Platform Context — conventions; Assumptions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-9\",\n      \"description\": \"Scope: deliver in a single forge run; no payments, pickup/transport, or parent self-registration; do not modify behaviour owned by PRD-16+.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Out of Scope; Constraints\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"NFR-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Lists use standard pagination (?page, ?pageSize ≤100), sorting and ?q search where applicable.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"source\": \"PRD-15 Platform Context — Pagination conventions\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 95,\n  \"clarificationLog\": [\n    {\n      \"round\": 1,\n      \"questions\": [\n        \"PRD-12 Announcement model/read-state is absent from the workspace (only src/server/announcements/audience.ts). Should the overview Announcements card render an empty state, or must SH-15 add a minimal Announcement read model? (FR-13)\",\n        \"PRD-14 dev phase failed (run-summary SH-14 dev failedCount=1): CalendarEvent models exist but no calendar pages/API. How should 'My meetings' (FR-35), 'Upcoming events' (FR-14), calendar studentId filter (FR-5) and ConsentForm.eventId linking be satisfied?\",\n        \"Shared wrappers live under src/components/<Name>/ (e.g. src/components/Toast/useToast.ts), not src/components/shared/ as the PRD states. Confirm reuse in place rather than moving.\",\n        \"Student detail route is /students/[id] (not [studentId]); confirm overview 'View all' links target existing tabs.\",\n        \"No parent timetable/grades page with a child selector found under src/app/(app) (only /grades, /assignments and /api/me/timetable). Which pages must adopt the sh_child default (FR-5)?\",\n        \"Notification key name for the 48h consent reminder and the manual 'Remind non-responders' is not specified (FR-44).\",\n        \"Does 'block individual slots' need a new ConferenceSlot field (schema has none), or is a blocked slot represented by deleting it? (FR-29)\"\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": [\n        \"PRD-12 Announcement model/read-state is absent from the workspace (only src/server/announcements/audience.ts). Should the overview Announcements card render an empty state, or must SH-15 add a minimal Announcement read model? (FR-13)\",\n        \"PRD-14 dev phase failed (run-summary SH-14 dev failedCount=1): CalendarEvent models exist but no calendar pages/API. How should 'My meetings' (FR-35), 'Upcoming events' (FR-14), calendar studentId filter (FR-5) and ConsentForm.eventId linking be satisfied?\",\n        \"Shared wrappers live under src/components/<Name>/ (e.g. src/components/Toast/useToast.ts), not src/components/shared/ as the PRD states. Confirm reuse in place rather than moving.\",\n        \"Student detail route is /students/[id] (not [studentId]); confirm overview 'View all' links target existing tabs.\",\n        \"No parent timetable/grades page with a child selector found under src/app/(app) (only /grades, /assignments and /api/me/timetable). Which pages must adopt the sh_child default (FR-5)?\",\n        \"Notification key name for the 48h consent reminder and the manual 'Remind non-responders' is not specified (FR-44).\",\n        \"Does 'block individual slots' need a new ConferenceSlot field (schema has none), or is a blocked slot represented by deleting it? (FR-29)\"\n      ],\n      \"note\": \"No interactive user available; aggregate confidence (95%) exceeds 80% threshold so no further rounds run. Items forwarded to Architect as flagged assumptions.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}","numLines":373,"startLine":1,"totalLines":373}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Eohdz6mcBaRTfn2CjwLJrL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
