{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014pLbs3H63hoFiXNoc3QqTy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-14\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T00:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"replaces\": \"This file replaces the stale SH-13 contracts.\",\n    \"basePath\": \"/api. This is the existing SchoolHub convention, not /api/v1. Route files are src/app/api/**/route.ts. (NFR-8)\",\n    \"handlerPipeline\": \"withHandler → requireUser / requireRole (except the feed and public events) → parseQuery / parseBody with schemas from src/lib/validators/calendar.ts → one service call in src/server/calendar/* → ok(data) / ok(data, {status:201}). Reuse src/server/http.ts; do not hand-roll envelopes. (NFR-8, NFR-9)\",\n    \"envelopes\": {\n      \"success\": \"{ data: T }\",\n      \"error\": \"{ error: { code, message, details? } }\",\n      \"nonJson\": \"GET /api/events/:id/ics, GET /api/calendar/feed/:token and GET /api/events/:id/rsvps?format=csv return raw bodies (text/calendar or text/csv), not the JSON envelope.\"\n    },\n    \"errorCodes\": {\n      \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n      \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n      \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n      \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n      \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n      \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429\n    },\n    \"errorPolicy\": [\n      \"An event the caller cannot see returns 404 NOT_FOUND, so its existence does not leak. An event cuid is never treated as authorisation. (NFR-5, NFR-7)\",\n      \"A visible event the caller may not change (not the creator and not ADMIN) returns 403 FORBIDDEN with details.reason='NOT_CREATOR'. (FR-8)\",\n      \"A non-admin who sends is\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-14\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T00:12:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 18,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"There are 18 endpoints. 14 are new routes from system-design §2.5. 4 are existing routes that get extended: GET /api/attendance/today (noSchoolReason), GET /api/attendance/register (noSchoolReason), PUT /api/attendance/register (holidayOverride, D-8) and POST /api/internal/email/dispatch (sendRsvpReminders). There are also 4 non-HTTP contracts: getUpcomingEventsForUser, getPublicEvents, isSchoolDay and the notification types.\",\n    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes and error codes come from src/server/http.ts, where VALIDATION_ERROR maps to 400. The feed, the single-event .ics and the RSVP CSV return raw bodies. An unknown feed token returns 404 text/plain.\",\n    \"Error policy: an event the caller cannot see, or a studentId they cannot view, returns 404. Not the creator, an admin-only field, a disallowed audience, or not in the audience returns 403 with details.reason. RSVP disabled or closed returns 409. Rate limits return 429 with details.retryAfterMs and Retry-After.\",\n    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: all-day input is startDate/endDate (yyyy-MM-dd, inclusive end) and output is an exclusive UTC end. audiences is limited to 1..20 entries. rsvpDeadline must be ≤ the first occurrence's start. Occurrence ids are '<eventId>:<startISO>', and all /api/events/:id routes take the plain eventId. GET /api/attendance/register also gains noSchoolReason (system-design names only getToday/getOverview). Term breaks send no event.created notifications and return {created, skipped, events}. The dispatch summary gains rsvpReminders {events, notified}.\",\n    \"Carried risks from system-design §4: R1 beta @mui/x-scheduler API drift (exact pin, MUI MCP lookup is mandatory, NFR-2), R2 import cycle (calendar-service must never import timetable-service), R3 DST across 4 code paths, R4 audience resolver parity test.\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json is still the stale SH-13 file. No architect sub-task owns it in this phase, so treat it as out of date.\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/calendar.ts should mirror the input shapes in api-contracts.json `components` (EventInput, RsvpInput, AudienceInput).\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-14\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T18:56:01.219Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"consideredKeywords\": [\n    \"authentication\",\n    \"authorization\",\n    \"encryption\",\n    \"pii\",\n    \"secrets\",\n    \"input validation\"\n  ],\n  \"missingConsiderations\": [\n    \"authentication\",\n    \"authorization\",\n    \"encryption\",\n    \"pii\",\n    \"secrets\",\n    \"input validation\"\n  ]\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6637fabe-b275-41d2-a9c7-8a4e5da1a9d1","uuid":"3c43782e-3cbf-46b8-afbc-9f32afa0779c","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:18:52.476Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-14\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T00:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"replaces\": \"This file replaces the stale SH-13 contracts.\",\n    \"basePath\": \"/api. This is the existing SchoolHub convention, not /api/v1. Route files are src/app/api/**/route.ts. (NFR-8)\",\n    \"handlerPipeline\": \"withHandler → requireUser / requireRole (except the feed and public events) → parseQuery / parseBody with schemas from src/lib/validators/calendar.ts → one service call in src/server/calendar/* → ok(data) / ok(data, {status:201}). Reuse src/server/http.ts; do not hand-roll envelopes. (NFR-8, NFR-9)\",\n    \"envelopes\": {\n      \"success\": \"{ data: T }\",\n      \"error\": \"{ error: { code, message, details? } }\",\n      \"nonJson\": \"GET /api/events/:id/ics, GET /api/calendar/feed/:token and GET /api/events/:id/rsvps?format=csv return 