{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FtRSqpqL3pvcLF1eE9HGDE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-15\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T13:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"replaces\": \"This file replaces the stale SH-14 contracts.\",\n    \"basePath\": \"/api. This is the existing SchoolHub convention, not /api/v1. Route files are src/app/api/**/route.ts. (FR-43, NFR-6)\",\n    \"handlerPipeline\": \"withHandler → requireUser / requireRole → parseQuery / parseBody with schemas from src/lib/validators/{absence-notes,conferences,consent-forms}.ts → access helper (assertCanViewStudent, assertHomeroomOrAdmin, assertConsentOwnerOrAdmin) → \n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-15\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T13:35:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 29,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"There are 29 endpoints. 24 are new routes from system-design §2.3. 5 are existing routes that get extended: POST /api/files (absence-note context), GET /api/me/timetable (sh_child default), GET and PUT /api/attendance/register (EXCUSED pre-fill and rule, absent-notification suppression) and POST /api/internal/email/dispatch (consentReminders). There are also 3 non-HTTP contracts: the notification types, getSelectedChild, and the pure helpers.\",\n    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, paginated() meta and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. http.ts has no 422, so system-design's '422' business-rule failures map to 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason (OUTSIDE_BOOKING_WINDOW, PAST_DUE, SIGNATURE_MISMATCH, DATE_WINDOW).\",\n    \"Error policy: an unviewable student or resource returns 404. A visible resource the caller may not act on returns 403 with details.reason. Races return 409 with details.reason (SLOT_TAKEN, OVERLAP, ONE_PER_TEACHER, ALREADY_REVIEWED, SLOT_BOOKED). The remind throttle returns 429 with retryAfterMs.\",\n    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: GET /api/conferences/:id/slots?view=day serves the teacher day view (FR-34). Slot booking details are hidden from anyone except the booker, the teacher and ADMIN. GET /api/students/:id/overview accepts ?cards= to limit which cards load. PATCH /api/conferences/:id returns 409 if booked slots exist and slotMinutes or date changes. The tracking CSV ignores pagination.\",\n    \"Partial requirements carried from system-design: FR-13 (announcements returns []), FR-35 and the calendar part of FR-5 (no PRD-14 calendar page). Neither is a blocker.\",\n    \"Three schema columns go beyond the PRD (ADR-3): ConferenceSlot.blocked, ConsentForm.lastRemindedAt and ConsentForm.dueReminderSentAt. The migration also adds a raw-SQL partial unique index on ConferenceSlot(eventId, teacherId, bookedForStudentId).\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/{absence-notes,conferences,consent-forms}.ts should mirror the input shapes in api-contracts.json `components`.\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json is still the stale SH-14 file. No architect sub-task owns it, so treat it as out of date.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n\n# System Design: PRD-16 Role Dashboards, Reports & Early-Warning Insights\n\nTicket: SH-16 · Phase: architect (arch-design-system) · Timestamp: 2026-11-10T14:00:00Z · Status: complete\n\nInputs: `artifacts/intake/requirements.json` (FR-1 to FR-46, NFR-1 to NFR-12), `artifacts/intake/handoff-to-architect.json`, `artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md` (ADR-1 to ADR-11), `artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md`. The SH-15 version of this file was moved to `artifacts/architect/.prev-SH-15/system-design.md`.\ntotal 200\ndrwxr-xr-x   9 ikramaansari  staff    288 Nov 10 09:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 ikramaansari  staff    384 Nov  9 16:57 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 ikramaansari  staff    128 Nov 10 09:30 .prev-SH-15\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  25803 Nov 10 08:30 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   2626 Nov 10 08:30 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  20056 Nov 10 09:30 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  28645 Nov 10 09:32 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  14295 Nov 10 09:29 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    397 Nov 10 08:30 threat-model-notes.json\n72e8d0c SH-15\n5249eec SH-14\nb8e056b SH-13","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3dc3003b-f495-40f4-b937-7fc5d8e13052","uuid":"fbfddc6c-b081-4e4d-9f66-01fceddcbbb1","timestamp":"2026-11-10T04:32:52.567Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-15\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T13:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"replaces\": \"This file replaces the stale SH-14 contracts.\",\n    \"basePath\": \"/api. This is the existing SchoolHub convention, not /api/v1. Route files are src/app/api/**/route.ts. (FR-43, NFR-6)\",\n    \"handlerPipeline\": \"withHandler → requireUser / requireRole → parseQuery / parseBody with schemas from src/lib/validators/{absence-notes,conferences,consent-forms}.ts → access helper (assertCanViewStudent, assertHomeroomOrAdmin, assertConsentOwnerOrAdmin) → \n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-15\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T13:35:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 29,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"There are 29 endpoints. 24 are new routes from system-design §2.3. 5 are existing routes that get extended: POST /api/files (absence-note context), GET /api/me/timetable (sh_child default), GET and PUT /api/attendance/register (EXCUSED pre-fill and rule, absent-notification suppression) and POST /api/internal/email/dispatch (consentReminders). There are also 3 non-HTTP contracts: the notification types, getSelectedChild, and the pure helpers.\",\n    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, paginated() meta and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. http.ts has no 422, so system-design's '422' business-rule failures map to 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason (OUTSIDE_BOOKING_WINDOW, PAST_DUE, SIGNATURE_MISMATCH, DATE_WINDOW).\",\n    \"Error policy: an unviewable student or resource returns 404. A visible resource the caller may not act on returns 403 with details.reason. Races return 409 with details.reason (SLOT_TAKEN, OVERLAP, ONE_PER_TEACHER, ALREADY_REVIEWED, SLOT_BOOKED). The remind throttle returns 429 with retryAfterMs.\",\n    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: GET /api/conferences/:id/slots?view=day serves the teacher day view (FR-34). Slot booking details are hidden from anyone except the booker, the teacher and ADMIN. GET /api/students/:id/overview accepts ?cards= to limit which cards load. PATCH /api/conferences/:id returns 409 if booked slots exist and slotMinutes or date changes. The tracking CSV ignores pagination.\",\n    \"Partial requirements carried from system-design: FR-13 (announcements returns []), FR-35 and the calendar part of FR-5 (no PRD-14 calendar page). Neither is a blocker.\",\n    \"Three schema columns go beyond the PRD (ADR-3): ConferenceSlot.blocked, ConsentForm.lastRemindedAt and ConsentForm.dueReminderSentAt. The migration also adds a raw-SQL partial unique index on ConferenceSlot(eventId, teacherId, bookedForStudentId).\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/{absence-notes,conferences,consent-forms}.ts should mirror the input shapes in api-contracts.json `components`.\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json is still the stale SH-14 file. No architect sub-task owns it, so treat it as out of date.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n\n# System Design: PRD-16 Role Dashboards, Reports & Early-Warning Insights\n\nTicket: SH-16 · Phase: architect (arch-design-system) · Timestamp: 2026-11-10T14:00:00Z · Status: complete\n\nInputs: `artifacts/intake/requirements.json` (FR-1 to FR-46, NFR-1 to NFR-12), `artifacts/intake/handoff-to-architect.json`, `artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md` (ADR-1 to ADR-11), `artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md`. The SH-15 version of this file was moved to `artifacts/architect/.prev-SH-15/system-design.md`.\ntotal 200\ndrwxr-xr-x   9 ikramaansari  staff    288 Nov 10 09:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 ikramaansari  staff    384 Nov  9 16:57 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 ikramaansari  staff    128 Nov 10 09:30 .prev-SH-15\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  25803 Nov 10 08:30 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   2626 Nov 10 08:30 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  20056 Nov 10 09:30 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  28645 Nov 10 09:32 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  14295 Nov 10 09:29 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    397 Nov 10 08:30 threat-model-notes.json\n72e8d0c SH-15\n5249eec SH-14\nb8e056b SH-13","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FtRSqpqL3pvcLF1eE9HGDE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
