{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AjaCRWu12EP1J3GrPLJC9B","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-16\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 58,\n  \"functionalCount\": 46,\n  \"nonFunctionalCount\": 12,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 91,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"warnings\": [\n    \"PRD-12 Announcement model is absent: FR-8 and FR-14 (announcement widgets) and FR-38 (announcement read rate) have no data source. Default is an empty state or an omitted metric.\",\n    \"PRD-14 has no calendar service or API, but the CalendarEvent model exists. FR-21 (upcoming events) should read the model directly.\",\n    \"FR-28 (LOW): 'one row per student per term, upserted' conflicts with the trend arrow and the snapshot history. The Architect must choose a history design.\",\n    \"'Missing' is derived, not stored (SubmissionStatus is SUBMITTED|RETURNED). Reuse the definition in src/server/assignments/reminders.ts with a 30-day window.\",\n    \"The hourly risk recompute should hook into the existing maintenance pass in src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts.\",\n    \"Shared components live under src/components/<Name>/ (StatCard, DataTable, LoadingSkeleton), not src/components/shared/. The student tab registry is src/config/student-tabs.ts.\",\n    \"Previous SH-15 intake artifacts are archived in artifacts/intake/.prev-SH-15/.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\nrequirements-analysis-notes.md\nsystem-design.md\n['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'conventions', 'components', 'endpoints', 'nonHttpContracts', 'status']\n{\n \"method\": \"POST\",\n \"path\": \"/api/me/selected-child\",\n \"description\": \"PARENT. Sets the sh_child cookie (httpOnly, sameSite=lax, 1 year) after checking ParentStudentLink. An unlinked studentId returns 404. The client then calls router.refresh().\",\n \"requestSchema\": {\n  \"studentId\": \"string\"\n },\n \"responseSchema\": {\n  \"data\": {\n   \"studentId\": \"string\"\n  }\n },\n \"requirementIds\": [\n  \"FR-3\",\n  \"FR-4\",\n  \"FR-6\",\n  \"NFR-5\"\n ]\n}\n{\n \"replaces\": \"This file replaces the stale SH-14 contracts.\",\n \"basePath\": \"/api. This is the existing SchoolHub convention, not /api/v1. Route files are src/app/api/**/route.ts. (FR-43, NFR-6)\",\n \"handlerPipeline\": \"withHandler \\u2192 requireUser / requireRole \\u2192 parseQuery / parseBody with schemas from src/lib/validators/{absence-notes,conferences,consent-forms}.ts \\u2192 access helper (assertCanViewStudent, assertHomeroomOrAdmin, assertConsentOwnerOrAdmin) \\u2192 one service call \\u2192 ok(data) / ok(data, {status:201}) / paginated(rows, meta). Everything comes from src/server/http.ts. Do not hand-roll envelopes. (FR-43, NFR-5, NFR-7)\",\n \"envelopes\": {\n  \"success\": \"{ data: T }\",\n  \"list\": \"{ data: T[], meta: { page, pageSize, total } } via paginated(). The query takes ?page (default 1), ?pageSize (default 20, clamped to 100 by parsePagination), ?sort=<field>:<asc|desc> and ?q. (NFR-10)\",\n  \"error\": \"{ error: { code, message, details? } }\",\n  \"nonJson\": \"GET /api/conference-slots/:id/ics returns text/calendar. GET /api/consent-forms/:id/tracking?format=csv returns text/csv with Content-Disposition: attachment.\"\n },\n \"errorCodes\": {\n  \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n  \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n  \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n  \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n  \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n  \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429,\n  \"INTERNAL\": 500\n },\n \"errorPolicy\": [\n  \"A studentId the caller cannot view, or a note/form/slot belonging to one, returns 404 NOT_FOUND so existence does not leak. (NFR-5)\",\n  \"A visible resource the caller may not act on returns 403 FORBIDDEN with details.reason. The reasons are NOT_HOMEROOM, NOT_FORM_OWNER, NOT_SLOT_TEACHER, NOT_BOOKER and AUDIENCE_NOT_ALLOWED. (NFR-5, FR-21, FR-36, FR-39)\",\n  \"Business-rule failures that the caller can fix by changing input return 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason. The reasons are OUTSIDE_BOOKING_WINDOW, PAST_DUE, SIGNATURE_MISMATCH and DATE_WINDOW. http.ts has no 422 code, so system-design's '422' maps to 400. (FR-18, FR-32, FR-37)\",\n  \"State races return 409 CONFLICT with details.reason. The reasons are SLOT_TAKEN ('That slot was just taken'), OVERLAP ('You already have a meeting with <teacher> at <time>'), ONE_PER_TEACHER, ALREADY_REVIEWED and SLOT_BOOKED. (NFR-1, FR-22, FR-29, FR-31)\",\n  \"The remind throttle returns 429 RATE_LIMITED with details.retryAfterMs and a Retry-After header. (FR-39)\"\n ],\n \"dates\": \"Date-only fields are 'yyyy-MM-dd' strings (@db.Date). Instants are ISO 8601 UTC. Every 'today' / window / due rule is evaluated in SchoolSettings.timezone via schoolToday(). (NFR-8)\",\n \"audit\": \"Absence review, consent respond/change and conference event create/update call audit({ request }) so getClientIp() captures the IP. (NFR-3, FR-23, FR-38)\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3dc3003b-f495-40f4-b937-7fc5d8e13052","uuid":"969efaff-ff90-4867-b827-f9dd62ab04d5","timestamp":"2026-11-10T04:32:56.353Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-16\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 58,\n  \"functionalCount\": 46,\n  \"nonFunctionalCount\": 12,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 91,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"warnings\": [\n    \"PRD-12 Announcement model is absent: FR-8 and FR-14 (announcement widgets) and FR-38 (announcement read rate) have no data source. Default is an empty state or an omitted metric.\",\n    \"PRD-14 has no calendar service or API, but the CalendarEvent model exists. FR-21 (upcoming events) should read the model directly.\",\n    \"FR-28 (LOW): 'one row per student per term, upserted' conflicts with the trend arrow and the snapsho