{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgtd8kYJaurkmshLRcUgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SWbDxMBFQse3PFmvjHvmoB","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-16\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T14:35:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 7,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"There are 7 HTTP endpoints, all new: GET /api/dashboard/{teacher,student,admin}, POST /api/dashboard/refresh, GET /api/insights/at-risk, GET /api/students/:id/insights and GET /api/reports/:reportKey. There are also 4 non-HTTP contracts: recomputeRiskSnapshots, the insights.student_high_risk notification type, the pure risk-rules, and missingWork.\",\n    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, paginated() meta and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. CSV goes through src/server/csv.ts toCsv and ignores pagination.\",\n    \"Error policy: an unknown reportKey returns 404. assertCanViewStudent returns 403 for a denied ADMIN/TEACHER (existing helper behaviour). Out-of-scope filters on /api/insights/at-risk return an empty 200 list, never 403.\",\n    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: the at-risk list meta adds computedAt; refresh returns studentsComputed and skipped; the admin payload omits openSafeguardingReports unless the caller is a safeguarding lead; the reportFilters block fixes per-report filters and row shapes.\",\n    \"Dependency gaps carried from system-design (not blockers): announcements (FR-8, FR-14, FR-38) return [] with announcementsAvailable=false, and FR-21 reads CalendarEvent directly.\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/{dashboards,reports}.ts should mirror the query shapes in api-contracts.json.\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json is still the stale SH-14 file. No architect sub-task owns it, so treat it as out of date.\",\n    \"The SH-15 api-contracts.json and handoff were moved to artifacts/architect/.prev-SH-15/.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":381,"cache_read_input_tokens":65034,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":381,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3dc3003b-f495-40f4-b937-7fc5d8e13052","uuid":"7b3f2c85-9f27-4dea-b49c-a9d4ac87df73","timestamp":"2026-11-10T04:34:08.617Z","request_id":"req_011Cgtd8kKu5mMZx4sKfMT7K","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01SWbDxMBFQse3PFmvjHvmoB":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-16\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-10T14:35:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 7,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"There are 7 HTTP endpoints, all new: GET /api/dashboard/{teacher,student,admin}, POST /api/dashboard/refresh, GET /api/insights/at-risk, GET /api/students/:id/insights and GET /api/reports/:reportKey. There are also 4 non-HTTP contracts: recomputeRiskSnapshots, the insights.student_high_risk notification type, the pure risk-rules, and missingWork.\",\n    \"The base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, paginated() meta and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. CSV goes through src/server/csv.ts toCsv and ignores pagination.\",\n    \"Error policy: an unknown reportKey returns 404. assertCanViewStudent returns 403 for a denied ADMIN/TEACHER (existing helper behaviour). Out-of-scope filters on /api/insights/at-risk return an empty 200 list, never 403.\",\n    \"Decisions made beyond system-design: the at-risk list meta adds computedAt; refresh returns studentsComputed and skipped; the admin payload omits openSafeguardingReports unless the caller is a safeguarding lead; the reportFilters block fixes per-report filters and row shapes.\",\n    \"Dependency gaps carried from system-design (not blockers): announcements (FR-8, FR-14, FR-38) return [] with announcementsAvailable=false, and FR-21 reads CalendarEvent directly.\",\n    \"src/lib/validators/{dashboards,reports}.ts should mirror the query shapes in api-contracts.json.\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json is still the stale SH-14 file. No architect sub-task owns it, so treat it as out of date.\",\n    \"The SH-15 api-contracts.json and handoff were moved to artifacts/architect/.prev-SH-15/.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n"}}}
